rs into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","💧 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms returns with water: +4 clean.","Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell.","🛡️ A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms catches you eyeing the bark plates — claw-scored, vine-laced. \"...Want to actually SEE one?\" They talk you through it — wide strips dried flat, laced overlapping like shingles, snug but not tight. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do.","💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +2 clean.","💧 A person, maybe 20s returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin is back — found A person, maybe 20s.","💧 A woman, maybe 60s returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 A woman, maybe 50s returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut returns with water: +2 clean.","\"Hey.\" A person, maybe 20s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 20s.)","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)","A person, maybe 20s traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Naran and Andre lingered over the fire together.","Naran and Anel lingered over the fire together.","You remember the Hatchet at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","You remember the Canvas Pants at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","📓 Journal: the person in their 60s, with a gap-toothed grin taught the person in their 60s, with tattooed arms Reading People.","📓 Journal: the woman in her 60s taught the person in their 20s Reading Tracks.","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🔥 Harold has been turning something over all evening. Finally: “Yuki. The past story — we all eat from the same pot here, we don’t get to lie about who’s at it.” It costs Harold to say it; you can see the price land.","A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","A woman, maybe 50s mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\"","\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek says. (Trust too low.)","A person, maybe 20s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)","A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)","📋 A woman, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","...and then it lands: A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience.","\"Sofia,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Sofia.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Sofia).","\"Naran,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Naran.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Naran).","\"Yuki,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Yuki.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Yuki).","You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":2,"gameDay":2,"pantryKcal":37490,"morningPantryKcal":37490,"freshKcal":37490,"freshDays":4.44430244802716,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek says. (Trust too low.)","\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 20s says. (Trust too low.)","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","A woman, maybe 50s folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\"","\"Ivy,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Ivy.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Ivy)."]},{"loopDay":3,"gameDay":4,"pantryKcal":27250,"morningPantryKcal":31820,"freshKcal":27250,"freshDays":4.892180838081538,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.\n— Nut trees —\nThe canopy here is a roof built by a thousand architects who never met. Light comes through in coins.","Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet.","You see smoke on the horizon. Thornfield — 12 people, 3 days in. fishing folk, by the look of it. They know 2 plants — 2 new to you. They've been here the whole time.","Unfamiliar unknown shoots — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","You also take some vine (crafting material).","Journal: Riparian ground. Water means life, and lunch.","📓 Journal: you UNDERSTAND Green Thumb, Literally. It resonates with: something unnamed, something unnamed.","A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 2× unknown shoots. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Naran forages greens.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","Someone by the fire nods at the counter. \"We pool food here. Keep what you need for the road — the rest feeds everyone, once it's food.\"","Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you.","You walk back into Haven. 3 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","A person, maybe 20s picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)","You break ground behind the hall — bed 3 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 4 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something.","You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut about Sofia. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do.","You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Naran about Ivy. It's picking up decorations as it travels.","You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut telling A woman, maybe 50s about Ivy. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do.","💧 Naran returns with water: +2 clean.","📨 Word came: Henry Zhang wants to join Haven. \"Word travels: Haven takes people in. I'm people.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge.","📓 Journal: Henry Zhang applied remotely.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +1035 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","Yuki is staring into the fire like it owes them answers.","Fireside lesson: A person, maybe 20s passes around a grey-green shrub with apple-sized green fruits and milky sap. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn.","★ IDENTIFIED: Sodom Apple. Grey-green shrub, apple-sized green fruits. DO NOT EAT. The sap burns. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","You were listening. Now you know Sodom Apple too.","A person, maybe 20s spends the afternoon with the vine with thick-skinned round fruit — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe.","★ IDENTIFIED: Muscadine Grapes. Muscadine. Thick-skinned wild grapes. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","💡 You see it again in your mind: a vine with thick-skinned round fruit. A person, maybe 20s's words land on the memory like a label. Muscadine Grapes. Of course.","Ivy traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Chloe and Saul lingered over the fire together.","Naran and Sofia lingered over the fire together.","🤢 Yuki's stomach knots — something in their meal was off.","🍽️ Saul carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"","📓 Journal: the person in their 20s taught Sofia Animal Behavior.","Fresh-cut stems on the northeast ground — someone else is working turf your crews use. (Thornfield's foragers, most likely. You walk the ground yourself: it's thinner than your crews alone could strip it.)","— DAY 4 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Sodom Apple — named and noted.","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","A woman, maybe 50s watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\"","A woman, maybe 50s waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"Got it,\" A woman, maybe 50s says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\"","\"Andre,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Andre.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Andre).","You are full enough.","The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."]},{"loopDay":4,"gameDay":4,"pantryKcal":27417,"morningPantryKcal":27417,"freshKcal":27417,"freshDays":4.922162276612166,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.","Movement — a gray fox, climbing a tree (foxes shouldn't do that).","👁 Clever. It'll stay just out of reach, toying with you. Run it down.","You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 20s about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","The path is washed out.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.\n— Nut trees —\nMast crunches underfoot — last season's nuts, sprouting or rotting. The trees don't waste anything.","Something moves out there — a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer.","Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","Journal: Riparian ground. Water means life, and lunch.","Journal updated: upright fuzzy red berry cones, compound leaves, velvety new branches grows here too — better than a shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs.","A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 4× unknown berries, 5× unknown berries. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The drumbeat with no drummer stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you.","You walk back into Haven. 5 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","Sofia picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)","Sofia will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority.","📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","...and then it lands: A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience.","\"Asantewaa,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Asantewaa.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Asantewaa).","A woman, maybe 60s leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer. Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer: Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Journal: Counter: Strike the taut drum — When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer."]},{"loopDay":5,"gameDay":5,"pantryKcal":24700,"morningPantryKcal":24700,"freshKcal":24700,"freshDays":4.851468149913281,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerE