 worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","While you were gone — 4 things you missed:","⚔️ Andre killed the something displaced a LOT of water with their party — 7 rounds, 59 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.","⚔️ Harold killed the humming in the grass with their party — 1 round, 11 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.","⚔️ Saul killed the thing with headlights for eyes with their party — 10 rounds, 70 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.","⚔️ Anel killed the dog-shaped silence at the treeline with their party — 3 rounds, 40 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.","You walk back into Haven. 14 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","Harold looks at the pantry, then at the Codex, then at you. \"We’re going to make it.\" Haven will survive — because someone learned the land, and wrote it down. One less thing to fear.","📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse.","Andre leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Hushpuppy. Wound the lead. Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Hushpuppy: Wound the lead. Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Wound the lead — Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free.","✨ Ability gained: Green Thumb, Literally (L1). Gather 50% more food from plants. Ask the Plants reveals what grows in the are