,"Something moves out there — The Paparazzo.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Paparazzo stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","⚔️ Yuki killed the Sweeps Week alone — 6 rounds, 21 taken. Word travels fast. Took Medfoam canister off the body. The village cheers.","You keep a day's food (900 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\"","📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","Recipe: Crossbow (Level 1). You have seen a crossbow. A bow on a stock, held at full draw by a catch.","Recipe: Sharpened stick (Level 1). You have seen the shape: a stick, one end shaved to a point.","Taken: Bark armor x1, Work Gloves x1, Crossbow x1, Good Boots x1, Sharpened stick x1, Chef's Knife x1.","You take bark armor, work gloves, crossbow, good boots, sharpened stick, chef's knife from Harold. Your hands know what they did. (+18 trauma)","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","Ivy leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Paparazzo. Break line of sight before the fourth shot. Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Paparazzo: Break line of sight before the fourth shot. Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Break line of sight before the fourth shot — Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies."]},{"loopDay":21,"gameDay":21,"pantryKcal":5150,"morningPantryKcal":5150,"freshKcal":5150,"freshDays":1.7648525519124054,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":3,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":9,"sayLines":["💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","You also take some vine (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Muscadine Grapes (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (1440 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","⬆️ Green Whisper deepened to L2! Plants lean toward you.","\"We didn't even explain that part! You figured it out yourself! That's the good stuff! The gamblers are thrilled!\"","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse.","Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","Recipe: Fire-hardened spear (Level 1). You have seen a fire-hardened spear. The tip is black, polished, hard.","Taken: Fire-hardened spear x1, Hand Saw x1, Good Boots x1, Knit Cap x1, Flannel Shirt x1, The Ledger x1.","You take fire-hardened spear, hand saw, good boots, knit cap, flannel shirt, the ledger from Sofia. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","Anel leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Sweeps Week. Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Sweeps Week: Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never show it your back — FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow.","You eat Muscadine Grapes and Staghorn Sumac (660 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":22,"gameDay":22,"pantryKcal":3100,"morningPantryKcal":3100,"freshKcal":3100,"freshDays":0.9905925334971322,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":4,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":9,"sayLines":["💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","Something moves out there — tick.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Spicebush, 10× Staghorn Sumac (780 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Big-Eyes stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (1560 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\"","📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."]},{"loopDay":23,"gameDay":23,"pantryKcal":2120,"morningPantryKcal":2120,"freshKcal":2120,"freshDays":0.6073520215221823,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":5,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":8,"sayLines":["💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Big-Eyes stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (1560 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\"","Elif steps closer. \"We need to talk. About who's actually running things here.\"","📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Elif — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Ivy — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","Taken: Canvas Pants x1, Stone knife x1, Bark armor x1, Snare wire x1.","You take canvas pants, stone knife, bark armor, snare wire from Anel. Your hands know what they did. (+8 trauma)","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."]},{"loopDay":24,"gameDay":24,"pantryKcal":2399,"morningPantryKcal":2219,"freshKcal":2399,"freshDays":0.636843934235273,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":6,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":7,"sayLines":["💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","Something moves out there — The Moderator.","Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Muscadine Grapes (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","(The snare wire becomes the snare — improvised, 2 uses.)","You set a Snare here. Check it tomorrow.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (1920 kcal) and unload 180 kcal into Haven's pantry.","You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)","📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\"","📋 Elif — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Chloe — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Ivy — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","Elif watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\"","You eat Muscadine Grapes and Staghorn Sumac (600 kcal)."]}],"sayLines":[{"seq":0,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Wiring & Circuits (Level 2). 12V systems: batteries, charge controllers, and what you can actually run off a car battery."},{"seq":1,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Old World Caches (Level 1). You know where people hid things: under floorboards, in hollow trees, behind loose bricks."},{"seq":2,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Steady Hands (Level 1). Fine work under pressure. Dressing game, stitching wounds, tying snares — no shake."},{"seq":3,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your old life taught you things. 3 skills from your past — check your Journal."},{"seq":4,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: knap a Stone knife (stone + vine) — the oldest tool there is. Find the stone."},{"seq":5,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: weave cloth (3 plant fiber — strip it from cleared brush), and build a Water Filter (cloth + charcoal from fire ashes). Dirty water doesn't have to stay dirty."},{"seq":6,"day":1,"line":"You wake up with dirt in your mouth and blood on your hands that isn't yours. The sky is the wrong color — not sunset-wrong, wound-wrong. DeAndre Aquino. Appliance repair tech. From Columbus, Ohio. That was yesterday. This is now. You have: Search locket, Seed packet, Dead Phone, Carpenter's square, Reading Glasses. That's everything you own in this world. Haven. Twelve people. The fire is lit. La"},{"seq":7,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin: \"Nothing grows here but dirt and tents. Past the treeline — that's where the green is. That's where the food is.\""},{"seq":8,"day":1,"line":"📓 Journal: Food won't come to Haven. Walk past the treeline — learn what grows out there, bring it back, and get it named at camp."},{"seq":9,"day":1,"line":"You tell the others you're heading out. Someone nods. \"Come back before dark.\""},{"seq":10,"day":1,"line":"— DAY 1 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":11,"day":1,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 24L left."},{"seq":12,"day":1,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":13,"day":1,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"seq":14,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":15,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":16,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":17,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":18,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin sets out to find A person, maybe 20s. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":19,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":20,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":21,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":22,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":23,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":24,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm walks away from Haven. They don't look back."},{"seq":25,"day":1,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":26,"day":1,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":27,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":28,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":29,"day":1,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":30,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":31,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":32,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":33,"day":1,"line":"📖 the man in his 60s is walking the woman in her 30s, with weathered hands through a shrubby tree with smooth peeling bark and round yellow-green fragrant fruit — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour."},{"seq":34,"day":1,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":35,"day":1,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":36,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":37,"day":1,"line":"You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."},{"seq":38,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":39,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":40,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":41,"day":1,"line":"Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell."},{"seq":42,"day":1,"line":"🛡️ A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms catches you eyeing the bark plates — claw-scored, vine-laced. \"...Want to actually SEE one?\" They talk you through it — wide strips dried flat, laced overlapping like shingles, snug but not tight. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."},{"seq":43,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":44,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 20s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":45,"day":1,"line":"🚶 A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin is back — found A person, maybe 20s."},{"seq":46,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 60s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":47,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":48,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 50s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":49,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":50,"day":1,"line":"\"Hey.\" A person, maybe 20s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 20s.)"},{"seq":51,"day":1,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":52,"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":53,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":54,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 20s traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":55,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":56,"day":1,"line":"Naran and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":57,"day":1,"line":"Naran and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":58,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Hatchet at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":59,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Canvas Pants at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":60,"day":1,"line":"📓 Journal: the person in their 60s, with a gap-toothed grin taught the person in their 60s, with tattooed arms Reading People."},{"seq":61,"day":1,"line":"📓 Journal: the woman in her 60s taught the person in their 20s Reading Tracks."},{"seq":62,"day":2,"line":"— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":63,"day":2,"line":"🔥 Harold has been turning something over all evening. Finally: “Yuki. The past story — we all eat from the same pot here, we don’t get to lie about who’s at it.” It costs Harold to say it; you can see the price land."},{"seq":64,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":65,"day":2,"line":"You step into the Haven hall."},{"seq":66,"day":2,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":67,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":68,"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":69,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 20s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":70,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":71,"day":2,"line":"📋 A woman, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":72,"day":2,"line":"(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"},{"seq":73,"day":2,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":74,"day":2,"line":"...and then it lands: A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."},{"seq":75,"day":2,"line":"\"Sofia,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Sofia.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":76,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Sofia)."},{"seq":77,"day":2,"line":"\"Naran,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Naran.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":78,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Naran)."},{"seq":79,"day":2,"line":"\"Yuki,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Yuki.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":80,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Yuki)."},{"seq":81,"day":2,"line":"You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."},{"seq":82,"day":2,"line":"It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."},{"seq":83,"day":2,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":84,"day":2,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":85,"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":86,"day":2,"line":"Equipped Hatchet (melee)."},{"seq":87,"day":2,"line":"Equipped Canvas Pants (legs)."},{"seq":88,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Naran sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Naran.)"},{"seq":89,"day":2,"line":"🌿 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":90,"day":2,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (13 logs now.)"},{"seq":91,"day":2,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 60s returns with 6L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":92,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":93,"day":2,"line":"💬 A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin has Naran's ear — quiet talk, the kind that doesn't need an audience."},{"seq":94,"day":2,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":95,"day":2,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":96,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":97,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":98,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Sofia sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Sofia.)"},{"seq":99,"day":2,"line":"🪨 A person, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":100,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling A woman, maybe 60s about A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin. The details have s