he light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":287,"day":4,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":288,"day":4,"line":"Movement — a gray fox, climbing a tree (foxes shouldn't do that)."},{"seq":289,"day":4,"line":"👁 Clever. It'll stay just out of reach, toying with you. Run it down."},{"seq":290,"day":4,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 20s about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":291,"day":4,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":292,"day":4,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":293,"day":4,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove.\n— Nut trees —\nMast crunches underfoot — last season's nuts, sprouting or rotting. The trees don't waste anything."},{"seq":294,"day":4,"line":"Something moves out there — a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer."},{"seq":295,"day":4,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":296,"day":4,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":297,"day":4,"line":"Journal: Riparian ground. Water means life, and lunch."},{"seq":298,"day":4,"line":"Journal updated: upright fuzzy red berry cones, compound leaves, velvety new branches grows here too — better than a shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs."},{"seq":299,"day":4,"line":"A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 4× unknown berries, 5× unknown berries. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":300,"day":4,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":301,"day":4,"line":"The drumbeat with no drummer stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":302,"day":4,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":303,"day":4,"line":"Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you."},{"seq":304,"day":4,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 5 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":305,"day":4,"line":"Sofia picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":306,"day":4,"line":"Sofia will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":307,"day":4,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":308,"day":4,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":309,"day":4,"line":"...and then it lands: A person, maybe 60s, with a gap-toothed grin speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."},{"seq":310,"day":4,"line":"\"Asantewaa,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Asantewaa.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":311,"day":4,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Asantewaa)."},{"seq":312,"day":4,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer. Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer.\""},{"seq":313,"day":4,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer: Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":314,"day":4,"line":"📓 Journal: Counter: Strike the taut drum — When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer."},{"seq":315,"day":4,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":316,"day":4,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (27 logs now.)"},{"seq":317,"day":4,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":318,"day":4,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek about themself. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":319,"day":4,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Naran about Andre. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":320,"day":4,"line":"DeAndre showed Ivy the Muscadine Grapes — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":321,"day":4,"line":"💧 Andre returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":322,"day":4,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":323,"day":4,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 50s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":324,"day":4,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":325,"day":4,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":326,"day":4,"line":"🍲 Ivy eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."},{"seq":327,"day":4,"line":"🍲 Naran eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."},{"seq":328,"day":4,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":329,"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1067 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":330,"day":4,"line":"Asantewaa has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. A person, maybe 20s drew Muscadine Grapes in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":331,"day":4,"line":"Ivy spends the afternoon with the upright fuzzy red berry cones, compound leaves, velvety new branches — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":332,"day":4,"line":"From the lumped bag: Staghorn Sumac — named, and out."},{"seq":333,"day":4,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Staghorn Sumac. Fuzzy red berry cones pointing up like torches. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":334,"day":4,"line":"💡 Staghorn Sumac. The upright fuzzy red berry cones, compound leaves, velvety new branches you've been looking at for days finally has a name, and now you'll never unsee it."},{"seq":335,"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":336,"day":4,"line":"Naran came back with 501 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 251 kcal in, 250 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":337,"day":4,"line":"Harold and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":338,"day":4,"line":"Harold and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":339,"day":4,"line":"🤢 Asantewaa's stomach knots — something in their meal was off."},{"seq":340,"day":4,"line":"Chloe and Ivy lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":341,"day":4,"line":"🍽️ Naran watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":342,"day":4,"line":"📓 Journal: Andre taught Ivy Old World Caches."},{"seq":343,"day":4,"line":"📓 Journal: the person in their 60s, with a scarred cheek taught the woman in her 30s, with a buzz cut Gossip Network."},{"seq":344,"day":4,"line":"🛟 Andre stands up by the fire. \"We can't just watch the fever in the tents happen. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":345,"day":4,"line":"\"Triage tents and broth for the sick, or half rations till it passes, or the healthy hunt hard to keep everyone fed. Pick — everything costs.\""},{"seq":346,"day":4,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Andre adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":347,"day":4,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":348,"day":4,"line":"📓 Journal: Andre proposed relief (sickness), day 4."},{"seq":349,"day":5,"line":"— DAY 5 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":350,"day":5,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Staghorn Sumac — named and noted."},{"seq":351,"day":5,"line":"👀 \"teacher, huh?\" Yuki nods — then, an hour later, drops a shop-talk detail no teacher would ever get right. They catch themselves. Too late."},{"seq":352,"day":5,"line":"📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (Yuki)."},{"seq":353,"day":5,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":354,"day":5,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+8 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":355,"day":5,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":356,"day":5,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":357,"day":5,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":358,"day":5,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":359,"day":5,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":360,"day":5,"line":"🌿 Sofia checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":361,"day":5,"line":"🪨 Sofia pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 stone now.)"},{"seq":362,"day":5,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":363,"day":5,"line":"Andre heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":364,"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek sets out to find Andre. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":365,"day":5,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 20s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":366,"day":5,"line":"💧 Asantewaa returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":367,"day":5,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 60s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":368,"day":5,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":369,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":370,"day":5,"line":"📖 Sofia has their finds spread out on a cloth, re-tying the bundle tighter."},{"seq":371,"day":5,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":372,"day":5,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":373,"day":5,"line":"🌙 Something went missing from the pantry in the night. Yuki was seen near the stores, but no one can prove anything."},{"seq":374,"day":5,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":375,"day":5,"line":"Andre hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":376,"day":5,"line":"The stash count is off. 2 stones missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":377,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling Yuki about themself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":378,"day":5,"line":"Ivy showed A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek the Staghorn Sumac — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":379,"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 20s wanders off. \"I want to see what's out there.\""},{"seq":380,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s sets out for the drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\""},{"seq":381,"day":5,"line":"Ivy sets out to hunt the drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer. \"It was there. Going back for it.\""},{"seq":382,"day":5,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":383,"day":5,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":384,"day":5,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":385,"day":5,"line":"Andre hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":386,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Naran about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":387,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling Asantewaa about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":388,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut showed Yuki the Staghorn Sumac — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":389,"day":5,"line":"💧 Andre returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":390,"day":5,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":391,"day":5,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":392,"day":5,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Ivy has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"A drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer — I put it down today.\" \"It rears up, belly swelling drum-taut, and beats it with both paws — BOOM. The air itself flinches.\" \"It waddles left, then is suddenly right — a feint, testing whether your eyes or your ears are in charge.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come"},{"seq":393,"day":5,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":394,"day":5,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":395,"day":5,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":396,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut telling A woman, maybe 50s about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":397,"day":5,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":398,"day":5,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":399,"day":5,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":400,"day":5,"line":"Movement — a chipmunk, cheeks already full."},{"seq":401,"day":5,"line":"👁 Spook it and it's down a hole you never saw. Block the burrow mouth, or hunt it in the open where the hole can't help."},{"seq":402,"day":5,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":403,"day":5,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":404,"day":5,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":405,"day":5,"line":"⚔️ Ivy killed the drumbeat with no drummer with their party — 2 rounds, 15 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":406,"day":5,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 6 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":407,"day":5,"line":"Ivy picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":408,"day":5,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":409,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":410,"day":5,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":411,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":412,"day":5,"line":"\"Anel,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Anel.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":413,"day":5,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Anel)."},{"seq":414,"day":5,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":415,"day":5,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (32 logs now.)"},{"seq":416,"day":5,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":417,"day":5,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (38 logs now.)"},{"seq":418,"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fish crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":419,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Ivy about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":420,"day":5,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Andre about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":421,"day":5,"line":"Ivy showed A woman, maybe 50s the Staghorn Sumac — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":422,"day":5,"line":"🚶 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek is back — found Andre."},{"seq":423,"day":5,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":424,"day":5,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":425,"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":426,"day":5,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Yuki fixing something."},{"seq":427,"day":5,"line":"Ivy drew Staghorn Sumac in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":428,"day":5,"line":"Sofia spends the afternoon with the shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":429,"day":5,"line":"From the lumped bag: Spicebush — named, and out."},{"seq":430,"day":5,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Spicebush. Small oval leaves, red berry clusters on bare twigs. Crushed leaves smell spicy. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":431,"day":5,"line":"💡 Spicebush. The shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs you've been looking at for days finally has a name, and now you'll never unsee it."},{"seq":432,"day":5,"line":"Andre came back with 345 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 173 kcal in, 172 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":433,"day":5,"line":"🤢 Anel's stomach knots — something in their meal was off."},{"seq":434,"day":5,"line":"Sofia and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":435,"day":5,"line":"Chloe and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":436,"day":5,"line":"🍽️ Sofia sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\""},{"seq":437,"day":5,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":438,"day":5,"line":"You've started noticing: A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek and Yuki never speak. It's not new. (Something old lives in Haven.)"},{"seq":439,"day":6,"line":"— DAY 6 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":440,"day":6,"line":"Overnight, unknown berries went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":441,"day":6,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":442,"day":6,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Spicebush — named and noted."},{"seq":443,"day":6,"line":"👀 Yuki let a place-name slip — somewhere that isn't Denver — then covered it with \"Denver\" so fast the cover was louder than the slip."},{"seq":444,"day":6,"line":"📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (Yuki)."},{"seq":445,"day":6,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":446,"day":6,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":447,"day":6,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":448,"day":6,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":449,"day":6,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":450,"day":6,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":451,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":452,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s steps closer. \"We need to talk. About who's actually running things here.\""},{"seq":453,"day":6,"line":"🌿 Sofia checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":454,"day":6,"line":"🪨 Sofia pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":455,"day":6,"line":"🪵 A woman, maybe 50s hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (40 logs now.)"},{"seq":456,"day":6,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":457,"day":6,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut telling Anel about A person, maybe 20s. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":458,"day":6,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":459,"day":6,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Andre is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":460,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s sets out to find Ivy. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":461,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":462,"day":6,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":463,"day":6,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":464,"day":6,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":465,"day":6,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":466,"day":6,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":467,"day":6,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 50s eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":468,"day":6,"line":"🪨 A woman, maybe 50s pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":469,"day":6,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (46 logs now.)"},{"seq":470,"day":6,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Andre about A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":471,"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek showed A woman, maybe 50s the Spicebush — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":472,"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":473,"day":6,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":474,"day":6,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":475,"day":6,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":476,"day":6,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":477,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":478,"day":6,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":479,"day":6,"line":"🪨 A woman, maybe 50s pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":480,"day":6,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 stone now.)"},{"seq":481,"day":6,"line":"🧭 A person, maybe 20s is back from the north. \"It's... different out there. I'll tell you about it.\" (Ask them what they saw.)"},{"seq":482,"day":6,"line":"🥩 Anel is back with strange meat: unknown flesh in the pantry. \"Test it cautiously before anyone eats.\""},{"seq":483,"day":6,"line":"🥩 Anel is back empty-handed. \"Nothing worth hauling out there.\""},{"seq":484,"day":6,"line":"Sofia heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":485,"day":6,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":486,"day":6,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":487,"day":6,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":488,"day":6,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":489,"day":6,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":490,"day":6,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 3× Muscadine Grapes (270 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":491,"day":6,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":492,"day":6,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":493,"day":6,"line":"You keep a day's food (270 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":494,"day":6,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 7 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":495,"day":6,"line":"You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":496,"day":6,"line":"Ivy will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":497,"day":6,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":498,"day":6,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" A woman, maybe 50s doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":499,"day":6,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":500,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":501,"day":6,"line":"You eat Muscadine Grapes (90 kcal)."},{"seq":502,"day":6,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":503,"day":6,"line":"🪵 A woman, maybe 50s hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (51 logs now.)"},{"seq":504,"day":6,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (59 logs now.)"},{"seq":505,"day":6,"line":"🪨 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (3 stone now.)"},{"seq":506,"day":6,"line":"👥 Out here, of all places — Sofia and Naran run into each other. They stop and talk a while."},{"seq":507,"day":6,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":508,"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":509,"day":6,"line":"Anel is showing everyone broad leaves standing tall above still water on stiff stalks by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The journal grows — the human way."},{"seq":510,"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 20s sets aside time with the drumbeat with no drummer flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" A person, maybe 20s tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Journal notes it."},{"seq":511,"day":6,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":512,"day":6,"line":"🍽️ Chloe watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":513,"day":6,"line":"🤒 Yuki is sitting up again. Whatever the fever was, it let go."},{"seq":514,"day":6,"line":"🤒 Asantewaa is sitting up again. Whatever the fever was, it let go."},{"seq":515,"day":6,"line":"🤒 Sofia is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":516,"day":6,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":517,"day":7,"line":"— DAY 7 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":518,"day":7,"line":"Overnight, unknown shoots went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":519,"day":7,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":520,"day":7,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":521,"day":7,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 36 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":522,"day":7,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":523,"day":7,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":524,"day":7,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":525,"day":7,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":526,"day":7,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":527,"day":7,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" A woman, maybe 50s doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":528,"day":7,"line":"🌱 Ivy waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":529,"day":7,"line":"🌿 Ivy checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":530,"day":7,"line":"🪵 Ivy hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (63 logs now.)"},{"seq":531,"day":7,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 50s returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":532,"day":7,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":533,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Ivy about A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":534,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling A woman, maybe 50s about herself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":535,"day":7,"line":"Yuki showed Asantewaa the Spicebush — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":536,"day":7,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":537,"day":7,"line":"Asantewaa sets out for the drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\""},{"seq":538,"day":7,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":539,"day":7,"line":"Ivy heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":540,"day":7,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":541,"day":7,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":542,"day":7,"line":"Sofia is tending the fire, coaxing it steady."},{"seq":543,"day":7,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":544,"day":7,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":545,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":546,"day":7,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":547,"day":7,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":548,"day":7,"line":"🪨 A woman, maybe 50s pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":549,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ivy telling Yuki about A woman, maybe 50s. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":550,"day":7,"line":"🚶 A woman, maybe 50s is back — found Ivy."},{"seq":551,"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 20s is sweeping the corners out, muttering at the dust."},{"seq":552,"day":7,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":553,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":554,"day":7,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 30L left."},{"seq":555,"day":7,"line":"The stash count is off. 2 stones missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":556,"day":7,"line":"🪵 A woman, maybe 50s hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (67 logs now.)"},{"seq":557,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Sofia about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":558,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Naran about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":559,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut telling Anel about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":560,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling Anel about Sofia. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":561,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Sofia about herself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":562,"day":7,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":563,"day":7,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":564,"day":7,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":565,"day":7,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":566,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":567,"day":7,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":568,"day":7,"line":"Something moves out there — something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log."},{"seq":569,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Ivy about Sofia. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":570,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek telling Anel about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":571,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 20s telling Asantewaa about A woman, maybe 50s. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":572,"day":7,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":573,"day":7,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":574,"day":7,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":575,"day":7,"line":"It followed you. Something displaced a LOT of water is here."},{"seq":576,"day":7,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 3× Spicebush, 5× Staghorn Sumac (390 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":577,"day":7,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":578,"day":7,"line":"It stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. Something displaced a LOT of water is still out there."},{"seq":579,"day":7,"line":"You keep a day's food (390 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":580,"day":7,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 7 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":581,"day":7,"line":"You sow Staghorn Sumac: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":582,"day":7,"line":"You sow Staghorn Sumac: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":583,"day":7,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":584,"day":7,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":585,"day":7,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":586,"day":7,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" A woman, maybe 50s doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":587,"day":7,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":588,"day":7,"line":"You eat Staghorn Sumac and Spicebush (150 kcal)."},{"seq":589,"day":7,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":590,"day":7,"line":"🚶 Andre: \"I want to see what's out there too. Lead on.\""},{"seq":591,"day":7,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 50s eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":592,"day":7,"line":"🪨 A woman, maybe 50s pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (3 stone now.)"},{"seq":593,"day":7,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":594,"day":7,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (73 logs now.)"},{"seq":595,"day":7,"line":"A woman, maybe 50s stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fetch water crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":596,"day":7,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a buzz cut returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":597,"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 20s is sweeping the corners out, muttering at the dust."},{"seq":598,"day":7,"line":"🐗 RAID — 4 raiders (something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log, the humming in the grass, the thing with headlights for eyes, standing too still, a dog-shaped silence at the treeline) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":599,"day":7,"line":"🚨 something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log, the humming in the grass, the thing with headlights for eyes, standing too still, a dog-shaped silence at the treeline is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one)."},{"seq":600,"day":7,"line":"📓 Journal: something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log, the humming in the grass, the thing with headlights for eyes, standing too still, a dog-shaped silence at the treeline at the door, day 7."},{"seq":601,"day":7,"line":"🛡️ Andre, the person in their 60s, with a scarred cheek, the person in their 20s and Anel met them at the door — 4 put down. Andre, the person in their 60s, with a scarred cheek, the person in their 20s, Anel are hurt."},{"seq":602,"day":7,"line":"The defenders met them at the treeline — nothing reached your bedroll."},{"seq":603,"day":7,"line":"Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."},{"seq":604,"day":7,"line":"📓 Journal: a cart-driver with flour on their sleeves arrived (trader)."},{"seq":605,"day":7,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" The Journal keeps it."},{"seq":606,"day":7,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)"},{"seq":607,"day":7,"line":"🌟 THE SKY SPLITS OPEN."},{"seq":608,"day":7,"line":"Not with light. With... interface. Windows scrolling across the clouds, too fast to read."},{"seq":609,"day":7,"line":"A voice behind your eyes — bright, delighted, utterly wrong. (The System has arrived.)"},{"seq":610,"day":7,"line":"🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":611,"day":7,"line":"📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\""},{"seq":612,"day":7,"line":"📖 Your journal shimmers — handwriting dissolving into interface. It talks now. It remembers everything."},{"seq":613,"day":7,"line":"🕐 Your hand-drawn time-circle glitches — and something colder, more precise, takes its place. (We kept the smudges. They're charming.)"},{"seq":614,"day":7,"line":"🦎 \"Those were CALIBRATION fauna! First drafts! The audience has NOTES! So we made BETTER ones!\" (Something new is crying in the treeline.)"},{"seq":615,"day":7,"line":"🧑‍🤝‍🧑 The village gathers. Everyone's journal is changing. Everyone hears the voice. Andre grabs your arm. \"Tell me you hear that too.\""},{"seq":616,"day":7,"line":"🎉 \"OH! One more thing! We noticed some of you have been... traveling together! In little groups! How ORGANIC! How INEFFICIENT!\""},{"seq":617,"day":7,"line":"\"So we made it OFFICIAL! The PARTY SYSTEM! Up to THREE companions! Formal! Tracked! With a UI! The audience can see your party composition now! Very important for the betting markets!\""},{"seq":618,"day":7,"line":"\"We've auto-enrolled your current traveling companions: Andre! You're welcome! (They can leave anytime. Probably.)\""},{"seq":619,"day":7,"line":"\"Choose wisely! Or don't! Betrayal arcs test VERY well with our demographics!\""},{"seq":620,"day":7,"line":"A new option appears when you look at people: invite them to your party."},{"seq":621,"day":7,"line":"💡 Learned: PARTY SYSTEM. You can invite people to travel and fight beside you. Ask — in conversation, like a person."},{"seq":622,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Ground Elder. Creeping patches of divided leaves in shady spots. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":623,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":624,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Andre taught everyone about Ground Elder. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":625,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Lotus Root. Lotus. Big round leaves standing up out of still water. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":626,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":627,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Anel taught everyone about Lotus Root. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":628,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Piquiarana. Tasty fruit, dangerous pit. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":629,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":630,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Anel taught everyone about Piquiarana. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":631,"day":7,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 35. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 3.\""},{"seq":632,"day":7,"line":"🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":633,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Knotweed Shoot. Knotweed. Hollow red-speckled shoots by the water. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":634,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":635,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Naran taught everyone about Knotweed Shoot. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":636,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Jamun. The monsoon berry — sweet-tart, purple to the elbow. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":637,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":638,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Andre taught everyone about Jamun. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":639,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Quest protocol integrated. Objectives will appear."},{"seq":640,"day":7,"line":"◈ THE MENTOR — Andre watches DeAndre work, then reaches over. \"No. Like this.\" An hour later something has unlocked that no manual could teach. (Ability slots: 3)"},{"seq":641,"day":7,"line":"◈ NEURAL CREEP — the overlay isn't on the world anymore. It's under it. Behind your eyes, faintly, when you blink."},{"seq":642,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Peepal Fig. Peepal. The tree the Buddha sat under — its figs feed birds, and you in a pinch. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":643,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":644,"day":7,"line":"Ivy was watching. Now they know Peepal Fig too."},{"seq":645,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Yuki taught everyone about Peepal Fig. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":646,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Chickpea. (chana). Protein in a pod. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":647,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":648,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Sofia taught everyone about Chickpea. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":649,"day":7,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":650,"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":651,"day":7,"line":"Yuki paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":652,"day":7,"line":"Anel is showing everyone Piquiarana by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":653,"day":7,"line":"Andre came back with 438 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 219 kcal in, 219 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":654,"day":7,"line":"Anel and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":655,"day":7,"line":"Ivy and Elif lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":656,"day":7,"line":"🍽️ Ivy carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":657,"day":7,"line":"📓 Codex: Saul taught Sofia Reading Tracks."},{"seq":658,"day":7,"line":"🛟 Elif stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":659,"day":7,"line":"\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\""},{"seq":660,"day":7,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Elif adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":661,"day":7,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":662,"day":7,"line":"The northeast ground is thinning faster than your crews alone could strip it. Thornfield isn't slowing down — their foragers are on your turf most days now. Their speaker would probably want words. (Talk about the shared ground at their fire.)"},{"seq":663,"day":7,"line":"You've started noticing: Asantewaa and Elif never speak. It's not new. (Something old lives in Haven.)"},{"seq":664,"day":7,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":665,"day":8,"line":"— DAY 8 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":666,"day":8,"line":"The fire burns low. 7 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Ground Elder — named and noted."},{"seq":667,"day":8,"line":"👀 Anel says to belong somewhere is the dream. Funny how the dream never comes up when they're the one choosing what to do with an afternoon."},{"seq":668,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Anel — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":669,"day":8,"line":"👀 Someone asks Yuki a shop-talk question about teacher work. The pause before the answer is long enough to hear."},{"seq":670,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Yuki — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":671,"day":8,"line":"💬 Yuki says: \"Do you ever feel it? Like the air leans in when something happens.\""},{"seq":672,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: The System offered an aid quest (learn), day 8."},{"seq":673,"day":8,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":674,"day":8,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 62 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":675,"day":8,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":676,"day":8,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":677,"day":8,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":678,"day":8,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":679,"day":8,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":680,"day":8,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":681,"day":8,"line":"🌱 Ivy waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":682,"day":8,"line":"🌿 Ivy checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":683,"day":8,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":684,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":685,"day":8,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":686,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (75 logs now.)"},{"seq":687,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (6 stone now.)"},{"seq":688,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Anel telling Yuki about Elif. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":689,"day":8,"line":"Andre showed Naran the Spicebush — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":690,"day":8,"line":"DeAndre showed Sofia the Knotweed Shoot — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":691,"day":8,"line":"Elif heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":692,"day":8,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":693,"day":8,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":694,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":695,"day":8,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":696,"day":8,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":697,"day":8,"line":"Elif plants themself in front of you. \"This isn't working. You know it, I know it. Say it out loud.\""},{"seq":698,"day":8,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":699,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (81 logs now.)"},{"seq":700,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (86 logs now.)"},{"seq":701,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (6 stone now.)"},{"seq":702,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Anel about Asantewaa. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":703,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Saul about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":704,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Sofia about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":705,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Ivy about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":706,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Saul about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":707,"day":8,"line":"Asantewaa showed Harold the Knotweed Shoot — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":708,"day":8,"line":"DeAndre showed Harold the Peepal Fig — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":709,"day":8,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (30 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":710,"day":8,"line":"🥩 Asantewaa is back empty-handed. \"Nothing worth hauling out there.\""},{"seq":711,"day":8,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":712,"day":8,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":713,"day":8,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE SIEGE. They came in the night for the pantry — and the village met them at the door with blades and fire and drove them back into the dark. Wealth has a scent. So does defiance."},{"seq":714,"day":8,"line":"SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\""},{"seq":715,"day":8,"line":"🛟 Elif looks up from the fire. \"And now a raid, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":716,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":717,"day":8,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":718,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (92 logs now.)"},{"seq":719,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (7 stone now.)"},{"seq":720,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (98 logs now.)"},{"seq":721,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Asantewaa about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":722,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Harold about Elif. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":723,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Asantewaa about Elif. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":724,"day":8,"line":"Chloe showed Anel the Jamun — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":725,"day":8,"line":"DeAndre showed Anel the Chickpea — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":726,"day":8,"line":"Naran showed Harold the Chickpea — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":727,"day":8,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (11 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":728,"day":8,"line":"👥 Asantewaa heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":729,"day":8,"line":"💧 Elif returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":730,"day":8,"line":"Naran is down by the firepit, nudging coals back into the middle."},{"seq":731,"day":8,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":732,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Andre has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Anaconda Empress — I put it down today.\" \"The water bulges — a ripple with intent.\" \"It loosens, reluctantly, and pours itself back into the water. It will remember this pool.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Elif says \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Asantewaa says \"Did it look at you? Be"},{"seq":733,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Harold has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Hummice — I put it down today.\" \"A low hum rises from the grass. It harmonizes with itself. Your teeth ache.\" \"Teeth in the grass, everywhere at once — a tide of small bites.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Yuki says quietly \"Say that again — slower.\" Anel asks \"The fire feels smaller now."},{"seq":734,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Saul has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Highbeam Deer — I put it down today.\" \"Its legs lock. White light wells behind its eyes.\" \"It drops its head — the antlers come around in a short, vicious arc.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Sofia mutters \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Asantewaa says \"So it bleeds.\" Someone at the edge of t"},{"seq":735,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Anel has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Hushpuppy — I put it down today.\" \"No telegraph you can hear. Watch the birds — when they go quiet, the pack is already moving.\" \"The pack circles — nips from the edge, never committing.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Andre says \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Elif says quietly \"And you're s"},{"seq":736,"day":8,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":737,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":738,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":739,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Sofia about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":740,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Saul about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":741,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Chloe telling Anel about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":742,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Chloe telling Elif about herself. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":743,"day":8,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":744,"day":8,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":745,"day":8,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Stay close, yeah?\""},{"seq":746,"day":8,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":747,"day":8,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":748,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":749,"day":8,"line":"While you were gone — 4 things you missed:"},{"seq":750,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Andre killed the something displaced a LOT of water with their party — 7 rounds, 59 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":751,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Harold killed the humming in the grass with their party — 1 round, 11 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":752,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Saul killed the thing with headlights for eyes with their party — 10 rounds, 70 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":753,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Anel killed the dog-shaped silence at the treeline with their party — 3 rounds, 40 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":754,"day":8,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 14 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":755,"day":8,"line":"Harold looks at the pantry, then at the Codex, then at you. \"We’re going to make it.\" Haven will survive — because someone learned the land, and wrote it down. One less thing to fear."},{"seq":756,"day":8,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":757,"day":8,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":758,"day":8,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":759,"day":8,"line":"Andre leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Hushpuppy. Wound the lead. Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free.\""},{"seq":760,"day":8,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Hushpuppy: Wound the lead. Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":761,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Wound the lead — Wound the lead and the pack breaks. Hit the FIRST wolf — the one that came in first — and the coordination dies. They fear fire, but breaking the lead is free."},{"seq":762,"day":8,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Green Thumb, Literally (L1). Gather 50% more food from plants. Ask the Plants reveals what grows in the area, once a day. Cultivate growing Haven beds: 200 kcal, once per bed each day. Higher levels accelerate growth further."},{"seq":763,"day":8,"line":"\"The plants lean toward you. They're gossiping. You're learning to listen.\""},{"seq":764,"day":8,"line":"\"We've been watching you figure things out all week! This one's on us — a head start! But the REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\""},{"seq":765,"day":8,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":766,"day":8,"line":"The stash count is off. 2 stones missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":767,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (6 stone now.)"},{"seq":768,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (7 stone now.)"},{"seq":769,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 7 wood. The pile grows. (105 logs now.)"},{"seq":770,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Harold hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (109 logs now.)"},{"seq":771,"day":8,"line":"◈ THE SPARK — something clicks. A trick DeAndre learned long ago suddenly has edges it never had. SYSTEM: \"ANOMALY: organic unit demonstrates pattern recognition. Slot capacity increased. We are taking notes.\" (Ability slots: 3)"},{"seq":772,"day":8,"line":"◈ ARC II — THE SHOW. The sky tore open a week ago and the village is still here. Still eating. The audience has noticed. Strangers will come — not because the plot says so, but because surviving is worth watching."},{"seq":773,"day":8,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"RATINGS DIP. The audience wants STAKES — pointed ones. A PALISADE. Stockpile 14,000 kcal, 350 wood and 60 stone. Walls make such good television. You will thank us when the teeth come.\""},{"seq":774,"day":8,"line":"A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":775,"day":8,"line":"Naran came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":776,"day":8,"line":"📢 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"Catch something! Anything! We want to see how you do it!\" (Hunt an animal today for a reward.)"},{"seq":777,"day":8,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":778,"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":779,"day":8,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Anel fixing something."},{"seq":780,"day":8,"line":"Yuki has been turning the Peepal Fig over — asking after it at fires, handling it on work days — and now knows it deep enough to teach. (Their trade grows: ask them what they know.)"},{"seq":781,"day":8,"line":"Chloe has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Yuki drew Peepal Fig in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":782,"day":8,"line":"💡 Peepal Fig: the village and a trader know more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click."},{"seq":783,"day":8,"line":"Anel had the day of their life — 1174 kcal. The pantry can't take it all: 587 kcal goes in, 587 kcal is eaten at the fire."},{"seq":784,"day":8,"line":"Saul and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":785,"day":8,"line":"Chloe and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":786,"day":8,"line":"🍽️ Elif watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":787,"day":8,"line":"Andre watches how you handle jewelweed — files it away. Learning by watching."},{"seq":788,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Chloe taught Naran Mediation."},{"seq":789,"day":8,"line":"🤒 Anel is sitting up again. Whatever the fever was, it let go."},{"seq":790,"day":8,"line":"🤒 Saul is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":791,"day":9,"line":"— DAY 9 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":792,"day":9,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":793,"day":9,"line":"\"The System flagged your sector. Move. NOW.\""},{"seq":794,"day":9,"line":"(306 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":795,"day":9,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":796,"day":9,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":797,"day":9,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":798,"day":9,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":799,"day":9,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":800,"day":9,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":801,"day":9,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":802,"day":9,"line":"🌱 Ivy waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":803,"day":9,"line":"🌿 Ivy checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":804,"day":9,"line":"🪨 Ivy pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (8 stone now.)"},{"seq":805,"day":9,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (113 logs now.)"},{"seq":806,"day":9,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":807,"day":9,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":808,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Yuki about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":809,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Anel about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":810,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Elif about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":811,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Andre about Asantewaa. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":812,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Harold about Asantewaa. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":813,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":814,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Andre is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":815,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":816,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument st