":9,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 14 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":889,"day":9,"line":"🗣️ Elif to Yuki, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 47 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\""},{"seq":890,"day":9,"line":"🚶 A stranger walks into Haven. They're thin, scared, and carrying nothing. \"Please,\" they say. \"I heard you have food.\" (Drama: do you share?)"},{"seq":891,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Turmeric. (haldi). The orange root that stains everything it touches. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":892,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":893,"day":9,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Saul taught everyone about Turmeric. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":894,"day":9,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":895,"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1204 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":896,"day":9,"line":"Naran is staring into the fire like it owes them answers."},{"seq":897,"day":9,"line":"Ivy has been turning the Spicebush over — asking after it at fires, handling it on work days — and now knows it deep enough to teach. (Their trade grows: ask them what they know.)"},{"seq":898,"day":9,"line":"Sofia drew Spicebush in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":899,"day":9,"line":"💡 Spicebush: the village and a trader know more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (1/2) and it'll click."},{"seq":900,"day":9,"line":"🔍 Sofia crouches over a small tree with spiny green heart-shaped fruit that turns yellow and perfumed when ripe, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":901,"day":9,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 50. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 4.\""},{"seq":902,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Greenbrier Shoots. Greenbrier. Thorny vines, tender spring tips that snap like asparagus. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":903,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":904,"day":9,"line":"Sofia brought you a sample. The Codex grows."},{"seq":905,"day":9,"line":"🤢 Harold's stomach knots — something in their meal was off."},{"seq":906,"day":9,"line":"Asantewaa and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":907,"day":9,"line":"Ivy and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":908,"day":9,"line":"🍽️ Chloe carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":909,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Naran taught Andre Tireless Stride."},{"seq":910,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Ivy taught Chloe Old World Caches."},{"seq":911,"day":10,"line":"— DAY 10 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":912,"day":10,"line":"On the carcass nearby, something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log (carcass), the humming in the grass (carcass), the thing with headlights for eyes, standing too still (carcass), a dog-shaped silence at the treeline (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost."},{"seq":913,"day":10,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Turmeric — named and noted."},{"seq":914,"day":10,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 199 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":915,"day":10,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":916,"day":10,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":917,"day":10,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":918,"day":10,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":919,"day":10,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":920,"day":10,"line":"Elif watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":921,"day":10,"line":"👂 O