mself. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":973,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Chloe about Asantewaa. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":974,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Sofia telling Yuki about Elif. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":975,"day":10,"line":"Elif showed Andre the Chickpea — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":976,"day":10,"line":"Chloe showed Asantewaa the Turmeric — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":977,"day":10,"line":"Ivy showed Sofia the Greenbrier Shoots — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":978,"day":10,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":979,"day":10,"line":"Chloe is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in."},{"seq":980,"day":10,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":981,"day":10,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":982,"day":10,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":983,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":984,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":985,"day":10,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":986,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Sofia telling Yuki about Asantewaa. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":987,"day":10,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Smell that? Something's different here.\""},{"seq":988,"day":10,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":989,"day":10,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":990,"day":10,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Huh. Never been this way before.\""},{"seq":991,"day":10,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Spicebush, 6× Staghorn Sumac (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":992,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":993,"day":10,"line":"You keep a day's food (540 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":994,"day":10,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":995,"day":10,"line":"Sofia will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":996,"day":10,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":997,"day":10,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":998,"day":10,"line":"⬆️ Green Thumb, Literally deepened to L2! +100% yield (was +50%)."},{"seq":999,"day":10,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"seq":1000,"day":10,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1001,"day":10,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1002,"day":10,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1003,"day":10,"line":"Sofia leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Hummice. Bellow at the choir. The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs.\""},{"seq":1004,"day":10,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Hummice: Bellow at the choir. The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1005,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Bellow at the choir — The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs."},{"seq":1006,"day":10,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1007,"day":10,"line":"You eat Staghorn Sumac and Spicebush (540 kcal)."},{"seq":1008,"day":10,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1009,"day":10,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1010,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (19 stone now.)"},{"seq":1011,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (165 logs now.)"},{"seq":1012,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (21 stone now.)"},{"seq":1013,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Harold hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (171 logs now.)"},{"seq":1014,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Ivy about herself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1015,"day":10,"line":"💧 Elif returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1016,"day":10,"line":"📖 The Codex settles deeper into you. It knows things before you do now. Deaths, especially — it will tell you itself."},{"seq":1017,"day":10,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Mountain Lord is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1018,"day":10,"line":"📺 Harold killed The Mountain Lord out past the ridge — alone — and walked home. 5 rounds, 47 taken. (The village watches the broadcast. Nobody blinks.)"},{"seq":1019,"day":10,"line":"Sofia shakes their head, admiring. \"Did you hear what Harold did?\" You hadn't. Now you have."},{"seq":1020,"day":10,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"Ooh. NEIGHBORS. You know what neighbors are for? STORYLINES. Go knock — worst case, it's CONTENT. Best case? The show gets BIGGER.\""},{"seq":1021,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: The System noticed the neighbors, and wants storylines."},{"seq":1022,"day":10,"line":"🐺 HOWLS in the distance. Closer than before. The System chirps: \"Oh! We made those! Are they... too many? We can make fewer?\" (New monster: hushwolf pack.)"},{"seq":1023,"day":10,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1024,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT CARPENTER'S SQUARE — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn; building and repairs hold better. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":1025,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Carpenter's square\nYour first solo frame, checked and found true. The nod that followed was the whole ceremony. Measure twice, cut once — it's in your hands now."},{"seq":1026,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: Measure twice. You still hear it."},{"seq":1027,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Carpenter's square is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":1028,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT DEAD PHONE — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn (morale). You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":1029,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Dead Phone\nCracked screen, 2% forever. The last text, unsent: 'call when you can.' It was from Marcus — your brother. You have carried the unsent message for years. Maybe he is still out there."},{"seq":1030,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: Your brother — last known heading west. Someone, somewhere, might have seen him."},{"seq":1031,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Dead Phone is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — quiet luck: 1 in 5 misses lands anyway, while worn.)"},{"seq":1032,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT SEED PACKET — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":1033,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Seed packet\nPressed into your hand with an order: keep people fed through winter. Seeds are a plan. Plans are how you stop being helpless."},{"seq":1034,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: You know what grows. You will prove it."},{"seq":1035,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Seed packet is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":1036,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT SEARCH LOCKET — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":1037,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Search locket\nThe last photo, the one where they're laughing at something off-camera. You'll ask the System what it wants, later. First: them."},{"seq":1038,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: You are looking. That counts for something."},{"seq":1039,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Search locket is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — quiet luck: 1 in 5 misses lands anyway, while worn.)"},{"seq":1040,"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1220 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1041,"day":10,"line":"Sofia is staring into the fire like it owes them answers."},{"seq":1042,"day":10,"line":"Naran is showing everyone Knotweed Shoot by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1043,"day":10,"line":"🔍 Yuki crouches over tall white flower umbels on smooth purple-blotched stems, smelling faintly foul, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":1044,"day":10,"line":"Yuki is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 80/100)"},{"seq":1045,"day":10,"line":"Saul and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1046,"day":10,"line":"Anel and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1047,"day":10,"line":"Chloe and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1048,"day":10,"line":"🍽️ Anel looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\""},{"seq":1049,"day":10,"line":"🛟 Asantewaa stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1050,"day":10,"line":"\"Triage tents and broth for the sick, or half rations till it passes, or the healthy hunt hard to keep everyone fed. Pick — everything costs.\""},{"seq":1051,"day":10,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Asantewaa adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1052,"day":10,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1053,"day":11,"line":"— DAY 11 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1054,"day":11,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 130 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1055,"day":11,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1056,"day":11,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1057,"day":11,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1058,"day":11,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1059,"day":11,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1060,"day":11,"line":"🌱 Sofia waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1061,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Sofia checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1062,"day":11,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1063,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (22 stone now.)"},{"seq":1064,"day":11,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1065,"day":11,"line":"💧 Andre eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1066,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (23 stone now.)"},{"seq":1067,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Elif about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1068,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Chloe about Asantewaa. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1069,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (17 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1070,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (57 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1071,"day":11,"line":"Elif heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":1072,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Ivy returns from foraging the wilds: +162 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 162 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1073,"day":11,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1074,"day":11,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1075,"day":11,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1076,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1077,"day":11,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1078,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (173 logs now.)"},{"seq":1079,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (179 logs now.)"},{"seq":1080,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (24 stone now.)"},{"seq":1081,"day":11,"line":"Ivy heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1082,"day":11,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1083,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1084,"day":11,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1085,"day":11,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1086,"day":11,"line":"\"Enough,\" Elif says. \"I want a say in how this village runs. A real say.\""},{"seq":1087,"day":11,"line":"Andre sidles up. \"Got anything to eat? The pot's been thin and my stomach's filing complaints.\""},{"seq":1088,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (184 logs now.)"},{"seq":1089,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (25 stone now.)"},{"seq":1090,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 10 wood. The pile grows. (194 logs now.)"},{"seq":1091,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Saul about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1092,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1093,"day":11,"line":"Chloe showed Harold the Greenbrier Shoots — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":1094,"day":11,"line":"Asantewaa showed Andre the Greenbrier Shoots — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":1095,"day":11,"line":"🚶 Asantewaa is back — found Naran."},{"seq":1096,"day":11,"line":"Chloe heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1097,"day":11,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1098,"day":11,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1099,"day":11,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Harold has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Mountain Lord — I put it down today.\" \"It crouches low, tail lashing once, twice. The stripes go still. Then it comes.\" \"A paw rises, claws out — casual, almost lazy. It is not lazy.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Naran asks \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Sofia breathes \"Say that again"},{"seq":1100,"day":11,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":1101,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1102,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1103,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about Harold. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1104,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Anel telling Andre about Elif. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1105,"day":11,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1106,"day":11,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":1107,"day":11,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":1108,"day":11,"line":"Something moves out there — The Paparazzo."},{"seq":1109,"day":11,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1110,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1111,"day":11,"line":"The Paparazzo stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":1112,"day":11,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1113,"day":11,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1114,"day":11,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1115,"day":11,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1116,"day":11,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1117,"day":11,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1118,"day":11,"line":"Elif watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":1119,"day":11,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1120,"day":11,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1121,"day":11,"line":"Andre leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Anaconda Empress. Strike the head as it coils. When the coils start to wrap, don't pull away — strike the head and eyes. It will release to protect them. On land it is slow and heavy; it needs the water to be the Empress. Never let it get a second wrap.\""},{"seq":1122,"day":11,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Anaconda Empress: Strike the head as it coils. When the coils start to wrap, don't pull away — strike the head and eyes. It will release to protect them. On land it is slow and heavy; it needs the water to be the Empress. Never let it get a second wrap. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1123,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Strike the head as it coils — When the coils start to wrap, don't pull away — strike the head and eyes. It will release to protect them. On land it is slow and heavy; it needs the water to be the Empress. Never let it get a second wrap."},{"seq":1124,"day":11,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1125,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (26 stone now.)"},{"seq":1126,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (27 stone now.)"},{"seq":1127,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (200 logs now.)"},{"seq":1128,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Harold hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (206 logs now.)"},{"seq":1129,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Saul pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (28 stone now.)"},{"seq":1130,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Anel about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1131,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Sofia telling Elif about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1132,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Naran about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1133,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Saul about Elif. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1134,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1135,"day":11,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1136,"day":11,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Fully identify 3 plants (knowledge level 3) within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":1137,"day":11,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1138,"day":11,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)"},{"seq":1139,"day":11,"line":"Chloe came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":1140,"day":11,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1141,"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1212 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1142,"day":11,"line":"Asantewaa came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1143,"day":11,"line":"Fireside lesson: Sofia passes around Chickpea. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."},{"seq":1144,"day":11,"line":"Harold is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 16/100)"},{"seq":1145,"day":11,"line":"Yuki came back with 400 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 200 kcal in, 200 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":1146,"day":11,"line":"Saul and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1147,"day":11,"line":"Ivy and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1148,"day":11,"line":"🍽️ Ivy taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":1149,"day":11,"line":"Andre watches how you handle dandelion — files it away. Learning by watching."},{"seq":1150,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Ivy taught Naran Diplomatic Incident."},{"seq":1151,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Ground Elder — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1152,"day":11,"line":"💡 Ground Elder: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1153,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Sodom Apple — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1154,"day":11,"line":"💡 Sodom Apple: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1155,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Lotus Root — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1156,"day":11,"line":"💡 Lotus Root: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1157,"day":11,"line":"🤒 Saul is on the mend — the fever broke."},{"seq":1158,"day":11,"line":"🤒 Harold is on the mend — the fever broke."},{"seq":1159,"day":11,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":1160,"day":12,"line":"— DAY 12 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1161,"day":12,"line":"💬 Elif says: \"Do you ever feel it? Like the air leans in when something happens.\""},{"seq":1162,"day":12,"line":"◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Emberhold bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Beloved. Strangers ask for your blessing. You don't know what to do with that."},{"seq":1163,"day":12,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1164,"day":12,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1165,"day":12,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1166,"day":12,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1167,"day":12,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1168,"day":12,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1169,"day":12,"line":"🌱 Sofia works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1170,"day":12,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1171,"day":12,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1172,"day":12,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1173,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Sofia telling Yuki about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1174,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Anel telling Sofia about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1175,"day":12,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":1176,"day":12,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Andre is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1177,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1178,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1179,"day":12,"line":"💬 Asantewaa has been asking Andre about Green Thumb, Literally — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":1180,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1181,"day":12,"line":"🌿 Elif returns from foraging the wilds: +528 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1182,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1183,"day":12,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1184,"day":12,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1185,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1186,"day":12,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1187,"day":12,"line":"🌿 Elif checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1188,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (208 logs now.)"},{"seq":1189,"day":12,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1190,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (29 stone now.)"},{"seq":1191,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 11 wood. The pile grows. (219 logs now.)"},{"seq":1192,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Elif about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1193,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Saul about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1194,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Asantewaa about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1195,"day":12,"line":"Ivy heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1196,"day":12,"line":"💧 Chloe returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1197,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1198,"day":12,"line":"Naran is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft."},{"seq":1199,"day":12,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1200,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1201,"day":12,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1202,"day":12,"line":"\"Don't suppose you've got food,\" Andre says, trying for casual and missing."},{"seq":1203,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (30 stone now.)"},{"seq":1204,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (225 logs now.)"},{"seq":1205,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (32 stone now.)"},{"seq":1206,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Chloe telling Ivy about Asantewaa. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1207,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1208,"day":12,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1209,"day":12,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1210,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1211,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1212,"day":12,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Smell that? Something's different here.\""},{"seq":1213,"day":12,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× Muscadine Grapes (900 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1214,"day":12,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1215,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1216,"day":12,"line":"You keep a day's food (900 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1217,"day":12,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1218,"day":12,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Huh. Never been this way before.\""},{"seq":1219,"day":12,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1220,"day":12,"line":"You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1221,"day":12,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1222,"day":12,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1223,"day":12,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1224,"day":12,"line":"Elif doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":1225,"day":12,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1226,"day":12,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1227,"day":12,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1228,"day":12,"line":"Sofia leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Mountain Lord. Stand tall and shout. When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched.\""},{"seq":1229,"day":12,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Mountain Lord: Stand tall and shout. When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1230,"day":12,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Stand tall and shout — When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched."},{"seq":1231,"day":12,"line":"You eat Muscadine Grapes (720 kcal)."},{"seq":1232,"day":12,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1233,"day":12,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":1234,"day":12,"line":"Asantewaa looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1235,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (33 stone now.)"},{"seq":1236,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (230 logs now.)"},{"seq":1237,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (238 logs now.)"},{"seq":1238,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Harold pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (34 stone now.)"},{"seq":1239,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Saul pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (35 stone now.)"},{"seq":1240,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1241,"day":12,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1242,"day":12,"line":"You catch Chloe telling the fire about Harold. \"Harold killed The Mountain Lord out past the ridge\" The story's already growing."},{"seq":1243,"day":12,"line":"Naran doesn't say it twice: \"Thornfield has grain. We have hands. Someone should walk over.\""},{"seq":1244,"day":12,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Loud.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1245,"day":12,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+4 integration)"},{"seq":1246,"day":12,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Captain Bright-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1247,"day":12,"line":"SYSTEM: Codex and inventory overlay online."},{"seq":1248,"day":12,"line":"◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers DeAndre a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 4)"},{"seq":1249,"day":12,"line":"◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pa"},{"seq":1250,"day":12,"line":"SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Reading Glasses. WATCH.\""},{"seq":1251,"day":12,"line":"💛 You hold Reading Glasses and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Green Thumb, Literally)"},{"seq":1252,"day":12,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+3 integration)"},{"seq":1253,"day":12,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"We've been thinking. You know things we don't. Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3). We will watch very closely, which is our entire personality.\""},{"seq":1254,"day":12,"line":"A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet."},{"seq":1255,"day":12,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1256,"day":12,"line":"🌟 \"We have detected elevated attachment to Unit CANVAS PANTS. This is inefficient. This is also... [PROCESSING] ...valuable? Optimization available.\" (Choose an enhancement for your Canvas Pants.)"},{"seq":1257,"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1208 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1258,"day":12,"line":"Naran came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1259,"day":12,"line":"Andre is showing everyone Jamun by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1260,"day":12,"line":"Anel traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1261,"day":12,"line":"Sofia and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1262,"day":12,"line":"Ivy and Sofia lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1263,"day":12,"line":"🌿 Piquiarana — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1264,"day":12,"line":"💡 Piquiarana: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1265,"day":12,"line":"🤒 Sofia is sitting up again. Whatever the fever was, it let go."},{"seq":1266,"day":12,"line":"Elif eats apart from the others tonight. Asantewaa doesn't look up. The fire feels smaller."},{"seq":1267,"day":13,"line":"— DAY 13 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1268,"day":13,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1269,"day":13,"line":"\"Cache by the hollow. Dried meat, clean water. I can't stay. — W.\""},{"seq":1270,"day":13,"line":"(334 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1271,"day":13,"line":"Snow by morning. (0°C — Cold) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear."},{"seq":1272,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1273,"day":13,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1274,"day":13,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1275,"day":13,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1276,"day":13,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1277,"day":13,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1278,"day":13,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Saul sighs. \"I need some space. A corner nobody needs me in. Is that okay?\" (Talk to Saul.)"},{"seq":1279,"day":13,"line":"👂 Overheard — Saul: \"The birds went quiet an hour before the last one came. Remember that.\""},{"seq":1280,"day":13,"line":"👂 Overheard — Andre: \"Ooh — and what if we also...? No, hear me out...\""},{"seq":1281,"day":13,"line":"🌱 Sofia works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1282,"day":13,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1283,"day":13,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1284,"day":13,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1285,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Naran about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1286,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1287,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1288,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1289,"day":13,"line":"👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1290,"day":13,"line":"👥 Elif heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1291,"day":13,"line":"👥 Naran heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1292,"day":13,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1293,"day":13,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1294,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1295,"day":13,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1296,"day":13,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1297,"day":13,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1298,"day":13,"line":"\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":1299,"day":13,"line":"Andre sidles up. \"Got anything to eat? The pot's been thin and my stomach's filing complaints.\""},{"seq":1300,"day":13,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1301,"day":13,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1302,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (241 logs now.)"},{"seq":1303,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (37 stone now.)"},{"seq":1304,"day":13,"line":"Elif stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fetch water crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":1305,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Yuki telling Asantewaa about Chloe. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1306,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Chloe about herself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1307,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about themself. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1308,"day":13,"line":"👥 Chloe heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1309,"day":13,"line":"🧭 Harold is back from past the east (+2110 kcal for the pantry, strange meat (unknown flesh — test it cautiously), 4 stories, a new scar) (Ask them what they saw.)"},{"seq":1310,"day":13,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1311,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1312,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1313,"day":13,"line":"Something moves out there — The Landlord."},{"seq":1314,"day":13,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1315,"day":13,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":1316,"day":13,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":1317,"day":13,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Landlord is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1318,"day":13,"line":"🌀 Green Thumb, Literally is STRAINING at its edges. The gift wants to become something — and it wants YOU to choose what."},{"seq":1319,"day":13,"line":"\"IT’S MOLTING! We didn’t program molting! This is YOUR doing! CHOOSE! Choose what it becomes!\""},{"seq":1320,"day":13,"line":"(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)"},{"seq":1321,"day":13,"line":"\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""},{"seq":1322,"day":13,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 8× Spicebush, 8× Staghorn Sumac (720 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1323,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1324,"day":13,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1325,"day":13,"line":"⚔️ Chloe killed the Landlord with their party — 5 rounds, 56 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1326,"day":13,"line":"You keep a day's food (720 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1327,"day":13,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1328,"day":13,"line":"Ivy will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":1329,"day":13,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1330,"day":13,"line":"You sow Staghorn Sumac: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1331,"day":13,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1332,"day":13,"line":"👂 Overheard — Saul: \"The creek's lower than yesterday. Markedly.\""},{"seq":1333,"day":13,"line":"👂 Overheard — Andre: \"Ooh — and what if we also...? No, hear me out...\""},{"seq":1334,"day":13,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1335,"day":13,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1336,"day":13,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1337,"day":13,"line":"Elif watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":1338,"day":13,"line":"Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\""},{"seq":1339,"day":13,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1340,"day":13,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":1341,"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Asantewaa says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1342,"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Anel says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1343,"day":13,"line":"Sofia hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1344,"day":13,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1345,"day":13,"line":"Ivy leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Landlord. Never end on leased ground. Rent comes due every round you end on leased ground — keep moving and the ledger starves. Each ADDENDUM raises the rent and heals it. Never end two rounds on the same dirt.\""},{"seq":1346,"day":13,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Landlord: Never end on leased ground. Rent comes due every round you end on leased ground — keep moving and the ledger starves. Each ADDENDUM raises the rent and heals it. Never end two rounds on the same dirt. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1347,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never end on leased ground — Rent comes due every round you end on leased ground — keep moving and the ledger starves. Each ADDENDUM raises the rent and heals it. Never end two rounds on the same dirt."},{"seq":1348,"day":13,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1349,"day":13,"line":"You eat Staghorn Sumac and Spicebush (600 kcal)."},{"seq":1350,"day":13,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1351,"day":13,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1352,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Andre checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1353,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 11 wood. The pile grows. (252 logs now.)"},{"seq":1354,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Harold hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (258 logs now.)"},{"seq":1355,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Saul pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (38 stone now.)"},{"seq":1356,"day":13,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1357,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1358,"day":13,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1359,"day":13,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1360,"day":13,"line":"You catch Asantewaa telling the fire about Harold. \"Harold came back mauled by Flashbulb Moth (1 rounds, 5 taken) and alive. A missing tip of the left ear now.\" The story's already growing."},{"seq":1361,"day":13,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1362,"day":13,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Chloe has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Landlord — I put it down today.\" \"It plants a sign in the ground around you. NOTICE SERVED. The ground is claimed.\" \"You ended your turn on claimed ground. The rent is due. It rises with every Addendum.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Andre breathes \"And you're still standing.\" Yuki say"},{"seq":1363,"day":13,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":1364,"day":13,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":1365,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (262 logs now.)"},{"seq":1366,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (39 stone now.)"},{"seq":1367,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1368,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Anel about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1369,"day":13,"line":"💧 Elif returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1370,"day":13,"line":"💧 Chloe returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1371,"day":13,"line":"Harold stared at their hands for a long time today. Something is changing."},{"seq":1372,"day":13,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Big.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1373,"day":13,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1374,"day":13,"line":"Asantewaa came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":1375,"day":13,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":1376,"day":13,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Andre is calling it \"Big Ugly.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1377,"day":13,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":1378,"day":13,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1379,"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1380,"day":13,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Andre fixing something."},{"seq":1381,"day":13,"line":"Fireside lesson: Saul passes around Turmeric. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."},{"seq":1382,"day":13,"line":"Sofia sets aside time with The Mountain Lord flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Sofia tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it."},{"seq":1383,"day":13,"line":"Naran came back with 353 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 177 kcal in, 176 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":1384,"day":13,"line":"Saul and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1385,"day":13,"line":"Anel and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1386,"day":13,"line":"Sofia and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1387,"day":13,"line":"Chloe and Asantewaa lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1388,"day":13,"line":"🍽️ Ivy carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":1389,"day":13,"line":"✦ Andre has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1390,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Andre discovered Tells (tells)."},{"seq":1391,"day":13,"line":"✦ Andre has found something — String Wall. Days of evidence_board and eagle_eye side by side, and now they move as one. (string_wall: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1392,"day":13,"line":"✦ Andre has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1393,"day":13,"line":"✦ Asantewaa has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1394,"day":13,"line":"✦ Asantewaa has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1395,"day":13,"line":"✦ Ivy has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1396,"day":13,"line":"✦ Ivy has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1397,"day":13,"line":"✦ Chloe has found something — Peacemaker's Voice. Days of diplomat and mediator side by side, and now they move as one. (peacemakers_voice: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1398,"day":13,"line":"✦ Chloe has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1399,"day":13,"line":"✦ Chloe has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1400,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Andre taught Ivy Tireless Stride."},{"seq":1401,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Muscadine Grapes — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1402,"day":13,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: Muscadine Grapes — Level 2. You knew it was safe. the village knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Parts: fruit (eat), leaves (wrap food), vines (cordage)."},{"seq":1403,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Staghorn Sumac — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1404,"day":13,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: Staghorn Sumac — Level 2. You knew it was safe. the village knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Parts: red berry fuzz (lemonade/tea). NOT the white berries — those are poison."},{"seq":1405,"day":13,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":1406,"day":14,"line":"— DAY 14 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1407,"day":14,"line":"Something has shifted. Conversations stop when you approach the fire. Nobody meets your eyes for long."},{"seq":1408,"day":14,"line":"📓 Codex: The village has gone quiet around me. I don't know why — I've eaten only what was set before me."},{"seq":1409,"day":14,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1410,"day":14,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+4 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 247 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1411,"day":14,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1412,"day":14,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1413,"day":14,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1414,"day":14,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1415,"day":14,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1416,"day":14,"line":"Elif doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":1417,"day":14,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1418,"day":14,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1419,"day":14,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1420,"day":14,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 5L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1421,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1422,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Sofia about herself. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1423,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1424,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Harold is still hurting (11 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1425,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1426,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1427,"day":14,"line":"👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1428,"day":14,"line":"Elif heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1429,"day":14,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1430,"day":14,"line":"Ivy is sweeping the corners out, muttering at the dust."},{"seq":1431,"day":14,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1432,"day":14,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1433,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1434,"day":14,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 26L left."},{"seq":1435,"day":14,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1436,"day":14,"line":"\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":1437,"day":14,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1438,"day":14,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1439,"day":14,"line":"💧 Andre eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1440,"day":14,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (267 logs now.)"},{"seq":1441,"day":14,"line":"💬 Anel says: \"If they're watching, let them watch me work. That's all I've got.\""},{"seq":1442,"day":14,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1443,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1444,"day":14,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1445,"day":14,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1446,"day":14,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (40 stone now.)"},{"seq":1447,"day":14,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (275 logs now.)"},{"seq":1448,"day":14,"line":"Asantewaa heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1449,"day":14,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1450,"day":14,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1451,"day":14,"line":"Ivy is feeding the fire one stick at a time, watching the flame take."},{"seq":1452,"day":14,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1453,"day":14,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":1454,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1455,"day":14,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1456,"day":14,"line":"Something moves out there — The Static Kite."},{"seq":1457,"day":14,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1458,"day":14,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":1459,"day":14,"line":"It followed you. The Static Kite is here."},{"seq":1460,"day":14,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Huh. Never been this way before.\""},{"seq":1461,"day":14,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1462,"day":14,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":1463,"day":14,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1464,"day":14,"line":"The Static Kite stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":1465,"day":14,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1466,"day":14,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Smell that? Something's different here.\""},{"seq":1467,"day":14,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1468,"day":14,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1469,"day":14,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1470,"day":14,"line":"Elif doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":1471,"day":14,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1472,"day":14,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1473,"day":14,"line":"Asantewaa looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1474,"day":14,"line":"Anel looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1475,"day":14,"line":"Sofia hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1476,"day":14,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1477,"day":14,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1478,"day":14,"line":"🎣 Andre worked the creek — 2 fish, +480 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1479,"day":14,"line":"🌿 Harold checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1480,"day":14,"line":"🪨 Harold pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (41 stone now.)"},{"seq":1481,"day":14,"line":"🪨 Saul pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (42 stone now.)"},{"seq":1482,"day":14,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1483,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1484,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1485,"day":14,"line":"💧 Elif returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1486,"day":14,"line":"🍲 Elif is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":1487,"day":14,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"AUDIENCE EXPANSION! Your party cap is now FOUR! The people demanded bigger ensembles! Don't let us down!\""},{"seq":1488,"day":14,"line":"📦 INCOMING: a crate thumps down outside your door, trailing parachute silk and the smell of glitter. Stenciled on the side, in enormous cheerful letters: FOR LUCK."},{"seq":1489,"day":14,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"A viewer sent this. A FAN. We checked. It is not dinner.\" A pause. \"We checked twice. The fans are very insistent that you open it ON CAMERA.\""},{"seq":1490,"day":14,"line":"The package sits in your pack, unopened. Opening it takes a day-part — the fans demand the full unboxing. (Use it from your pack when you have a morning to spend.)"},{"seq":1491,"day":14,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1492,"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1493,"day":14,"line":"Naran came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1494,"day":14,"line":"Andre: \"The greenbrier shoots patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\""},{"seq":1495,"day":14,"line":"Sofia: \"Spicebush is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\""},{"seq":1496,"day":14,"line":"Harold and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1497,"day":14,"line":"Sofia and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1498,"day":14,"line":"Chloe and Ivy lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1499,"day":14,"line":"Naran and Chloe lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1500,"day":14,"line":"Naran and Elif lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1501,"day":14,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE HUNGER WINTER. Three days now the village has gone to sleep hungry. The pantry is an echo. This is the part the old stories skip — the part where you find out what you’re made of."},{"seq":1502,"day":14,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Organic units require fuel. Noting. Noting loudly. The audience is very quiet, which for them is screaming.\""},{"seq":1503,"day":14,"line":"🛟 Asantewaa stands up by the fire. \"We can't just watch the empty bins happen. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1504,"day":14,"line":"\"Half rations for three days, voted and held — or a hard hunt now, hungry, to fill the bins before it's choosing-who-eats.\""},{"seq":1505,"day":14,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Asantewaa adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1506,"day":14,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1507,"day":14,"line":"📓 Codex: Saul taught Elif Animal Behavior."},{"seq":1508,"day":14,"line":"Thornfield's speaker sent a runner: the northeast ground feeds both villages or neither. They want to talk — properly, at their fire. Ignoring this is also an answer."},{"seq":1509,"day":14,"line":"You find Asantewaa and Elif in a sharp, quiet argument. It stops when you approach. Neither explains."},{"seq":1510,"day":14,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":1511,"day":15,"line":"— DAY 15 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1512,"day":15,"line":"👀 Yuki starts a story with \"back when I was a teacher...\" then corrects to something else mid-sentence. The correction is worse than the slip."},{"seq":1513,"day":15,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1514,"day":15,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1515,"day":15,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1516,"day":15,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1517,"day":15,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1518,"day":15,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1519,"day":15,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1520,"day":15,"line":"👂 Overheard — Sofia: \"The birds went quiet an hour before the last one came. Remember that.\""},{"seq":1521,"day":15,"line":"👂 Overheard — Naran: \"Yeah. Yeah, okay. That's solid.\""},{"seq":1522,"day":15,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1523,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1524,"day":15,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1525,"day":15,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 6L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1526,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Sofia about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1527,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Naran telling Elif about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1528,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about Asantewaa. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1529,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1530,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Harold is still hurting (11 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1531,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1532,"day":15,"line":"💧 Asantewaa returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1533,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1534,"day":15,"line":"Sofia heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":1535,"day":15,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1536,"day":15,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1537,"day":15,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1538,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1539,"day":15,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1540,"day":15,"line":"Andre hovers near you. \"I hate asking. I'm asking anyway — anything to spare?\""},{"seq":1541,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1542,"day":15,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1543,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (276 logs now.)"},{"seq":1544,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (44 stone now.)"},{"seq":1545,"day":15,"line":"Elif doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fish crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":1546,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about Sofia. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1547,"day":15,"line":"Asantewaa heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":1548,"day":15,"line":"Elif heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":1549,"day":15,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1550,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1551,"day":15,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1552,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1553,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (282 logs now.)"},{"seq":1554,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (46 stone now.)"},{"seq":1555,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Asantewaa about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1556,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about Sofia. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1557,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Chloe about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1558,"day":15,"line":"Ivy heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1559,"day":15,"line":"🍲 Chloe eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."},{"seq":1560,"day":15,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1561,"day":15,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":1562,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1563,"day":15,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove