"seq":1581,"day":15,"line":"Elif steps closer. \"We need to talk. About who's actually running things here.\""},{"seq":1582,"day":15,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1583,"day":15,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1584,"day":15,"line":"Asantewaa looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1585,"day":15,"line":"Anel shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1586,"day":15,"line":"Sofia hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1587,"day":15,"line":"Elif hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1588,"day":15,"line":"📋 Ivy — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1589,"day":15,"line":"Saul leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Static Kite. Leave the marked square. The mark is generous — two full beats to leave the square. When it dips to transmit it's at melee height and takes +50%: that's the only window. Leave the square, then punish the dip.\""},{"seq":1590,"day":15,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Static Kite: Leave the marked square. The mark is generous — two full beats to leave the square. When it dips to transmit it's at melee height and takes +50%: that's the only window. Leave the square, then punish the dip. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1591,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Leave the marked square — The mark is generous — two full beats to leave the square. When it dips to transmit it's at melee height and takes +50%: that's the only window. Leave the square, then punish the dip."},{"seq":1592,"day":15,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Muscadine Grapes. Uses: sugar, resveratrol. Leaves are edible (like grape leaves). (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: thick-skinned wild grapes, sweet-tart; bait: fallen fruit baits traps well."},{"seq":1593,"day":15,"line":"You eat Muscadine Grapes (1080 kcal)."},{"seq":1594,"day":15,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1595,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1596,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (288 logs now.)"},{"seq":1597,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Andre worked the creek — 5 fish, +1200 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1598,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Harold worked the creek — 2 fish, +350 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1599,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 3 fish, +385 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1600,"day":15,"line":"🍲 Ivy cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1601,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Asantewaa about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1602,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Sofia returns from foraging the wilds: +497 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1603,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Elif returns from foraging the wilds: +225 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1604,"day":15,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1605,"day":15,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":1606,"day":15,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 72. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 5.\""},{"seq":1607,"day":15,"line":"◈ THE CREEP — DeAndre's thoughts have an echo now. The System's echo. Or theirs. Hard to tell anymore. Gifts used in sequence resonate — try them together. (Ability slots: 5)"},{"seq":1608,"day":15,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+8 integration)"},{"seq":1609,"day":15,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 16 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1610,"day":15,"line":"◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something."},{"seq":1611,"day":15,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Ugly.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1612,"day":15,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1613,"day":15,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":1614,"day":15,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1615,"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1616,"day":15,"line":"Sofia paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":1617,"day":15,"line":"Naran came back with 563 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1618,"day":15,"line":"Naran and Sofia lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1619,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Saul taught Andre Animal Behavior."},{"seq":1620,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Anel taught Elif Reading Tracks."},{"seq":1621,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Chloe taught Naran Old World Caches."},{"seq":1622,"day":15,"line":"🤒 Harold is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1623,"day":16,"line":"— DAY 16 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1624,"day":16,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Muscadine Grapes — understood at last."},{"seq":1625,"day":16,"line":"👀 \"teacher, huh?\" Yuki nods — then, an hour later, drops a shop-talk detail no teacher would ever get right. They catch themselves. Too late."},{"seq":1626,"day":16,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1627,"day":16,"line":"\"The System flagged your sector. Move. NOW.\""},{"seq":1628,"day":16,"line":"(471 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1629,"day":16,"line":"👁 \"Don't — don't react