aler at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1647,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Asantewaa returns from foraging the wilds: +480 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1648,"day":16,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1649,"day":16,"line":"🩹 Chloe is still hurting (44 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1650,"day":16,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1651,"day":16,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1652,"day":16,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1653,"day":16,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1654,"day":16,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1655,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1656,"day":16,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1657,"day":16,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (47 stone now.)"},{"seq":1658,"day":16,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 11 wood. The pile grows. (296 logs now.)"},{"seq":1659,"day":16,"line":"Asantewaa heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1660,"day":16,"line":"👥 Sofia heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1661,"day":16,"line":"💧 Ivy returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1662,"day":16,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1663,"day":16,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1664,"day":16,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1665,"day":16,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1666,"day":1