 raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1702,"day":16,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1703,"day":16,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Staghorn Sumac. Uses: tart drink (sumac-ade), vitamin C. Steep in cold water. (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: tart red fuzz steeped cold = sumac-ade (NOT white berries — poison); seasoning: dried red spice, lemony and bright; dye: red-brown dye from cones and leaves."},{"seq":1704,"day":16,"line":"You eat Staghorn Sumac and Spicebush (840 kcal)."},{"seq":1705,"day":16,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1706,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1707,"day":16,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (49 stone now.)"},{"seq":1708,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Andre worked the creek — 5 fish, +900 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1709,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Harold worked the creek — 4 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1710,"day":16,"line":"🍽️ Saul checks the pantry before heading out — ~4 days of fresh on hand, but someone has gone hungry three days running. The hungry eat first: keeps working the fish nets instead of turning to other work."},{"seq":1711,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1712,"day":16,"line":"🍲 Sofia cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1713,"day":16,"line":"💧 Asantewaa returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1714,"day":16,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1715,"day":16,"line":"SYSTEM: Deep integration. You see the world through us now."},{"seq":1716,"day":16,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 80. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 6.\""},{"seq":1717,"day":16,"line":"The overlay's tone has changed around you. Warmer. It notices you noticing."},{"seq":1718,"day":16,"line":"◈ THE GRANT — full integration. The System opens the last slot like a door it built just for DeAndre. \"You have been adequate entertainment. We upgrade adequate.\" (Ability slots: 6)"},{"seq":1719,"day":16,"line":"◈ FULL INTEGRATION — you don't look AT the System anymore. You look WITH it."},{"seq":1720,"day":16,"line":"📺 The audience has a favorite, and it's you. The chant doesn't have words. It doesn't need them."},{"seq":1721,"day":16,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+6 integration)"},{"seq":1722,"day":16,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 15 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1723,"day":16,"line":"🔇 The birds have gone quiet. Even the crickets. The woods are holding their breath."},{"seq":1724,"day":16,"line":"Something out there knows exactly where you sleep. It isn't howling. That's the worst part — it isn't making a sound at all."},{"seq":1725,"day":16,"line":"Three shapes at the treeline — dog-shaped silences, circling. (A real pack is out there now: 3 of them. No names yet — nobody's lived to argue about one.)"},{"seq":1726,"day":16,"line":"Investigate and the morning is gone — tracking them costs a full day-part. Bar the door and you learn nothing. Your call."},{"seq":1727,"day":16,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1728,"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1729,"day":16,"line":"Saul traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1730,"day":16,"line":"Saul and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1731,"day":16,"line":"Ivy and Asantewaa lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1732,"day":16,"line":"Andre is getting sharper out there with you — steadier hands, better eyes. (Mentor bonus growing.)"},{"seq":1733,"day":16,"line":"✦ Ivy has found something — String Wall. Days of evidence_board and eagle_eye side by side, and now they move as one. (string_wall: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1734,"day":16,"line":"✦ Chloe has found something — Word of Mouth. Days of gossip_network and peacemaker side by side, and now they move as one. (word_of_mouth: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1735,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Knotweed Shoot — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1736,"day":16,"line":"💡 Knotweed Shoot: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1737,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Jamun — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1738,"day":16,"line":"💡 Jamun: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1739,"day":16,"line":"🤒 Yuki is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1740,"day":16,"line":"🛟 Asantewaa looks up from the fire. \"And now sickness, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":1741,"day":16,"line":"You carry a message from Asantewaa to Elif. It's not kind. You deliver it anyway. That's what neighbors do, apparently."},{"seq":1742,"day":17,"line":"— DAY 17 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1743,"day":17,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Staghorn Sumac — understood at last."},{"seq":1744,"day":17,"line":"👁️ Yuki cornered Elif away from the fire. No one heard the words, but Elif hasn't been the same since."},{"seq":1745,"day":17,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1746,"day":17,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 375 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1747,"day":17,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1748,"day":17,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1749,"day":17,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1750,"day":17,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1751,"day":17,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1752,"day":17,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1753,"day":17,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1754,"day":17,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1755,"day":17,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1756,"day":17,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1757,"day":17,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1758,"day":17,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1759,"day":17,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Andre sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Andre.)"},{"seq":1760,"day":17,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1761,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1762,"day":17,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1763,"day":17,"line":"💧 Andre returns with 4L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1764,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Naran about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1765,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Sofia about Asantewaa. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1766,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (27 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1767,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (63 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1768,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Ivy is still hurting (66 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1769,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Chloe is still hurting (47 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1770,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Harold is still hurting (9 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1771,"day":17,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1772,"day":17,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":1773,"day":17,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1774,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1775,"day":17,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1776,"day":17,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1777,"day":17,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1778,"day":17,"line":"👂 Overheard — Andre: \"We should paint the warning markers. Red means run, yellow means look.\""},{"seq":1779,"day":17,"line":"👂 Overheard — Ivy: \"Correlation isn't cause, but three data points is a pattern. Noted.\""},{"seq":1780,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +315 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1781,"day":17,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1782,"day":17,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (307 logs now.)"},{"seq":1783,"day":17,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (50 stone now.)"},{"seq":1784,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1785,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Sofia about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1786,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1787,"day":17,"line":"💬 Asantewaa has been asking Andre about Green Whisper — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":1788,"day":17,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1789,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1790,"day":17,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 25L left."},{"seq":1791,"day":17,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1792,"day":17,"line":"👂 Overheard — Andre: \"We should paint the warning markers. Red means run, yellow means look.\""},{"seq":1793,"day":17,"line":"👂 Overheard — Ivy: \"Correlation isn't cause, but three data points is a pattern. Noted.\""},{"seq":1794,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1795,"day":17,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1796,"day":17,"line":"🪵 Andre hauls back 11 wood. The pile grows. (318 logs now.)"},{"seq":1797,"day":17,"line":"Elif stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fish crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":1798,"day":17,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1799,"day":17,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1800,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1801,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1802,"day":17,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":1803,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Saul about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1804,"day":17,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1805,"day":17,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":1806,"day":17,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":1807,"day":17,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1808,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1809,"day":17,"line":"The Paparazzo stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":1810,"day":17,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1811,"day":17,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Stay close, yeah?\""},{"seq":1812,"day":17,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1813,"day":17,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1814,"day":17,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1815,"day":17,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1816,"day":17,"line":"Elif doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":1817,"day":17,"line":"Elif plants themself in front of you. \"This isn't working. You know it, I know it. Say it out loud.\""},{"seq":1818,"day":17,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1819,"day":17,"line":"Asantewaa hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1820,"day":17,"line":"Anel shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1821,"day":17,"line":"📋 Sofia — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1822,"day":17,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":1823,"day":17,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1824,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1825,"day":17,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (51 stone now.)"},{"seq":1826,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Andre worked the creek — 2 fish, +360 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1827,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Harold worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1828,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1829,"day":17,"line":"🍲 Sofia cooked for the haven — meals stretched. Sofia worked the smoke racks too — 3 batches preserved (~872 kcal, keeps a couple of weeks)."},{"seq":1830,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Andre telling Saul about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1831,"day":17,"line":"📨 Word came: a weathered farmer of Thornfield wants to join Haven. \"Word travels: Haven takes people in. I'm people.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":1832,"day":17,"line":"🗣️ Sofia to Ivy, by the fire: \"The pantry's the thing. We don't raise The Palisade on empty shelves — 10,467 of 14,000 kcal.\""},{"seq":1833,"day":17,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1834,"day":17,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1835,"day":17,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":1836,"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1837,"day":17,"line":"Andre came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1838,"day":17,"line":"🔍 Sofia crouches over a hibiscus-like plant with ridged green pods, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":1839,"day":17,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Sofia — Field 1. Three offers; they took Green Thumb, Literally. Earned, chosen. (green_thumb: villager level-up)"},{"seq":1840,"day":17,"line":"📓 Codex: Sofia chose Green Thumb, Literally (green_thumb) at Field 1."},{"seq":1841,"day":17,"line":"Sofia came back with 269 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1842,"day":17,"line":"Asantewaa and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1843,"day":17,"line":"Ivy and Andre lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1844,"day":17,"line":"Chloe and Ivy lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1845,"day":17,"line":"Chloe and Harold lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1846,"day":17,"line":"Andre shows you Green Whisper — not the power, just the shape of it. Watch and learn."},{"seq":1847,"day":17,"line":"📓 Codex: you've SEEN Green Whisper now. Days ago the plants started leaning toward you. You know which ones are thirsty, which are sick, which are hiding something good. You don’t know how you know. Cultivate growing Haven beds: 200 kcal, once per bed each day. Higher levels accelerate growth further."},{"seq":1848,"day":17,"line":"📓 Codex: Asantewaa taught Ivy Mediation."},{"seq":1849,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Spicebush — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1850,"day":17,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: Spicebush — Level 3. You knew it was safe. the village and a trader knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Uses: vitamin C in berries, flavoring, morale. Berries dry well."},{"seq":1851,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Peepal Fig — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1852,"day":17,"line":"💡 Peepal Fig: the village and a trader know more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click."},{"seq":1853,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Chickpea — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1854,"day":17,"line":"💡 Chickpea: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1855,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Turmeric — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1856,"day":17,"line":"💡 Turmeric: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1857,"day":18,"line":"— DAY 18 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1858,"day":18,"line":"Overnight, Staghorn Sumac went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":1859,"day":18,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1860,"day":18,"line":"👀 Anel claims to belong somewhere — then spends the whole evening oriented around something they won't name. The wanting is real. The word for it isn't \"to belong somewhere\"."},{"seq":1861,"day":18,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1862,"day":18,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":1863,"day":18,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Huckleberry. Small dark berries, mountain slopes. Bears love them. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1864,"day":18,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":1865,"day":18,"line":"Asantewaa was watching. Now they know Huckleberry too."},{"seq":1866,"day":18,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1867,"day":18,"line":"Took Fish catch (smoked)."},{"seq":1868,"day":18,"line":"You eat Fish catch (smoked) (168 kcal)."},{"seq":1869,"day":18,"line":"Took Foraged food (dried)."},{"seq":1870,"day":18,"line":"You eat Foraged food (dried) (384 kcal)."},{"seq":1871,"day":18,"line":"Took Fish catch (smoked)."},{"seq":1872,"day":18,"line":"You eat Fish catch (smoked) (320 kcal)."},{"seq":1873,"day":18,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1874,"day":18,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1875,"day":18,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1876,"day":18,"line":"You eat Canned so