aa showed Yuki the Huckleberry — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":1895,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Andre is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1896,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (30 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1897,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Anel is still hurting (66 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1898,"day":18,"line":"Sofia heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1899,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Ivy is still hurting (69 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1900,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Chloe is still hurting (50 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1901,"day":18,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1902,"day":18,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1903,"day":18,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":1904,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1905,"day":18,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1906,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +385 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1907,"day":18,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1908,"day":18,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (320 logs now.)"},{"seq":1909,"day":18,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (52 stone now.)"},{"seq":1910,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1911,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1912,"day":18,"line":"Naran heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1913,"day":18,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1914,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1915,"day":18,"line":"📋 Andre — 💧 Fetch water. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1916,"day":18,"line":"Ivy forages the bushes."},{"seq":1917,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1918,"day":18,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (325 logs now.)"},{"seq":1919,"day":18,"line":"🪨 Andre pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (53 stone now.)"},{"seq":1920,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about Sofia. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1921,"day":18,"line":"Asantewaa sets out to find Naran. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":1922,"day":18,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1923,"day":18,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":1924,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1925,"day":18,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1926,"day":18,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Murkcap is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1927,"day":18,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 12× Muscadine Grapes (1080 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1928,"day":18,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1929,"day":18,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1930,"day":18,"line":"⚔️ Asantewaa killed the Murkcap with their party — 6 rounds, 62 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1931,"day":18,"line":"You keep a day's food (1080 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1932,"day":18,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 18 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1933,"day":18,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1934,"day":18,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1935,"day":18,"line":"📋 Andre — 🎣 Fish. Andre nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1936,"day":18,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1937,"day":18,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1938,"day":18,"line":"Asantewaa hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1939,"day":18,"line":"Anel looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1940,"day":18,"line":"📋 Sofia — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1941,"day":18,"line":"Ivy leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Murkcap. Stay out of the sporefall. The spores only drift so far and sink in still air. When the gills start breathing, back off and let the cloud settle — then move in while it recovers. Never stand downwind of a breathing cap.\""},{"seq":1942,"day":18,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Murkcap: Stay out of the sporefall. The spores only drift so far and sink in still air. When the gills start breathing, back off and let the cloud settle — then move in while it recovers. Never stand downwind of a breathing cap. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1943,"day":18,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Stay out of the sporefall — The spores only drift so far and sink in still air. When the gills start breathing, back off and let the cloud settle — then move in while it recovers. Never stand downwind of a breathing cap."},{"seq":1944,"day":18,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1945,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1946,"day":18,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (330 logs now.)"},{"seq":1947,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Andre worked the creek — 2 fish, +480 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1948,"day":18,"line":"🌿 Harold checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1949,"day":18,"line":"🪵 Harold hauls back 7 wood. The pile grows. (337 logs now.)"},{"seq":1950,"day":18,"line":"🪨 Saul pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (54 stone now.)"},{"seq":1951,"day":18,"line":"🍲 Sofia cooked for the haven — meals stretched. Sofia worked the smoke racks too — 1 batch preserved (~215 kcal, keeps a couple of weeks)."},{"seq":1952,"day":18,"line":"💧 Sofia returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1953,"day":18,"line":"💧 Naran returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1954,"day":18,"line":"🍲 Elif is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":1955,"day":18,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 15 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1956,"day":18,"line":"🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Paparazzo, Big Big, Flashbulb Moth) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":1957,"day":18,"line":"🚨 The Paparazzo, Big Big, Flashbulb Moth is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"seq":1958,"day":18,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Paparazzo is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1959,"day":18,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Sofia is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1960,"day":18,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":1961,"day":18,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE FIRST GRAVE. Sofia is dead. The village digs its first grave, and everyone understands at once: this place can kill you. It just did."},{"seq":1962,"day":18,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Oh. Oh no. Was that supposed to happen? The audience is crying. I did not know they could do that.\""},{"seq":1963,"day":18,"line":"📖 The entry for Sofia is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":1964,"day":18,"line":"SOFIA — GONE. 1 open question closed unanswered."},{"seq":1965,"day":18,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Flashbulb Moth is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1966,"day":18,"line":"🛡️ Anel, Sofia and Elif met them at the door — 2 put down. Sofia didn't come back. Anel, Elif are hurt."},{"seq":1967,"day":18,"line":"One of them is coming for YOU — Big Big, inside the haven, eyes on your bedroll."},{"seq":1968,"day":18,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"We have studied cooking. Step one: apply heat until food stops being food? No — wait. We had it. Teach us? Show us one cooked meal, start to finish.\""},{"seq":1969,"day":18,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"We have already cleared your morning. You are welcome. We require 300 kcal of tubers and your full attention. The fans love a cooking segment.\""},{"seq":1970,"day":18,"line":"You lay out 360 kcal of tubers and roots, build the fire up, and start. The System watches with the intensity of a trillion eyes."},{"seq":1971,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"Heat applied. Food is now HOT. Hypothesis: hot food is better because it is hot. ...We will allow it.\""},{"seq":1972,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"You stopped BEFORE it stopped being food. Restraint. We did not know restraint was a flavor. Logging it as one.\""},{"seq":1973,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"The tubers did not scream. Our models predicted screaming. The models have been updated. You are welcome.\""},{"seq":1974,"day":18,"line":"🍲 It replicates your stew for the whole haven. It added a garnish of pocket lint. It's still 400 kcal. You eat around the lint. (+400 kcal to the pantry. The System is SO proud.)"},{"seq":1975,"day":18,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1976,"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1977,"day":18,"line":"Chloe traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1978,"day":18,"line":"Elif came back with 306 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1979,"day":18,"line":"📓 Codex: Saul taught Andre Reading Tracks."},{"seq":1980,"day":18,"line":"🤒 Andre is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1981,"day":18,"line":"🤒 Anel is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1982,"day":18,"line":"🛟 Naran stands up by the fire. \"People are going down and the tents are filling — we do something or we don't, but we decide. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1983,"day":18,"line":"\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""},{"seq":1984,"day":18,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Naran adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1985,"day":18,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1986,"day":18,"line":"Asantewaa corners you by the fire: \"Don't share your haul with Elif.\" It's not a request."},{"seq":1987,"day":19,"line":"— DAY 19 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1988,"day":19,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Huckleberry — named and noted."},{"seq":1989,"day":19,"line":"💬 Chloe says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\""},{"seq":1990,"day":19,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1991,"day":19,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":1992,"day":19,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE BREACH. It got INSIDE. The haven was supposed to be the safe place — the one place. It isn’t."},{"seq":1993,"day":19,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\""},{"seq":1994,"day":19,"line":"The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline."},{"seq":1995,"day":19,"line":"⚔ BIG BIG! (4 of them!) Andre, Saul, Ivy join you!"},{"seq":1996,"day":19,"line":"Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."},{"seq":1997,"day":19,"line":"Saul doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\""},{"seq":1998,"day":19,"line":"The woods go silent — not quiet. Silent. Like the world holding its breath. The pack is already moving. They go quiet before the rush. If the birds stop, they're already moving."},{"seq":1999,"day":19,"line":"The Big Big 4 is on you — no warning, just teeth."},{"seq":2000,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":2001,"day":19,"line":"Big Big 4 hits you for 12."},{"seq":2002,"day":19,"line":"📖 Codex: Silent Rush — gives no warning — it just moves and hits. You won't forget this."},{"seq":2003,"day":19,"line":"🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer."},{"seq":2004,"day":19,"line":"💬 Andre: \"Stay behind me!\""},{"seq":2005,"day":19,"line":"🤝 Andre: \"There's two of them. We can't do this scattered — we need a real team. A named one. People fight harder for a name.\""},{"seq":2006,"day":19,"line":"(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")"},{"seq":2007,"day":19,"line":"⚠️ 1 threats: Big Big 1 (×4) — all here, all now.\nYour party: Andre. You are outnumbered — fight like it."},{"seq":2008,"day":19,"line":"Saul strikes the Big Big 4."},{"seq":2009,"day":19,"line":"Saul hits wolf 4 for 11."},{"seq":2010,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Saul."},{"seq":2011,"day":19,"line":"Andre strikes the Big Big 4."},{"seq":2012,"day":19,"line":"Andre hits wolf 4 for 8."},{"seq":2013,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Andre."},{"seq":2014,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 4's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2015,"day":19,"line":"The pack's heads turn as one — toward Ivy. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)"},{"seq":2016,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +2)"},{"seq":2017,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2018,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits you for 9."},{"seq":2019,"day":19,"line":"📖 Codex: Harass — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this."},{"seq":2020,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 2's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2021,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2022,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 2's Harass hits you for 9."},{"seq":2023,"day":19,"line":"The pack's heads turn as one — toward Ivy. The straggler. (They run down the isolated — stay together.)"},{"seq":2024,"day":19,"line":"You don't stroll through the Big Big 4."},{"seq":2025,"day":19,"line":"Saul patches you up (+12 HP). \"Hold still!\""},{"seq":2026,"day":19,"line":"Ivy runs for it!"},{"seq":2027,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds Ivy — no dodging it."},{"seq":2028,"day":19,"line":"Ivy's gear absorbs 2."},{"seq":2029,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits Ivy for 4."},{"seq":2030,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +2)"},{"seq":2031,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":2032,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits you for 10."},{"seq":2033,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 2's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +2)"},{"seq":2034,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2035,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 2's Harass hits you for 8."},{"seq":2036,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 1's Harass finds Ivy — no dodging it."},{"seq":2037,"day":19,"line":"Ivy's gear absorbs 2."},{"seq":2038,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 1's Harass hits Ivy for 5."},{"seq":2039,"day":19,"line":"Saul strikes the Big Big 4."},{"seq":2040,"day":19,"line":"Saul hits wolf 4 for 8."},{"seq":2041,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Saul."},{"seq":2042,"day":19,"line":"Andre patches you up (+12 HP). \"Hold still!\""},{"seq":2043,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 4's attention SNAPS to you — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2044,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +2)"},{"seq":2045,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2046,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits you for 10."},{"seq":2047,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2048,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":2049,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits you for 12."},{"seq":2050,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 2's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +6)"},{"seq":2051,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":2052,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 2's Harass hits you for 11."},{"seq":2053,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 1's attention SNAPS to Andre — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2054,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 1's Harass finds you — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2055,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":2056,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 1's Harass hits you for 11."},{"seq":2057,"day":19,"line":"Saul strikes the Big Big 2."},{"seq":2058,"day":19,"line":"Saul hits wolf 2 for 10."},{"seq":2059,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Saul."},{"seq":2060,"day":19,"line":"Andre strikes the Big Big 3."},{"seq":2061,"day":19,"line":"Andre hits wolf 3 for 9."},{"seq":2062,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Andre."},{"seq":2063,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 4's attention SNAPS to Saul — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2064,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":2065,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2066,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits you for 6."},{"seq":2067,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 3's attention SNAPS to Saul — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2068,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":2069,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2070,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits you for 5."},{"seq":2071,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 2's Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":2072,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2073,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 2's Harass hits you for 5."},{"seq":2074,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 1's Harass finds Andre — no dodging it. (FLANKED +2)"},{"seq":2075,"day":19,"line":"Andre's gear absorbs 4."},{"seq":2076,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 1's Harass hits Andre for 5."},{"seq":2077,"day":19,"line":"Saul strikes the Big Big 2."},{"seq":2078,"day":19,"line":"Saul hits wolf 2 for 11."},{"seq":2079,"day":19,"line":"Andre strikes the Big Big 1."},{"seq":2080,"day":19,"line":"Andre hits wolf 1 for 9."},{"seq":2081,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds Saul — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2082,"day":19,"line":"Saul's gear absorbs 6."},{"seq":2083,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits Saul for 7."},{"seq":2084,"day":19,"line":"Too close. The wolf 3's attention SNAPS to Andre — proximity overrules patience."},{"seq":2085,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds Saul — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2086,"day":19,"line":"Saul's gear absorbs 6."},{"seq":2087,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits Saul for 7."},{"seq":2088,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 2's Harass finds Saul — no dodging it. (FLANKED +4)"},{"seq":2089,"day":19,"line":"Saul's gear absorbs 5."},{"seq":2090,"day":19,"line":"Saul takes the hit and runs — while running still works."},{"seq":2091,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 2's Harass hits Saul for 5."},{"seq":2092,"day":19,"line":"The Big Big 2 stalks closer. The pack circles — nips from the edge, never committing."},{"seq":2093,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 1's Harass finds Andre — no dodging it."},{"seq":2094,"day":19,"line":"Andre's gear absorbs 3."},{"seq":2095,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 1's Harass hits Andre for 4."},{"seq":2096,"day":19,"line":"Andre strikes the Big Big 2."},{"seq":2097,"day":19,"line":"Andre hits wolf 2 for 8."},{"seq":2098,"day":19,"line":"wolf 2 is hurt — and it goes quiet and clever. It stops rushing. It starts CHOOSING. Watch the spacing."},{"seq":2099,"day":19,"line":"It staggers — pain gets noticed. Its attention fixes on Andre."},{"seq":2100,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds Saul — no dodging it."},{"seq":2101,"day":19,"line":"Saul's gear absorbs 3."},{"seq":2102,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits Saul for 3."},{"seq":2103,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 3's Harass finds Andre — no dodging it."},{"seq":2104,"day":19,"line":"Andre's gear absorbs 3."},{"seq":2105,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 3's Harass hits Andre for 3."},{"seq":2106,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 1's Harass finds Andre — no dodging it."},{"seq":2107,"day":19,"line":"Andre's gear absorbs 3."},{"seq":2108,"day":19,"line":"Andre takes the hit and runs — while running still works."},{"seq":2109,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 1's Harass hits Andre for 3."},{"seq":2110,"day":19,"line":"💥 wolf 4's Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":2111,"day":19,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":2112,"day":19,"line":"Wolf 4's Harass hits you for 7."},{"seq":2113,"day":19,"line":"You go down."},{"seq":2114,"day":19,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. DeAndre Aquino is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2115,"day":19,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2116,"day":19,"line":"🕯️ DeAndre Aquino is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."},{"seq":2117,"day":19,"line":"What DeAndre kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body."},{"seq":2118,"day":19,"line":"\"DeAndre's gone.\" Harold looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not DeAndre.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."},{"seq":2119,"day":19,"line":"The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Andre blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."},{"seq":2120,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Sewing & Textiles (Level 1). Mend tears so they hold: backstitch, small stitches, match the grain."},{"seq":2121,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Reading People (Level 1). Microexpressions leak truth. Watch the eyes, not the mouth. People tell you who they are."},{"seq":2122,"day":19,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"seq":2123,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Tireless Stride (Level 1). You walk like water downhill — no wasted steps, no wasted breath. Every mile costs 15% less."},{"seq":2124,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 1). Most animals flee. Give them an escape route and they take it. Cornered animals fight."},{"seq":2125,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Reading Tracks (Level 1). Fresh tracks have sharp edges. Old tracks crumble. You can tell how recently something passed."},{"seq":2126,"day":19,"line":"🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\""},{"seq":2127,"day":19,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page: DeAndre Aquino, 19 days. The mantle passes to Andre Iyer."},{"seq":2128,"day":19,"line":"🪞 You wake up somebody else. Andre Iyer, 74 — a tailor. Their hands know different work now: Green Whisper."},{"seq":2129,"day":19,"line":"The village's quarrel was with DeAndre — and DeAndre is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers."},{"seq":2130,"day":19,"line":"The fire knew Andre before the Codex did — their name already carried weight here."},{"seq":2131,"day":19,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":2132,"day":19,"line":"Took Foraged food (dried)."},{"seq":2133,"day":19,"line":"You eat Foraged food (dried) (215 kcal)."},{"seq":2134,"day":19,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":2135,"day":19,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":2136,"day":19,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":2137,"day":19,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":2138,"day":19,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":2139,"day":19,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":2140,"day":19,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":2141,"day":19,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2142,"day":19,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2143,"day":19,"line":"📋 Harold — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2144,"day":19,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":2145,"day":19,"line":"Ivy keeps glancing at the treeline. \"Tell me you heard that too.\""},{"seq":2146,"day":19,"line":"👂 Overheard — Saul: \"The creek's lower than yesterday. Markedly.\""},{"seq":2147,"day":19,"line":"👂 Overheard — Ivy: \"Interesting. But what's the underlying pattern?\""},{"seq":2148,"day":19,"line":"👂 Ivy \"Hey — come here. You should hear this.\""},{"seq":2149,"day":19,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2150,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2151,"day":19,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 11L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2152,"day":19,"line":"💧 Harold returns with 4L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2153,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Harold about Sofia. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":2154,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ivy telling Saul about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2155,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Asantewaa about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":2156,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about Naran. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2157,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Harold telling Anel about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":2158,"day":19,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2159,"day":19,"line":"🩹 Ivy is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2160,"day":19,"line":"🩹 Chloe is still hurting (50 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2161,"day":19,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2162,"day":19,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2163,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2164,"day":19,"line":"Saul sticks close to the fire. \"Can I... just stay here a while? The dark's been loud today.\""},{"seq":2165,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2166,"day":19,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":2167,"day":19,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (341 logs now.)"},{"seq":2168,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Anel telling Harold about Naran. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":2169,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Chloe about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2170,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2171,"day":19,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2172,"day":19,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":2173,"day":19,"line":"🛟 Naran looks up from the fire. \"And now a raid, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":2174,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2175,"day":19,"line":"Saul eats from the pantry."},{"seq":2176,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2177,"day":19,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (55 stone now.)"},{"seq":2178,"day":19,"line":"Elif doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fish crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":2179,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Ivy about Naran. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":2180,"day":19,"line":"Yuki showed Elif the Huckleberry — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":2181,"day":19,"line":"🚶 Asantewaa is back — found Naran."},{"seq":2182,"day":19,"line":"Asantewaa is working the cookpot, tasting, adjusting."},{"seq":2183,"day":19,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2184,"day":19,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Asantewaa has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Murkcap — I put it down today.\" \"The gills begin to breathe — a sweet, wrong smell rolls out from under the cap. The air shimmers.\" \"The cap tilts. The stem creaks like a ship's mast. Get out from under it.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Harold asks \"So it bleeds.\" Anel asks \"Say that "},{"seq":2185,"day":19,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Anel has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Paparazzo — I put it down today.\" \"The flash charges — whine rising. When it fires, you freeze in place.\" \"Every shot refines its model — hit or miss. At 4, the money shot is unavoidable.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Elif mutters \"The fire feels smaller now.\" Asantewaa says quietly \"S"},{"seq":2186,"day":19,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Elif has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Flashbulb Moth — I put it down today.\" \"It lands. It folds its wings. The light in the clearing changes, like someone adjusting a lamp.\" \"It lets go of the air and simply... drifts. Somewhere else. Hard to predict.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Asantewaa mutters \"The fire feels smaller now"},{"seq":2187,"day":19,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2188,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2189,"day":19,"line":"💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2190,"day":19,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2191,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Anel telling Ivy about Asantewaa. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":2192,"day":19,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2193,"day":19,"line":"The path is washed out."},{"seq":2194,"day":19,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2195,"day":19,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× Spicebush, 10× Staghorn Sumac (900 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2196,"day":19,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2197,"day":19,"line":"While you were gone — 3 things you missed:"},{"seq":2198,"day":19,"line":"⚔️ Anel killed the Paparazzo with their party — 5 rounds, 50 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":2199,"day":19,"line":"💀 The Big Big killed Sofia in 4 rounds. The village mourns."},{"seq":2200,"day":19,"line":"⚔️ Elif killed the Flashbulb Moth with their party — 2 rounds, 8 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":2201,"day":19,"line":"You keep a day's food (900 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2202,"day":19,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2203,"day":19,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2204,"day":19,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2205,"day":19,"line":"📋 Harold — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2206,"day":19,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2207,"day":19,"line":"\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":2208,"day":19,"line":"\"Enough,\" Elif says. \"I want a say in how this village runs. A real say.\""},{"seq":2209,"day":19,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2210,"day":19,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":2211,"day":19,"line":"Anel looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":2212,"day":19,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2213,"day":19,"line":"Chloe leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Flashbulb Moth. Hit it while it folds. The Wing Flash only fires FORWARD — it must face you. Circle while it folds its wings and hit it before the wings open. It can't flash what's behind it.\""},{"seq":2214,"day":19,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Flashbulb Moth: Hit it while it folds. The Wing Flash only fires FORWARD — it must face you. Circle while it folds its wings and hit it before the wings open. It can't flash what's behind it. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":2215,"day":19,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Hit it while it folds — The Wing Flash only fires FORWARD — it must face you. Circle while it folds its wings and hit it before the wings open. It can't flash what's behind it."},{"seq":2216,"day":19,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2217,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Harold worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2218,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2219,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2220,"day":19,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2221,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Ivy about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":2222,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Naran about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":2223,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Naran about themself. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":2224,"day":19,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Big.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2225,"day":19,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2226,"day":19,"line":"Ivy came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":2227,"day":19,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":2228,"day":19,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Harold is calling it \"Loud-Eyes.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2229,"day":19,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2230,"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +2220 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2231,"day":19,"line":"Elif came back with 507 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2232,"day":19,"line":"Elif and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2233,"day":19,"line":"📓 Codex: Asantewaa taught Naran Reading People."},{"seq":2234,"day":19,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Harold is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2235,"day":19,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2236,"day":19,"line":"📖 The entry for Harold is finished. 2 deeds recorded. No more pages."},{"seq":2237,"day":19,"line":"📓 Codex: The old argument between Harold and Yuki ended — one of them is gone."},{"seq":2238,"day":20,"line":"— DAY 20 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2239,"day":20,"line":"👀 When the others traded stories about Denver, Yuki went quiet in a way that wasn't listening — more like realizing they had nothing true to trade."},{"seq":2240,"day":20,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":2241,"day":20,"line":"\"Cache by the hollow. Dried meat, clean water. I can't stay. — W.\""},{"seq":2242,"day":20,"line":"(373 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":2243,"day":20,"line":"💬 Chloe pulls you aside. \"I need to tell you something. Last night I... dreamed? No. I was AWAKE. And something spoke to me. Not the System — something else. It said: 'Tell the human to watch the northern treeline.' Then it was gone.\""},{"seq":2244,"day":20,"line":"(Chloe has been contacted by an alien player. They don't understand what happened. But they'll warn you when they dream again.)"},{"seq":2245,"day":20,"line":"◈ HAVEN — You've noticed: people cover for each other without being asked. The gaps close themselves."},{"seq":2246,"day":20,"line":"🔥 Asantewaa says it at the fire, not quite looking at Yuki: “Your trade story doesn’t add up. Someone had to say it.” The fire goes quiet in the way it does when someone’s decided to be brave."},{"seq":2247,"day":20,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2248,"day":20,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2249,"day":20,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2250,"day":20,"line":"📋 Saul — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2251,"day":20,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2252,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2253,"day":20,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2254,"day":20,"line":"💧 Saul returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2255,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2256,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Asantewaa is still hurting (38 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2257,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Ivy is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2258,"day":20,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2259,"day":20,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2260,"day":20,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2261,"day":20,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2262,"day":20,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2263,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +550 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2264,"day":20,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":2265,"day":20,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 7 wood. The pile grows. (345 logs now.)"},{"seq":2266,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2267,"day":20,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2268,"day":20,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2269,"day":20,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 20L left."},{"seq":2270,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 4 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2271,"day":20,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2272,"day":20,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":2273,"day":20,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Saul is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2274,"day":20,"line":"Elif is working the broom along the hall floor, slow and thorough."},{"seq":2275,"day":20,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2276,"day":20,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":2277,"day":20,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2278,"day":20,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2279,"day":20,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Sweeps Week is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2280,"day":20,"line":"Something moves out there — The Ugly Beast."},{"seq":2281,"day":20,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2282,"day":20,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2283,"day":20,"line":"It followed you. The Ugly Beast is here."},{"seq":2284,"day":20,"line":"Something moves out there — The Paparazzo."},{"seq":2285,"day":20,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2286,"day":20,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":2287,"day":20,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2288,"day":20,"line":"The Paparazzo stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2289,"day":20,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":2290,"day":20,"line":"⚔️ Yuki killed the Sweeps Week alone — 6 rounds, 21 taken. Word travels fast. Took Medfoam canister off the body. The village cheers."},{"seq":2291,"day":20,"line":"You keep a day's food (900 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2292,"day":20,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2293,"day":20,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2294,"day":20,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2295,"day":20,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2296,"day":20,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2297,"day":20,"line":"\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":2298,"day":20,"line":"📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2299,"day":20,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2300,"day":20,"line":"Recipe: Crossbow (Level 1). You have seen a crossbow. A bow on a stock, held at full draw by a catch."},{"seq":2301,"day":20,"line":"Recipe: Sharpened stick (Level 1). You have seen the shape: a stick, one end shaved to a point."},{"seq":2302,"day":20,"line":"Taken: Bark armor x1, Work Gloves x1, Crossbow x1, Good Boots x1, Sharpened stick x1, Chef's Knife x1."},{"seq":2303,"day":20,"line":"You take bark armor, work gloves, crossbow, good boots, sharpened stick, chef's knife from Harold. Your hands know what they did. (+18 trauma)"},{"seq":2304,"day":20,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":2305,"day":20,"line":"Ivy leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Paparazzo. Break line of sight before the fourth shot. Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies.\""},{"seq":2306,"day":20,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Paparazzo: Break line of sight before the fourth shot. Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":2307,"day":20,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Break line of sight before the fourth shot — Four shots is the whole fight — break line of sight before the fourth and the model starves. The EXCLUSIVE cannot be dodged, only prevented: move while the lens steadies."},{"seq":2308,"day":20,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2309,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2310,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2311,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Anel worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2312,"day":20,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2313,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Ivy about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":2314,"day":20,"line":"🍲 Naran is eating by the fire — not talking, just eating."},{"seq":2315,"day":20,"line":"🗣️ Saul to Chloe, by the fire: \"The pantry's the thing. We don't raise The Palisade on empty shelves — 7,500 of 14,000 kcal.\""},{"seq":2316,"day":20,"line":"That night, they bring DeAndre home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."},{"seq":2317,"day":20,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2318,"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +2030 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2319,"day":20,"line":"Naran came back with 453 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2320,"day":20,"line":"🔍 Chloe crouches over a bushy herb with serrated purple-green leaves on square stems, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":2321,"day":20,"line":"Chloe is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 24/100)"},{"seq":2322,"day":20,"line":"Asantewaa and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2323,"day":20,"line":"Elif and Anel lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2324,"day":20,"line":"Naran and Asantewaa lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2325,"day":20,"line":"✦ Naran has found something — Word of Mouth. Days of gossip_network and peacemaker side by side, and now they move as one. (word_of_mouth: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":2326,"day":20,"line":"📓 Codex: Chloe taught Ivy Gossip Network."},{"seq":2327,"day":21,"line":"— DAY 21 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2328,"day":21,"line":"On the carcass nearby, Flashbulb Moth (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost."},{"seq":2329,"day":21,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 42 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2330,"day":21,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2331,"day":21,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2332,"day":21,"line":"📋 Saul — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2333,"day":21,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":2334,"day":21,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2335,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 1 fish, +200 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2336,"day":21,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2337,"day":21,"line":"💧 Saul returns with 5L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2338,"day":21,"line":"💬 Elif whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":2339,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2340,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Asantewaa is still hurting (38 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2341,"day":21,"line":"Elif wanders off. \"I want to see what's out there.\""},{"seq":2342,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Ivy is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2343,"day":21,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2344,"day":21,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2345,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2346,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2347,"day":21,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":2348,"day":21,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (56 stone now.)"},{"seq":2349,"day":21,"line":"Naran is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":2350,"day":21,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2351,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2352,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2353,"day":21,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (347 logs now.)"},{"seq":2354,"day":21,"line":"Elif stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fish crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":2355,"day":21,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Anel about themself. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2356,"day":21,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Chloe telling Saul about Elif. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2357,"day":21,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2358,"day":21,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Yuki has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Sweeps Week — I put it down today.\" \"The grass stops moving the way wind moves it. Two amber eyes — then the whole striped avalanche.\" \"It circles, unhurried. It has seen this episode before — and it knows how it ends.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Anel mutters \"And you're still standing.\""},{"seq":2359,"day":21,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":2360,"day":21,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":2361,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2362,"day":21,"line":"💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2363,"day":21,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2364,"day":21,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":2365,"day":21,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Muscadine Grapes (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2366,"day":21,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2367,"day":21,"line":"You keep a day's food (1440 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2368,"day":21,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2369,"day":21,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2370,"day":21,"line":"⬆️ Green Whisper deepened to L2! Plants lean toward you."},{"seq":2371,"day":21,"line":"\"We didn't even explain that part! You figured it out yourself! That's the good stuff! The gamblers are thrilled!\""},{"seq":2372,"day":21,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2373,"day":21,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2374,"day":21,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2375,"day":21,"line":"📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2376,"day":21,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Elif doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":2377,"day":21,"line":"Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\""},{"seq":2378,"day":21,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2379,"day":21,"line":"Recipe: Fire-hardened spear (Level 1). You have seen a fire-hardened spear. The tip is black, polished, hard."},{"seq":2380,"day":21,"line":"Taken: Fire-hardened spear x1, Hand Saw x1, Good Boots x1, Knit Cap x1, Flannel Shirt x1, The Ledger x1."},{"seq":2381,"day":21,"line":"You take fire-hardened spear, hand saw, good boots, knit cap, flannel shirt, the ledger from Sofia. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)"},{"seq":2382,"day":21,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":2383,"day":21,"line":"Anel leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Sweeps Week. Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow.\""},{"seq":2384,"day":21,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Sweeps Week: Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":2385,"day":21,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never show it your back — FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow."},{"seq":2386,"day":21,"line":"You eat Muscadine Grapes and Staghorn Sumac (660 kcal)."},{"seq":2387,"day":21,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2388,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2389,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2390,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Anel worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2391,"day":21,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2392,"day":21,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Asantewaa telling Anel about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2393,"day":21,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2394,"day":21,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2395,"day":21,"line":"🐪 A trader from the downriver village walks into Haven, pack heavy, smile practiced. River-mud on their boots, river-gossip on their tongue."},{"seq":2396,"day":21,"line":"\"Heard you people eat REGULARLY now,\" they say. \"Heard the sky talks to you. I have news — some of it might even be true.\""},{"seq":2397,"day":21,"line":"Feed a guest: about 600 kcal from the stores. Trading takes a full day-part. Rudeness is free — but the river remembers. (They'll be here till dusk.)"},{"seq":2398,"day":21,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2399,"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +2360 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2400,"day":21,"line":"Naran set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":2401,"day":21,"line":"Anel came back with 394 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2402,"day":21,"line":"Asantewaa and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2403,"day":21,"line":"✦ Chloe has found something — String Wall. Days of evidence_board and eagle_eye side by side, and now they move as one. (string_wall: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":2404,"day":21,"line":"🤒 Ivy is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2405,"day":21,"line":"🤒 Chloe is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2406,"day":21,"line":"🛟 Naran stands up by the fire. \"People are going down and the tents are filling — we do something or we don't, but we decide. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":2407,"day":21,"line":"\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""},{"seq":2408,"day":21,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Naran adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":2409,"day":21,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":2410,"day":21,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":2411,"day":22,"line":"— DAY 22 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2412,"day":22,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":2413,"day":22,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2414,"day":22,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2415,"day":22,"line":"📋 Saul — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2416,"day":22,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":2417,"day":22,"line":"Equipped Fire-hardened spear (ranged)."},{"seq":2418,"day":22,"line":"Unequipped Sharpened stick."},{"seq":2419,"day":22,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2420,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2421,"day":22,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2422,"day":22,"line":"💧 Saul returns with 4L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2423,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2424,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Asantewaa is still hurting (38 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2425,"day":22,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2426,"day":22,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2427,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2428,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2429,"day":22,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":2430,"day":22,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (58 stone now.)"},{"seq":2431,"day":22,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2432,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2433,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2434,"day":22,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (353 logs now.)"},{"seq":2435,"day":22,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":2436,"day":22,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Saul is calling it \"Ugly-Eyes.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2437,"day":22,"line":"🧭 Elif is back from the west. \"It's... different out there. I'll tell you about it.\" (Ask them what they saw.)"},{"seq":2438,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2439,"day":22,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2440,"day":22,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":2441,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2442,"day":22,"line":"💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2443,"day":22,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2444,"day":22,"line":"Something moves out there — tick."},{"seq":2445,"day":22,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2446,"day":22,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2447,"day":22,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Spicebush, 10× Staghorn Sumac (780 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2448,"day":22,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2449,"day":22,"line":"The Big-Eyes stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2450,"day":22,"line":"You keep a day's food (1560 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2451,"day":22,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2452,"day":22,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2453,"day":22,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2454,"day":22,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2455,"day":22,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":2456,"day":22,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2457,"day":22,"line":"📋 Anel — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2458,"day":22,"line":"📋 Elif — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2459,"day":22,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2460,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2461,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2462,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Anel worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2463,"day":22,"line":"🍲 Elif cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2464,"day":22,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Beard Moss. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":2465,"day":22,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Elif — Craft 1. Three offers; they took Beard Moss. Earned, chosen. (beard_moss: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2466,"day":22,"line":"📓 Codex: Elif chose Beard Moss (beard_moss) at Craft 1."},{"seq":2467,"day":22,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2468,"day":22,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":2469,"day":22,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2470,"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +2100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2471,"day":22,"line":"Asantewaa came back with 514 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2472,"day":22,"line":"Asantewaa and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2473,"day":22,"line":"Chloe and Elif lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2474,"day":22,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 1 of hunger."},{"seq":2475,"day":22,"line":"🤒 Yuki is on the mend — the fever broke."},{"seq":2476,"day":22,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Anel is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2477,"day":22,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2478,"day":22,"line":"📖 The entry for Anel is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2479,"day":22,"line":"ANEL — GONE. 1 open question closed unanswered."},{"seq":2480,"day":23,"line":"— DAY 23 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2481,"day":23,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":2482,"day":23,"line":"\"I left bandages where the path bends. Don't thank me. Just live.\""},{"seq":2483,"day":23,"line":"(349 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":2484,"day":23,"line":"💬 Chloe says: \"They said you're doing well. It sounded... proud? Can they feel proud?\""},{"seq":2485,"day":23,"line":"🛟 Naran looks up from the fire. \"And now hunger, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":2486,"day":23,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+5 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2487,"day":23,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2488,"day":23,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2489,"day":23,"line":"📋 Saul — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2490,"day":23,"line":"Elif folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":2491,"day":23,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Saul sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Saul.)"},{"seq":2492,"day":23,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2493,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2494,"day":23,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2495,"day":23,"line":"💧 Saul returns with 4L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2496,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Asantewaa is still hurting (34 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2497,"day":23,"line":"Elif heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\""},{"seq":2498,"day":23,"line":"Naran heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":2499,"day":23,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2500,"day":23,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2501,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2502,"day":23,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2503,"day":23,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2504,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2505,"day":23,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":2506,"day":23,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (59 stone now.)"},{"seq":2507,"day":23,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Chloe about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2508,"day":23,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":2509,"day":23,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Saul is calling it \"Big Loud.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2510,"day":23,"line":"💬 Saul whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":2511,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (4 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2512,"day":23,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2513,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2514,"day":23,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 22L left."},{"seq":2515,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2516,"day":23,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2517,"day":23,"line":"Elif doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fish crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":2518,"day":23,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Saul telling Naran about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2519,"day":23,"line":"🌿 Elif returns from foraging the wilds: +567 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2520,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Saul is still hurting (4 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2521,"day":23,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2522,"day":23,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2523,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2524,"day":23,"line":"💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2525,"day":23,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2526,"day":23,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2527,"day":23,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2528,"day":23,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2529,"day":23,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":2530,"day":23,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2531,"day":23,"line":"The Big-Eyes stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2532,"day":23,"line":"You keep a day's food (1560 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2533,"day":23,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2534,"day":23,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2535,"day":23,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2536,"day":23,"line":"📋 Saul — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2537,"day":23,"line":"\"Got it,\" Elif says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":2538,"day":23,"line":"Elif steps closer. \"We need to talk. About who's actually running things here.\""},{"seq":2539,"day":23,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2540,"day":23,"line":"📋 Elif — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2541,"day":23,"line":"📋 Ivy — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2542,"day":23,"line":"Taken: Canvas Pants x1, Stone knife x1, Bark armor x1, Snare wire x1."},{"seq":2543,"day":23,"line":"You take canvas pants, stone knife, bark armor, snare wire from Anel. Your hands know what they did. (+8 trauma)"},{"seq":2544,"day":23,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":2545,"day":23,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2546,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Saul worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2547,"day":23,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Echo Location. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":2548,"day":23,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Saul — Field 1. Three offers; they took Echo Location. Earned, chosen. (echo_location: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2549,"day":23,"line":"📓 Codex: Saul chose Echo Location (echo_location) at Field 1."},{"seq":2550,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2551,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2552,"day":23,"line":"🍲 Ivy cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2553,"day":23,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2554,"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +2060 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2555,"day":23,"line":"Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Naran goes to sit with them."},{"seq":2556,"day":23,"line":"Saul came back with 579 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2557,"day":23,"line":"Asantewaa and Saul lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2558,"day":23,"line":"Ivy and Elif lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2559,"day":23,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Saul is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2560,"day":23,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2561,"day":23,"line":"📖 The entry for Saul is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2562,"day":23,"line":"💀 Saul starved. Slowly. Somebody keeps looking at the door, like they're still going to walk in."},{"seq":2563,"day":23,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 2 of hunger."},{"seq":2564,"day":23,"line":"✦ Naran has found something — Peacemaker's Voice. Days of diplomat and mediator side by side, and now they move as one. (peacemakers_voice: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":2565,"day":23,"line":"🤒 Andre made it through the worst of it — the fever finally broke."},{"seq":2566,"day":24,"line":"— DAY 24 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2567,"day":24,"line":"◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Thornfield bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Beloved. Strangers ask for your blessing. You don't know what to do with that."},{"seq":2568,"day":24,"line":"📊 THE STANDINGS — Haven sits 1st of 4. Haven leads. The audience has a favorite, and it's you."},{"seq":2569,"day":24,"line":"Hunger is doing its slow work on everyone. The lines get thinner every hungry day."},{"seq":2570,"day":24,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 36 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2571,"day":24,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2572,"day":24,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2573,"day":24,"line":"Asantewaa hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":2574,"day":24,"line":"🌱 Ivy works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2575,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2576,"day":24,"line":"💧 Elif returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2577,"day":24,"line":"🩹 Asantewaa is still hurting (30 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2578,"day":24,"line":"🌿 Naran returns from foraging the wilds: +569 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2579,"day":24,"line":"Elif is stitching a tear shut by the door light, squinting at every stitch."},{"seq":2580,"day":24,"line":"📖 Naran is walking Elif through a shrubby tree with smooth peeling bark and round yellow-green fragrant fruit — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour."},{"seq":2581,"day":24,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2582,"day":24,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":2583,"day":24,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2584,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2585,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2586,"day":24,"line":"💧 Elif eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":2587,"day":24,"line":"🪵 Elif hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (352 logs now.)"},{"seq":2588,"day":24,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2589,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2590,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 3 fish, +450 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2591,"day":24,"line":"🪨 Elif pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (61 stone now.)"},{"seq":2592,"day":24,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2593,"day":24,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2594,"day":24,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":2595,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2596,"day":24,"line":"💛 You hold Seed packet. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2597,"day":24,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2598,"day":24,"line":"Something moves out there — The Moderator."},{"seq":2599,"day":24,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":2600,"day":24,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Muscadine Grapes (540 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2601,"day":24,"line":"(The snare wire becomes the snare — improvised, 2 uses.)"},{"seq":2602,"day":24,"line":"You set a Snare here. Check it tomorrow."},{"seq":2603,"day":24,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2604,"day":24,"line":"You keep a day's food (1920 kcal) and unload 180 kcal into Haven's pantry."},{"seq":2605,"day":24,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2606,"day":24,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2607,"day":24,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":2608,"day":24,"line":"📋 Asantewaa — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2609,"day":24,"line":"Elif mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":2610,"day":24,"line":"📋 Elif — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2611,"day":24,"line":"📋 Chloe — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2612,"day":24,"line":"📋 Ivy — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2613,"day":24,"line":"Elif watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":2614,"day":24,"line":"You eat Muscadine Grapes and Staghorn Sumac (600 kcal)."},{"seq":2615,"day":24,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2616,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Asantewaa worked the creek — 2 fish, +245 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2617,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Elif worked the creek — 4 fish, +700 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2618,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Chloe worked the creek — 2 fish, +245 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2619,"day":24,"line":"🍲 Ivy cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2620,"day":24,"line":"The village debates a weathered nurse. Split room. Some for, some against. It's your call. (55% for.)"},{"seq":2621,"day":24,"line":"📨 The village didn't wait for you. a weathered nurse was vouched for around the fire — they're walking."},{"seq":2622,"day":24,"line":"Accepted. a weathered nurse is walking. They'll reach Haven in a few days — membership starts when they arrive, but the village already counts them."},{"seq":2623,"day":24,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":2624,"day":24,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Loud-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2625,"day":24,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2626,"day":24,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Don't-Look.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2627,"day":24,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2628,"day":24,"line":"📺 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"We have designed a trial JUST for you. Based on our observations. Which are extensive. And flattering.\""},{"seq":2629,"day":24,"line":"It lists your recent deeds back at you — the good ones, mostly, with the embarrassing ones edited into heroics. It has been WATCHING. (Flattering.)"},{"seq":2630,"day":24,"line":"  1. Trial of the Long Stalk — Take game with patience, not noise."},{"seq":2631,"day":24,"line":"  2. Trial of Stone — Endure. That is the whole trial. Endure."},{"seq":2632,"day":24,"line":"  3. Trial of the First Ember — Make fire the old way, from nothing."},{"seq":2633,"day":24,"line":"Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets."},{"seq":2634,"day":24,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2635,"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +2409 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2636,"day":24,"line":"Asantewaa set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":2637,"day":24,"line":"🔍 Ivy has been turning over a bushy plant with big trumpet flowers, white or purple, and spiny round pods for days — today it clicked. \"I know this one now. Look — see the leaves?\""},{"seq":2638,"day":24,"line":"Ivy: \"giant rhubarb-like leaves, round burrs, first-year = leaf rosette with no stalk is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\""},{"seq":2639,"day":24,"line":"Ivy is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 20/100)"},{"seq":2640,"day":24,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 3 of hunger."},{"seq":2641,"day":24,"line":"Haven couldn't hold. On the third hungry day, people started walking — in different directions. The scattering, again."},{"seq":2642,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: Asantewaa taught Ivy Generous Heart."},{"seq":2643,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: Naran taught Chloe Tireless Stride."},{"seq":2644,"day":24,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Chloe is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2645,"day":24,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2646,"day":24,"line":"📖 The entry for Chloe is finished. No more pages."}]}
