 remember the Hunting spear at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","You remember the Canvas Pants at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","🌙 Something went missing from the pantry in the night. A man, maybe 60s was seen near the stores, but no one can prove anything.","A man, maybe 40s will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 A man, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part.","A person, maybe 30s mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\"","📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","\"Daniela,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Daniela.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Daniela).","\"Oscar,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Oscar.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Oscar).","\"Caleb,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Caleb.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Caleb).","You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":2,"gameDay":2,"pantryKcal":38680,"morningPantryKcal":38680,"freshKcal":38680,"freshDays":5.074633341402482,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 A man, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part.","📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Daniela doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking.","\"Otto,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Otto.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Otto).","\"Minh,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Minh.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Minh)."]},{"loopDay":3,"gameDay":4,"pantryKcal":30150,"morningPantryKcal":32800,"freshKcal":30150,"freshDays":5.9574485270920965,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to wetland.\n— Still water, cattails —\nCattails mean starch. Still water means boil it first — the Codex insists.","Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet.","Movement — a broad flat-tailed beaver, working the bank.","👁 The tail-slap ends the hunt — it dives and warns the whole creek. Strike before the tail rises, or trap the slide.","Unfamiliar unknown roots — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","Unfamiliar unknown shoots — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","Journal: Where the creek spreads out, the starch grows.","Journal updated: dusty-green diamond leaves with white mealy underside, grows in disturbed soil grows here too — better than small tree with mitten-shaped leaves (three shapes), spicy root smell.","Journal updated: Pawpaw grows here too — better than dusty-green diamond leaves with white mealy underside, grows in disturbed soil.","📓 Journal: you UNDERSTAND Green Thumb, Literally. It resonates with: something unnamed, something unnamed.","You work the patch: 3× Pawpaw — and 4× unknown roots, 4× unknown shoots you can't name yet. This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (240 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","Someone by the fire nods at the counter. \"We pool food here. Keep what you need for the road — the rest feeds everyone, once it's food.\"","Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you.","You walk back into Haven. 3 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","★ IDENTIFIED: Sassafras. Mitten-shaped leaves — three shapes on one tree. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","💡 Sassafras. The small tree with mitten-shaped leaves (three shapes), spicy root smell you've been looking at for days finally has a name, and now you'll never unsee it.","A woman, maybe 60s was watching. Now they know Sassafras too.","Minh spreads the bag on a flat stone and starts naming: Sassafras ★.","You watch closely — Sassafras is yours now too.","The bag is empty. Everything named.","Minh picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)","You sow Pawpaw: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You break ground behind the hall — bed 3 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 4 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling A man, maybe 50s about himself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater.","You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 60s telling A woman, maybe 20s about A man, maybe 50s. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions.","You catch fragments by the fire — Caleb telling A woman, maybe 30s about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater.","💧 A woman, maybe 30s returns with water: +2 clean.","🍲 Daniela is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters.","🧳 A traveler passed through yesterday, talking about a village to the northeast called Emberhold. The region is bigger than your fire.","🗣️ A man, maybe 50s to Minh, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 59 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\"","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","Minh and A man, maybe 60s are comparing scars like trading cards.","A person, maybe 50s spends the afternoon with the dusty-green diamond leaves with white mealy underside, grows in disturbed soil — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. Edible, but it argues on the way down. The fire's verdict: food, carefully. Small amounts.","From the lumped bag: Lamb's Quarters — named, and out.","★ IDENTIFIED: Lamb's Quarters. Dusty-green leaves, white powder underneath. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","💡 You see it again in your mind: dusty-green diamond leaves with white mealy underside, grows in disturbed soil. A person, maybe 50s's words land on the memory like a label. Lamb's Quarters. Of course.","Caleb was watching. Now they know Lamb's Quarters too.","The Journal notes it: Lamb's Quarters — edible, carefully. (A person, maybe 50s tested it.)","Daniela came back with 540 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 270 kcal in, 270 kcal eaten at the fire.","Daniela and Oscar lingered over the fire together.","Ruth and Adil lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Benoit watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\"","📓 Journal: the man in his 50s taught Minh Camp Cooking.","📓 Journal: the person in their 50s taught the woman in her 20s Mediation.","— DAY 4 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Overnight, unknown shoots went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies.","Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last.","The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Sassafras — named and noted.","👀 Someone asks the man in his 60s, the veterinarian a shop-talk question about veterinarian work. The pause before the answer is long enough to hear.","📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A man, maybe 60s).","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","📋 A man, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part.","Daniela mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\"","Daniela plants themself in front of you. \"This isn't working. You know it, I know it. Say it out loud.\"","📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","You eat Pawpaw (80 kcal).","The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."]},{"loopDay":4,"gameDay":4,"pantryKcal":30000,"morningPantryKcal":30150,"freshKcal":30000,"freshDays":5.927809479693629,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to wetland.","You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 60s telling Otto about Oscar. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nA woodpecker works somewhere you can't see. Down here it smells of mushrooms and cold shade.","Unfamiliar unknown nuts — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","A sturdy stick (crafting material).","Journal: Deep shade. The floor keeps its secrets.","A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 9× unknown nuts. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Oscar eats from the pantry.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you.","You walk back into Haven. 5 Codex entries. The 