r.\n— Under the canopy —\nMushrooms thumb up through the duff in a ring — a fairy ring, old as the path. You step around it, not through it. Some rules are older than knowledge.","You see smoke on the horizon. Emberhold — 11 people, 5 days in. fishing folk, by the look of it. They know 2 plants — 2 new to you. They've been here the whole time.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nSaplings push up through last year's deadfall, racing each other for the light. The forest never stops trying.","Something moves out there — the absence of sound, shaped like wings.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to thicket.\n— Thick brush —\nThe brush closes behind you like water. You learn to move sideways, leading with a shoulder.","Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","You also take some vine (crafting material).","You also take some vine (crafting material).","Journal: Edge habitat. Berries grow where the light gets in.","A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 4× unknown berries. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to forest floor.","The Snare comes apart in your hands. The materials are wasted. (craft failed)","...and then it lands: A person, maybe 50s speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience.","\"Adil,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Adil.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Adil).","Nothing edible. (unknown berries — not food yet: identify it first — test cautiously from your pack, or sort it at camp.)"]},{"loopDay":6,"gameDay":6,"pantryKcal":28495,"morningPantryKcal":28495,"freshKcal":28495,"freshDays":6.472191083630422,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"a