TER LEARNED — The Living Wire: Get OUT of the water. When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Get OUT of the water — When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek.","✨ Ability gained: Green Thumb, Literally (L1). Gather 50% more food from plants. Ask the Plants reveals what grows in the area, once a day. Cultivate growing Haven beds: 200 kcal, once per bed each day. Higher levels accelerate growth further.","\"The plants lean toward you. They're gossiping. You're learning to listen.\"","\"We've been watching you figure things out all week! This one's on us — a head start! But the REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\"","You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)","You eat Lamb's Quarters, Pawpaw, and Sassafras (410 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":10,"gameDay":10,"pantryKcal":22850,"morningPantryKcal":22850,"freshKcal":22850,"freshDays":7.248740398187528,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":11,"sayLines":["Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nMushrooms thumb up through the duff in a ring — a fairy ring, old as the path. You step around it, not through it. Some rules are older than knowledge.","Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet.","Movement — a chipmunk, cheeks already full.","👁 Spook it and it's down a hole you never saw. Block the burrow mouth, or hunt it in the open where the hole can't help.","You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Caleb about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do.","Travel 