28,"pantryKcal":0,"morningPantryKcal":0,"freshKcal":0,"freshDays":0,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":12,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":5,"sayLines":["💛 You hold Mixtape. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","Travel 1 tile to wetland.","📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Loud-Eyes is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.","Something moves out there — The Paparazzo.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.","It followed you. The Paparazzo is here.","Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods.","Travel 2 tiles to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","While you were gone — one thing you missed:","⚔️ Jonas killed the Loud-Eyes with their party — 2 rounds, 8 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers.","You keep a day's food (640 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 23 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Aria — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Benoit — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1.","Taken: Work Gloves x1, Medfoam canister x1, Hand drill x1.","You take work gloves, medfoam canister, hand drill from Caleb. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Good Boots x1, Hardlight knife x1, Pitch torch x1, Tracker's Blind x1.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Work Gloves x1, Kitchen knife x1, Multitool x1.","✨ Ability gained: Pocket Sand (L1). Throw sand in eyes. Blinds for 2 rounds. (You always have sand. Don't ask where.)","\"SAND! In the eyes! It's in YOUR pocket! How?! We don't know! But it's there!\"","\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\""]}],"sayLines":[{"seq":0,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 2). Predators test: they approach, watch, decide. Prey freezes or bolts. Learn which you're looking at."},{"seq":1,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Wire Snares (Level 2). Set the loop at head height for the target species. Anchor it solid. Camouflage the wire."},{"seq":2,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Tripwire (Level 2). Barbed wire. The prone monster also bleeds."},{"seq":3,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Tainted Bait (Level 1). Your bait is tainted — traps catch 50% more. (The poison’s in the bait, not your hands. Mostly.)"},{"seq":4,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Reading Tracks (Level 1). Fresh tracks have sharp edges. Old tracks crumble. You can tell how recently something passed."},{"seq":5,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your old life taught you things. 5 skills from your past — check your Journal."},{"seq":6,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: knap a Stone knife (stone + vine) — the oldest tool there is. Find the stone."},{"seq":7,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: weave cloth (3 plant fiber — strip it from cleared brush), and build a Water Filter (cloth + charcoal from fire ashes). Dirty water doesn't have to stay dirty."},{"seq":8,"day":1,"line":"You wake up with dirt in your mouth and blood on your hands that isn't yours. The sky is the wrong color — not sunset-wrong, wound-wrong. Anh Jablonski. Exterminator. From Columbus, Ohio. That was yesterday. This is now. You have: Energy Bar Wrapper, Trail compass, Wedding ring, Daughter's Drawing, Knife roll. That's everything you own in this world. Haven. Twelve people. The fire is lit. The star"},{"seq":9,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 30s: \"Don't bother picking around the tents. Walk out. The land feeds people who go looking.\""},{"seq":10,"day":1,"line":"📓 Journal: Food won't come to Haven. Walk past the treeline — learn what grows out there, bring it back, and get it named at camp."},{"seq":11,"day":1,"line":"You tell the others you're heading out. Someone nods. \"Come back before dark.\""},{"seq":12,"day":1,"line":"— DAY 1 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":13,"day":1,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 24L left."},{"seq":14,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":15,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":16,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 20s, with a limp heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":17,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":18,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":19,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s sets out to find A person, maybe 50s. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":20,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 40s heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":21,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":22,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":23,"day":1,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":24,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 50s sets out to find A woman, maybe 20s. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":25,"day":1,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":26,"day":1,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":27,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":28,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":29,"day":1,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":30,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":31,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":32,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 50s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":33,"day":1,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":34,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 20s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":35,"day":1,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":36,"day":1,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":37,"day":1,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":38,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":39,"day":1,"line":"You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."},{"seq":40,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":41,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":42,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":43,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 20s, with a limp returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":44,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 40s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":45,"day":1,"line":"🚶 A woman, maybe 60s is back — found A person, maybe 50s."},{"seq":46,"day":1,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 40s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":47,"day":1,"line":"\"Hey.\" A person, maybe 40s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 40s.)"},{"seq":48,"day":1,"line":"Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell."},{"seq":49,"day":1,"line":"🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."},{"seq":50,"day":1,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":51,"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":52,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 30s and A woman, maybe 60s are comparing scars like trading cards."},{"seq":53,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 50s came back with 502 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":54,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 50s: \"The white umbrella flowers over hollow purple-streaked stems in the marsh patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\""},{"seq":55,"day":1,"line":"Oscar and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":56,"day":1,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":57,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Hunting spear at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":58,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Canvas Pants at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":59,"day":2,"line":"— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":60,"day":2,"line":"🌙 Something went missing from the pantry in the night. A man, maybe 60s was seen near the stores, but no one can prove anything."},{"seq":61,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 40s will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":62,"day":2,"line":"You step into the Haven hall."},{"seq":63,"day":2,"line":"📋 A man, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":64,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":65,"day":2,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":66,"day":2,"line":"(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"},{"seq":67,"day":2,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":68,"day":2,"line":"\"Daniela,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Daniela.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":69,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Daniela)."},{"seq":70,"day":2,"line":"\"Oscar,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Oscar.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":71,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Oscar)."},{"seq":72,"day":2,"line":"\"Caleb,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Caleb.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":73,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Caleb)."},{"seq":74,"day":2,"line":"You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."},{"seq":75,"day":2,"line":"It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."},{"seq":76,"day":2,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":77,"day":2,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":78,"day":2,"line":"Oscar looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":79,"day":2,"line":"Equipped Hunting spear (ranged)."},{"seq":80,"day":2,"line":"Recipe: Hunting spear (Level 1). You have seen a hunting spear. Longer than a man, stone at the killing end."},{"seq":81,"day":2,"line":"Equipped Canvas Pants (legs)."},{"seq":82,"day":2,"line":"📋 Caleb wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"seq":83,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" A man, maybe 50s sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A man, maybe 50s.)"},{"seq":84,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A woman, maybe 60s: \"Hmm. That doesn't add up. Let me think it through out loud.\""},{"seq":85,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Caleb: \"Yeah. Yeah, okay. That's solid.\""},{"seq":86,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A person, maybe 40s: \"Something's been at the pantry. Not an animal — the jars were moved, not broken.\""},{"seq":87,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Daniela: \"Okay — what's the first step?\""},{"seq":88,"day":2,"line":"🌿 Caleb checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":89,"day":2,"line":"🪵 Caleb hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (15 logs now.)"},{"seq":90,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":91,"day":2,"line":"🪨 A person, maybe 60s pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":92,"day":2,"line":"Oscar heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":93,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":94,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":95,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":96,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":97,"day":2,"line":"🚶 A man, maybe 50s is back — found A woman, maybe 20s."},{"seq":98,"day":2,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":99,"day":2,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":100,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":101,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":102,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Caleb sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Caleb.)"},{"seq":103,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Daniela: \"We need more firewood before dark. Who's with me?\""},{"seq":104,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A person, maybe 60s: \"Yeah. Yeah, okay. That's solid.\""},{"seq":105,"day":2,"line":"👂 A person, maybe 60s \"You. Yeah, you. What do you make of this?\""},{"seq":106,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 20s telling A woman, maybe 60s about A person, maybe 60s. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":107,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":108,"day":2,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":109,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":110,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":111,"day":2,"line":"Daniela eats from the pantry."},{"seq":112,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" A person, maybe 40s sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 40s.)"},{"seq":113,"day":2,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":114,"day":2,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":115,"day":2,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 50s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":116,"day":2,"line":"🍲 Daniela is eating by the fire — not talking, just eating."},{"seq":117,"day":2,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":118,"day":2,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":119,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":120,"day":2,"line":"You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."},{"seq":121,"day":2,"line":"You step into the Haven hall."},{"seq":122,"day":2,"line":"📋 A man, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":123,"day":2,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":124,"day":2,"line":"Daniela doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":125,"day":2,"line":"\"Otto,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Otto.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":126,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Otto)."},{"seq":127,"day":2,"line":"\"Minh,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Minh.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":128,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Minh)."},{"seq":129,"day":2,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":130,"day":2,"line":"🪵 A man, maybe 60s hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (19 logs now.)"},{"seq":131,"day":2,"line":"💧 Otto eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":132,"day":2,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":133,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s telling Otto about A woman, maybe 60s. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":134,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 20s telling Oscar about A woman, maybe 60s. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":135,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Daniela about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":136,"day":2,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Daniela about Oscar. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":137,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":138,"day":2,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 20s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":139,"day":2,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":140,"day":2,"line":"🍲 Minh is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":141,"day":2,"line":"🧳 A traveler passed through yesterday, talking about a village to the northeast called Thornfield. The region is bigger than your fire."},{"seq":142,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: A traveler passed through yesterday, talking about a village to the northeast called Thornfield."},{"seq":143,"day":2,"line":"🛖 Three days of raising beams, and the longhouse stands — a real roof, a real hearth, room to grow. Someone carves the date into the center post. The village feels bigger already."},{"seq":144,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: The Longhouse raised. Population cap now 16."},{"seq":145,"day":2,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":146,"day":2,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":147,"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":148,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 50s paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":149,"day":2,"line":"🔍 A crouches over floating rosettes of leaves; under them, black horned nuts, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":150,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 20s is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 72/100)"},{"seq":151,"day":2,"line":"🍽️ Benoit leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\""},{"seq":152,"day":3,"line":"— DAY 3 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":153,"day":3,"line":"👀 Oscar pronounced a Denver place-name the way someone reads it off a map for the first time. Nobody from there says it that way."},{"seq":154,"day":3,"line":"📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (Oscar)."},{"seq":155,"day":3,"line":"👀 the man in his 60s, the veterinarian starts a story with \"back when I was a veterinarian...\" then corrects to something else mid-sentence. The correction is worse than the slip."},{"seq":156,"day":3,"line":"📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A man, maybe 60s)."},{"seq":157,"day":3,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+3 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 300 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":158,"day":3,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":159,"day":3,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":160,"day":3,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":161,"day":3,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":162,"day":3,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":163,"day":3,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":164,"day":3,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":165,"day":3,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":166,"day":3,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":167,"day":3,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":168,"day":3,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":169,"day":3,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":170,"day":3,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":171,"day":3,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":172,"day":3,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":173,"day":3,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":174,"day":3,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":175,"day":3,"line":"Otto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":176,"day":3,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Daniela doesn't wait for an answer. \"We need to discuss how things are run here.\" (Talk to Daniela.)"},{"seq":177,"day":3,"line":"👂 Overheard — A woman, maybe 60s: \"Hmm. That doesn't add up. Let me think it through out loud.\""},{"seq":178,"day":3,"line":"👂 Overheard — Caleb: \"Us. Yeah. I'll drink to that — water, but still.\""},{"seq":179,"day":3,"line":"👂 Caleb \"Don't just stand there — you've got opinions, right?\""},{"seq":180,"day":3,"line":"🌿 Caleb checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":181,"day":3,"line":"🪨 Caleb pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 