ntries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":234,"day":3,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Sassafras. Mitten-shaped leaves — three shapes on one tree. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":235,"day":3,"line":"💡 Sassafras. The small tree with mitten-shaped leaves (three shapes), spicy root smell you've been looking at for days finally has a name, and now you'll never unsee it."},{"seq":236,"day":3,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s was watching. Now they know Sassafras too."},{"seq":237,"day":3,"line":"Minh spreads the bag on a flat stone and starts naming: Sassafras ★."},{"seq":238,"day":3,"line":"You watch closely — Sassafras is yours now too."},{"seq":239,"day":3,"line":"The bag is empty. Everything named."},{"seq":240,"day":3,"line":"Minh picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":241,"day":3,"line":"You sow Pawpaw: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":242,"day":3,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 3 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":243,"day":3,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 4 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":244,"day":3,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling A man, maybe 50s about himself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":245,"day":3,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 60s telling A woman, maybe 20s about A man, maybe 50s. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":246,"day":3,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Caleb telling A woman, maybe 30s about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":247,"day":3,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 30s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":248,"day":3,"line":"🍲 Daniela is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like