":7,"line":"Overnight, unknown berries went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":516,"day":7,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":517,"day":7,"line":"👀 Oscar was talking about home — then stopped mid-sentence, recalibrated, and said \"Denver\" just a fraction too deliberately. Whatever home is, it isn't where that sentence started."},{"seq":518,"day":7,"line":"📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (Oscar)."},{"seq":519,"day":7,"line":"Your stomach is a fist. Eat — anything real, now."},{"seq":520,"day":7,"line":"Dawn. You wake stiff and half-frozen. (-28 health, restless night. Your sleeping body burned less — 54 kcal conserved. The cold got in — no healing, and it took its cut. (Sleeping unsheltered in a cold snap is a mistake you only make once.))"},{"seq":521,"day":7,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":522,"day":7,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":523,"day":7,"line":"Need a fire to boil water."},{"seq":524,"day":7,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":525,"day":7,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":526,"day":7,"line":"🌿 Daniela checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":527,"day":7,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":528,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Oscar about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":529,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Adil about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":530,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A man, maybe 60s telling Caleb about Minh. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":531,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ruth telling Oscar about Daniela. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":532,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ruth telling A woman, maybe 30s about Oscar. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":533,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s telling Oscar about themself. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":534,"day":7,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":535,"day":7,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":536,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":537,"day":7,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (46 logs now.)"},{"seq":538,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 30s telling A man, maybe 60s about Daniela. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":539,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Minh about themself. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":540,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 20s telling A woman, maybe 30s about Otto. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":541,"day":7,"line":"your jaw aches — a dirty cut. Smiling hurts. The neck is going stiff."},{"seq":542,"day":7,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":543,"day":7,"line":"🌙 Something owns the night out here. You haven't learned its name yet — but the dark gets busier after sunset, and every step is riskier. A lit fire is a beacon — light through canvas, smoke on the wind. Sealed and dark, you're just a smell in the night. Haven's walls end every argument."},{"seq":544,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":545,"day":7,"line":"🌱 Caleb waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":546,"day":7,"line":"💧 Caleb returns with 6L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":547,"day":7,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 stone now.)"},{"seq":548,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Caleb about Oscar. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":549,"day":7,"line":"Spasms run through you like a struck wire. (-2 HP)"},{"seq":550,"day":7,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":551,"day":7,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":552,"day":7,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":553,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":554,"day":7,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":555,"day":7,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":556,"day":7,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":557,"day":7,"line":"Travel 1 tile to thicket."},{"seq":558,"day":7,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":559,"day":7,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nMushrooms thumb up through the duff in a ring — a fairy ring, old as the path. You step around it, not through it. Some rules are older than knowledge."},{"seq":560,"day":7,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":561,"day":7,"line":"Travel 3 tiles to thicket."},{"seq":562,"day":7,"line":"Something moves out there — a dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":563,"day":7,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":564,"day":7,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":565,"day":7,"line":"It followed you. The dog-shaped silence at the treeline is here."},{"seq":566,"day":7,"line":"Movement — a waddling opossum, playing dead (badly)."},{"seq":567,"day":7,"line":"👁 You know this one's trick: it plays dead. Don't fall for it — or do, and be ready when it wakes."},{"seq":568,"day":7,"line":"\"Nadia,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Nadia.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":569,"day":7,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Nadia)."},{"seq":570,"day":7,"line":"Sleeping rough means the cold ground — heal ~16. Tonight will cost you — the night burns ~2200 kcal and you haven't eaten enough today. Eat and drink before you sleep, or the spiral starts at midnight."},{"seq":571,"day":7,"line":"You settle into the cold ground. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":572,"day":7,"line":"You don't know what that was. A dog-shaped silence at the treeline. Someone at the haven should hear about this."},{"seq":573,"day":7,"line":"⚔ A DOG-SHAPED SILENCE AT THE TREELINE! You're on your own."},{"seq":574,"day":7,"line":"Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."},{"seq":575,"day":7,"line":"The woods go silent — not quiet. Silent. Like the world holding its breath. The pack is already moving."},{"seq":576,"day":7,"line":"The dog-shaped silence at the treeline is on you — no warning, just teeth."},{"seq":577,"day":7,"line":"Armor absorbs 2."},{"seq":578,"day":7,"line":"A dog-shaped silence at the treeline hits you for 11."},{"seq":579,"day":7,"line":"📖 Codex: Silent Rush — gives no warning — it just moves and hits. You won't forget this."},{"seq":580,"day":7,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":581,"day":7,"line":"You don't stroll through the dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":582,"day":7,"line":"You don't stroll through the dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":583,"day":7,"line":"💥 The attack finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":584,"day":7,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":585,"day":7,"line":"The attack hits you for 5."},{"seq":586,"day":7,"line":"📖 Codex: Harass — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this."},{"seq":587,"day":7,"line":"You don't stroll through the dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":588,"day":7,"line":"💥 The Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":589,"day":7,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":590,"day":7,"line":"The Harass hits you for 5."},{"seq":591,"day":7,"line":"You don't stroll through the dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":592,"day":7,"line":"💥 The Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":593,"day":7,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":594,"day":7,"line":"The Harass hits you for 9."},{"seq":595,"day":7,"line":"You don't stroll through the dog-shaped silence at the treeline."},{"seq":596,"day":7,"line":"💥 The Harass finds you — no dodging it."},{"seq":597,"day":7,"line":"Armor absorbs 1."},{"seq":598,"day":7,"line":"The Harass hits you for 5."},{"seq":599,"day":7,"line":"You go down."},{"seq":600,"day":7,"line":"🕯️ Anh Jablonski is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."},{"seq":601,"day":7,"line":"What Anh kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body."},{"seq":602,"day":7,"line":"Nadia picks up the journal. Their hands shake. Then they open it, and keep writing."},{"seq":603,"day":7,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Silver Tongue (Level 1). Words are tools. You've got a whole workshop."},{"seq":604,"day":7,"line":"🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\""},{"seq":605,"day":7,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page: Anh Jablonski, 7 days. The mantle passes to Nadia Khoury."},{"seq":606,"day":7,"line":"🪞 You wake up somebody else. Nadia Khoury, 29 — a radio DJ. Her hands know different work now: Green Whisper."},{"seq":607,"day":7,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":608,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":609,"day":7,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":610,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":611,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":612,"day":7,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":613,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":614,"day":7,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":615,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":616,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":617,"day":7,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":618,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":619,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":620,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":621,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":622,"day":7,"line":"Took Dried beans."},{"seq":623,"day":7,"line":"The Dried beans was off. Your stomach knots. (-5 health)"},{"seq":624,"day":7,"line":"You eat Dried beans (150 kcal)."},{"seq":625,"day":7,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 2L carried (2kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 33L left."},{"seq":626,"day":7,"line":"Otto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":627,"day":7,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (50 logs now.)"},{"seq":628,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling A woman, maybe 20s about Adil. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":629,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling A man, maybe 50s about Adil. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":630,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ruth telling Caleb about A man, maybe 50s. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":631,"day":7,"line":"💧 Adil returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":632,"day":7,"line":"💧 Ruth returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":633,"day":7,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":634,"day":7,"line":"🐗 RAID — 5 raiders (stripes flowing where no wind blows, the creek went still, and your arm-hairs stood up, a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer, the absence of sound, shaped like wings, stripes resolving out of the bamboo, watching you) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":635,"day":7,"line":"🚨 stripes flowing where no wind blows, the creek went still, and your arm-hairs stood up, a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer, the absence of sound, shaped like wings, stripes resolving out of the bamboo, watching you is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voic"},{"seq":636,"day":7,"line":"📓 Journal: stripes flowing where no wind blows, the creek went still, and your arm-hairs stood up, a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer, the absence of sound, shaped like wings, stripes resolving out of the bamboo, watching you at the door, day 7."},{"seq":637,"day":7,"line":"🛡️ Oscar, Minh, Daniela, Adil and Ruth met them at the door — 5 put down. Oscar, Minh, Daniela, Adil, Ruth are hurt."},{"seq":638,"day":7,"line":"The defenders met them at the treeline — nothing reached your bedroll."},{"seq":639,"day":7,"line":"Caleb came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":640,"day":7,"line":"🌟 THE SKY SPLITS OPEN."},{"seq":641,"day":7,"line":"Not with light. With... interface. Windows scrolling across the clouds, too fast to read."},{"seq":642,"day":7,"line":"A voice behind your eyes — bright, delighted, utterly wrong. (The System has arrived.)"},{"seq":643,"day":7,"line":"🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":644,"day":7,"line":"📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\""},{"seq":645,"day":7,"line":"📖 Your journal shimmers — handwriting dissolving into interface. It talks now. It remembers everything."},{"seq":646,"day":7,"line":"🕐 Your hand-drawn time-circle glitches — and something colder, more precise, takes its place. (We kept the smudges. They're charming.)"},{"seq":647,"day":7,"line":"🦎 \"Those were CALIBRATION fauna! First drafts! The audience has NOTES! So we made BETTER ones!\" (Something new is crying in the treeline.)"},{"seq":648,"day":7,"line":"🧑‍🤝‍🧑 The village gathers. Everyone's journal is changing. Everyone hears the voice. Minh grabs your arm. \"Tell me you hear that too.\""},{"seq":649,"day":7,"line":"🎉 \"OH! One more thing! We noticed some of you have been... traveling together! In little groups! How ORGANIC! How INEFFICIENT!\""},{"seq":650,"day":7,"line":"\"So we made it OFFICIAL! The PARTY SYSTEM! Up to THREE companions! Formal! Tracked! With a UI! The audience can see your party composition now! Very important for the betting markets!\""},{"seq":651,"day":7,"line":"\"Choose wisely! Or don't! Betrayal arcs test VERY well with our demographics!\""},{"seq":652,"day":7,"line":"A new option appears when you look at people: invite them to your party."},{"seq":653,"day":7,"line":"💡 Learned: PARTY SYSTEM. You can invite people to travel and fight beside you. Ask — in conversation, like a person."},{"seq":654,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Bissap Hibiscus. Bissap. Red fleshy cups around the seed pods. Those red calyces are food and drink. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":655,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":656,"day":7,"line":"Adil was watching. Now they know Bissap Hibiscus too."},{"seq":657,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Daniela taught everyone about Bissap Hibiscus. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":658,"day":7,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":659,"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +2234 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":660,"day":7,"line":"Ruth has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Daniela drew Bissap Hibiscus in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":661,"day":7,"line":"Caleb traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":662,"day":7,"line":"Benoit traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":663,"day":7,"line":"Ruth and Adil lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":664,"day":7,"line":"Aria and Adil lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":665,"day":7,"line":"🍽️ Aria taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":666,"day":7,"line":"📓 Codex: Oscar taught Minh Steady Hands."},{"seq":667,"day":7,"line":"📓 Codex: Ruth taught Adil Diplomatic Incident."},{"seq":668,"day":7,"line":"📓 Codex: Carlos taught Aria Reading Tracks."},{"seq":669,"day":7,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~750 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":670,"day":7,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":671,"day":8,"line":"— DAY 8 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":672,"day":8,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Bissap Hibiscus — named and noted."},{"seq":673,"day":8,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":674,"day":8,"line":"\"The System flagged your sector. Move. NOW.\""},{"seq":675,"day":8,"line":"(475 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":676,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: The System offered an aid quest (fetch), day 8."},{"seq":677,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":678,"day":8,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":679,"day":8,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":680,"day":8,"line":"📋 Otto — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":681,"day":8,"line":"Daniela folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":682,"day":8,"line":"\"Enough,\" Daniela says. \"I want a say in how this village runs. A real say.\""},{"seq":683,"day":8,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":684,"day":8,"line":"🌿 Daniela checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":685,"day":8,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":686,"day":8,"line":"💧 Otto returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":687,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Aria telling Ruth about Otto. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":688,"day":8,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":689,"day":8,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"Big Loud.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":690,"day":8,"line":"💬 Nadia whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":691,"day":8,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (24 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":692,"day":8,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (39 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":693,"day":8,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (48 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":694,"day":8,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":695,"day":8,"line":"You catch Benoit telling the fire about Oscar. \"Oscar showed the woman in her 20s a low plant with tiny white flowers\" The story's already growing."},{"seq":696,"day":8,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":697,"day":8,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":698,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":699,"day":8,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 27L left."},{"seq":700,"day":8,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":701,"day":8,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":702,"day":8,"line":"📋 Otto — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":703,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (2 stone now.)"},{"seq":704,"day":8,"line":"💧 Otto eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":705,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (3 stone now.)"},{"seq":706,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Minh about Benoit. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":707,"day":8,"line":"🚶 Otto is back — found Oscar."},{"seq":708,"day":8,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":709,"day":8,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":710,"day":8,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE SIEGE. They came in the night for the pantry — and the village met them at the door with blades and fire and drove them back into the dark. Wealth has a scent. So does defiance."},{"seq":711,"day":8,"line":"SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\""},{"seq":712,"day":8,"line":"🛟 Otto stands up by the fire. \"We take the hit and we answer it — standing here isn't an answer. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":713,"day":8,"line":"\"Tend the hurt, stretch the food, or hunt it back — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":714,"day":8,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Otto adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":715,"day":8,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":716,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":717,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":718,"day":8,"line":"Something moves out there — tick."},{"seq":719,"day":8,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 4× Sassafras, 5× Lamb's Quarters, 4× Pawpaw (650 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":720,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":721,"day":8,"line":"While you were gone — 5 things you missed:"},{"seq":722,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Oscar killed the stripes flowing where no wind blows with their party — 7 rounds, 79 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":723,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Minh killed the creek went still with their party — 5 rounds, 56 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":724,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Daniela killed the drumbeat with no drummer with their party — 4 rounds, 28 taken. Word travels fast. Took Wrong bandage off the body. The village cheers."},{"seq":725,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Adil killed the absence of sound with their party — 4 rounds, 55 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":726,"day":8,"line":"⚔️ Ruth killed the stripes resolving out of the bamboo with their party — 6 rounds, 30 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":727,"day":8,"line":"You keep a day's food (650 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":728,"day":8,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 11 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":729,"day":8,"line":"Carlos looks at the pantry, then at the Codex, then at you. \"We’re going to make it.\" Haven will survive — because someone learned the land, and wrote it down. One less thing to fear."},{"seq":730,"day":8,"line":"You sow Lamb's Quarters: 30 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 28 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":731,"day":8,"line":"Aria will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":732,"day":8,"line":"You sow Lamb's Quarters: 30 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 28 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":733,"day":8,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":734,"day":8,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":735,"day":8,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":736,"day":8,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":737,"day":8,"line":"\"Got it,\" Daniela says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""},{"seq":738,"day":8,"line":"Oscar leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Night Court. Dodge twice. No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours.\""},{"seq":739,"day":8,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Night Court: Dodge twice. No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":740,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Dodge twice — No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours."},{"seq":741,"day":8,"line":"No free ability slots (1/1). Increase System integration to unlock more."},{"seq":742,"day":8,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":743,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Aria hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (55 logs now.)"},{"seq":744,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (61 logs now.)"},{"seq":745,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Carlos pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":746,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Otto hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (66 logs now.)"},{"seq":747,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Minh about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":748,"day":8,"line":"🚶 Caleb is back — found Adil."},{"seq":749,"day":8,"line":"👥 Benoit heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":750,"day":8,"line":"Ruth shakes their head, admiring. \"Did you hear what Oscar did?\" You hadn't. Now you have."},{"seq":751,"day":8,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":752,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Oscar has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Sweeps Week — I put it down today.\" \"The grass stops moving the way wind moves it. Two amber eyes — then the whole striped avalanche.\" \"It circles, unhurried. It has seen this episode before — and it knows how it ends.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Benoit says quietly \"So it bleeds.\" Aria"},{"seq":753,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Minh has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Living Wire — I put it down today.\" \"The water goes glass-still. A faint crackling, and the hairs on your arms lift.\" \"The crackling fades. It slides backward into the black water, done spending itself — for now.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Ruth says \"So it bleeds.\" Oscar mutters \"So"},{"seq":754,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Daniela has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Drum-Belly — I put it down today.\" \"It rears up, belly swelling drum-taut, and beats it with both paws — BOOM. The air itself flinches.\" \"It waddles left, then is suddenly right — a feint, testing whether your eyes or your ears are in charge.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Caleb says \"Te"},{"seq":755,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Adil has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Night Court — I put it down today.\" \"No sound. That is the warning. The moon-shadow on the ground is growing — and there is no sound at all. Owls don't make sound when they hunt.\" \"It missed — and it is already turning. The second dive re-aims at where you moved.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at on"},{"seq":756,"day":8,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Ruth has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Mountain Lord — I put it down today.\" \"It crouches low, tail lashing once, twice. The stripes go still. Then it comes.\" \"A paw rises, claws out — casual, almost lazy. It is not lazy.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Otto says quietly \"And you're still standing.\" Benoit breathes \"Tell me y"},{"seq":757,"day":8,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":758,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (5 stone now.)"},{"seq":759,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Ruth about Caleb. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":760,"day":8,"line":"🍲 Caleb eats with Daniela — bowls side by side, talk low."},{"seq":761,"day":8,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 11 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":762,"day":8,"line":"◈ ARC II — THE SHOW. The sky tore open a week ago and the village is still here. Still eating. The audience has noticed. Strangers will come — not because the plot says so, but because surviving is worth watching."},{"seq":763,"day":8,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"RATINGS DIP. The audience wants STAKES — pointed ones. A PALISADE. Stockpile 14,000 kcal, 350 wood and 60 stone. Walls make such good television. You will thank us when the teeth come.\""},{"seq":764,"day":8,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":765,"day":8,"line":"Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."},{"seq":766,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: a weathered trader arrived (trader)."},{"seq":767,"day":8,"line":"That night, they bring Anh home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."},{"seq":768,"day":8,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big Big.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":769,"day":8,"line":"SYSTEM: Neural interface stable. Text overlay enabled."},{"seq":770,"day":8,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 22. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 2.\""},{"seq":771,"day":8,"line":"🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":772,"day":8,"line":"◈ THE SPARK — something clicks. A trick Nadia learned long ago suddenly has edges it never had. SYSTEM: \"ANOMALY: organic unit demonstrates pattern recognition. Slot capacity increased. We are taking notes.\" (Ability slots: 2)"},{"seq":773,"day":8,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)"},{"seq":774,"day":8,"line":"📢 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"Catch something! Anything! We want to see how you do it!\" (Hunt an animal today for a reward.)"},{"seq":775,"day":8,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Lemongrass. Tea and mosquito armor in one clump. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":776,"day":8,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":777,"day":8,"line":"Caleb was watching. Now they know Lemongrass too."},{"seq":778,"day":8,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Minh taught everyone about Lemongrass. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":779,"day":8,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":780,"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +2100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":781,"day":8,"line":"Fireside lesson: Minh passes around Lemongrass. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."},{"seq":782,"day":8,"line":"Otto came back with 620 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 310 kcal in, 310 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":783,"day":8,"line":"Aria traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":784,"day":8,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":785,"day":8,"line":"🍽️ Benoit leaves the surplus by the fire for whoever's hungry. \"The pantry can't take it. We can.\""},{"seq":786,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Carlos taught Otto Reading Tracks."},{"seq":787,"day":9,"line":"— DAY 9 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":788,"day":9,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Lemongrass — named and noted."},{"seq":789,"day":9,"line":"◈ HAVEN — You've noticed: people cover for each other without being asked. The gaps close themselves."},{"seq":790,"day":9,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+15 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 3 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":791,"day":9,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":792,"day":9,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":793,"day":9,"line":"Otto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":794,"day":9,"line":"The stash count is off. 2 stones missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":795,"day":9,"line":"🌱 Aria waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":796,"day":9,"line":"🌿 Aria checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":797,"day":9,"line":"🪨 Aria pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":798,"day":9,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (69 logs now.)"},{"seq":799,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Oscar about Benoit. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":800,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":801,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":802,"day":9,"line":"Otto showed Daniela the floating rosettes of leaves; under them, black horned nuts — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":803,"day":9,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (27 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":804,"day":9,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (42 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":805,"day":9,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (51 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":806,"day":9,"line":"🌿 Benoit returns from foraging the wilds: +166 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 166 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":807,"day":9,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":808,"day":9,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":809,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":810,"day":9,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 19L left."},{"seq":811,"day":9,"line":"Otto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":812,"day":9,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":813,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":814,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"Judge Hoot.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":815,"day":9,"line":"💬 Carlos has been asking Otto about Night Eyes — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":816,"day":9,"line":"👥 Benoit heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":817,"day":9,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":818,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":819,"day":9,"line":"📋 Otto — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":820,"day":9,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (5 stone now.)"},{"seq":821,"day":9,"line":"💧 Otto returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":822,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ruth telling Oscar about Otto. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":823,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":824,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"Big Big.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":825,"day":9,"line":"👥 Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":826,"day":9,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":827,"day":9,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":828,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":829,"day":9,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":830,"day":9,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":831,"day":9,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"Big Ugly.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":832,"day":9,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":833,"day":9,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":834,"day":9,"line":"Movement — a deer, white tail raised in alarm."},{"seq":835,"day":9,"line":"👁 Wary. Ears always tracking. Get close before it knows you're there."},{"seq":836,"day":9,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":837,"day":9,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":838,"day":9,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":839,"day":9,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":840,"day":9,"line":"You keep a day's food (450 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":841,"day":9,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":842,"day":9,"line":"You lay out the haul. Otto leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":843,"day":9,"line":"📖 Otto starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":844,"day":9,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 12 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":845,"day":9,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":846,"day":9,"line":"Otto will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":847,"day":9,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":848,"day":9,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green whisper.)"},{"seq":849,"day":9,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":850,"day":9,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":851,"day":9,"line":"Daniela mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":852,"day":9,"line":"Daniela leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Living Wire. Get OUT of the water. When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek.\""},{"seq":853,"day":9,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Living Wire: Get OUT of the water. When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":854,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Get OUT of the water — When the crackling starts, step onto dry ground — the discharge cannot reach you there. On land it is just a long blind fish: slow, harmless, dinner. Never fight it standing in the creek."},{"seq":855,"day":9,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Green Thumb, Literally (L1). Gather 50% more food from plants. Ask the Plants reveals what grows in the area, once a day. Cultivate growing Haven beds: 200 kcal, once per bed each day. Higher levels accelerate growth further."},{"seq":856,"day":9,"line":"\"The plants lean toward you. They're gossiping. You're learning to listen.\""},{"seq":857,"day":9,"line":"\"We've been watching you figure things out all week! This one's on us — a head start! But the REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\""},{"seq":858,"day":9,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":859,"day":9,"line":"You eat Lamb's Quarters, Pawpaw, and Sassafras (410 kcal)."},{"seq":860,"day":9,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":861,"day":9,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":862,"day":9,"line":"Daniela doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":863,"day":9,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (73 logs now.)"},{"seq":864,"day":9,"line":"💧 Carlos returns with 5L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":865,"day":9,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (6 stone now.)"},{"seq":866,"day":9,"line":"💧 Oscar eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":867,"day":9,"line":"🪵 Oscar hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (79 logs now.)"},{"seq":868,"day":9,"line":"Daniela stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fetch water crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":869,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Carlos telling Daniela about Benoit. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":870,"day":9,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":871,"day":9,"line":"📨 Word came: Hannah Kim wants to join Haven. \"Word travels: Haven takes people in. I'm people.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":872,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Hannah Kim applied remotely."},{"seq":873,"day":9,"line":"A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":874,"day":9,"line":"🚶 A stranger walks into Haven. They're thin, scared, and carrying nothing. \"Please,\" they say. \"I heard you have food.\" (Drama: do you share?)"},{"seq":875,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Dandelion. Jagged leaves, yellow flower. You grab the whole plant. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":876,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":877,"day":9,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Otto taught everyone about Dandelion. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":878,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Water Chestnut. Singhara (water chestnut). The pond's horned nut — sweet and crisp. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":879,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":880,"day":9,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Aria taught everyone about Water Chestnut. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":881,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Bracken Fiddlehead. Bracken. Coiled fiddleheads opening into triangle fronds. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":882,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":883,"day":9,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Otto taught everyone about Bracken Fiddlehead. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":884,"day":9,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 37. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 3.\""},{"seq":885,"day":9,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Pupunha (Peach Palm). Pupunha. Orange fruit clusters on a spiny palm. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":886,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":887,"day":9,"line":"Aria was watching. Now they know Pupunha (Peach Palm) too."},{"seq":888,"day":9,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Adil taught everyone about Pupunha (Peach Palm). The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":889,"day":9,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":890,"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +2066 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":891,"day":9,"line":"Adil is showing everyone Pupunha (Peach Palm) by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":892,"day":9,"line":"Otto came back with 536 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 268 kcal in, 268 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":893,"day":9,"line":"Benoit is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 78/100)"},{"seq":894,"day":9,"line":"Minh and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":895,"day":9,"line":"Caleb and Ruth lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":896,"day":9,"line":"Caleb and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":897,"day":9,"line":"🍽️ Benoit watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":898,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Minh taught Oscar The Forager’s Eye."},{"seq":899,"day":9,"line":"🤒 Oscar is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":900,"day":9,"line":"Daniela corners you by the fire: \"Don't share your haul with Ruth.\" It's not a request."},{"seq":901,"day":10,"line":"— DAY 10 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":902,"day":10,"line":"On the carcass nearby, stripes flowing where no wind blows (carcass), the creek went still, and your arm-hairs stood up (carcass), a drumbeat with no drummer, getting closer (carcass), the absence of sound, shaped like wings (carcass), stripes resolving out of the bamboo, watching you (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost."},{"seq":903,"day":10,"line":"The fire burns low. 4 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Dandelion — named and noted."},{"seq":904,"day":10,"line":"👀 \"researcher, huh?\" Ruth nods — then, an hour later, drops a shop-talk detail no researcher would ever get right. They catch themselves. Too late."},{"seq":905,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: Ruth — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":906,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":907,"day":10,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":908,"day":10,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":909,"day":10,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":910,"day":10,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":911,"day":10,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":912,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Otto hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (79 logs now.)"},{"seq":913,"day":10,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":914,"day":10,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":915,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ruth telling Benoit about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":916,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Oscar about Ruth. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":917,"day":10,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (45 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":918,"day":10,"line":"Daniela heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":919,"day":10,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (54 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":920,"day":10,"line":"Caleb heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":921,"day":10,"line":"💧 Aria returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":922,"day":10,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":923,"day":10,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":924,"day":10,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":925,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":926,"day":10,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":927,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (7 stone now.)"},{"seq":928,"day":10,"line":"💧 Daniela eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":929,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (8 stone now.)"},{"seq":930,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Oscar hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (84 logs now.)"},{"seq":931,"day":10,"line":"💬 Nadia says: \"If they're watching, let them watch me work. That's all I've got.\""},{"seq":932,"day":10,"line":"Otto showed Ruth the Dandelion — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":933,"day":10,"line":"Aria heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":934,"day":10,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":935,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":936,"day":10,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nMushrooms thumb up through the duff in a ring — a fairy ring, old as the path. You step around it, not through it. Some rules are older than knowledge."},{"seq":937,"day":10,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":938,"day":10,"line":"Movement — a chipmunk, cheeks already full."},{"seq":939,"day":10,"line":"👁 Spook it and it's down a hole you never saw. Block the burrow mouth, or hunt it in the open where the hole can't help."},{"seq":940,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Caleb about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":941,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nSaplings push up through last year's deadfall, racing each other for the light. The forest never stops trying."},{"seq":942,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to forest floor.\n— Under the canopy —\nOld growth. The canopy closes overhead and the light comes down in shafts. Something rustled, and decided not to be seen."},{"seq":943,"day":10,"line":"Movement — a deer, white tail raised in alarm."},{"seq":944,"day":10,"line":"👁 Wary. Ears always tracking. Get close before it knows you're there."},{"seq":945,"day":10,"line":"Stonebridge's clearing. Voices, a cookfire, somebody else's home. You're a guest here — act like it."},{"seq":946,"day":10,"line":"You clear the rubble, stone by stone. The path is clear."},{"seq":947,"day":10,"line":"You pocket 3 good throwing stones. (sling ammo)"},{"seq":948,"day":10,"line":"Travel 3 tiles to grove.\n— Nut trees —\nHickories and oaks, heavy with mast. This is a pantry that grows."},{"seq":949,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":950,"day":10,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":951,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":952,"day":10,"line":"Movement — a long gray snake coiled on a sunlit log."},{"seq":953,"day":10,"line":"👁 No rattle, no venom — but your hands don't know that yet. It freezes, hoping you'll walk past. Pin it behind the head; it bites only when grabbed."},{"seq":954,"day":10,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown shoots — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":955,"day":10,"line":"Journal: Riparian ground. Water means life, and lunch."},{"seq":956,"day":10,"line":"A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 8× unknown shoots. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":957,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":958,"day":10,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":959,"day":10,"line":"Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you."},{"seq":960,"day":10,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":961,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Carlos telling Oscar about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":962,"day":10,"line":"Otto picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":963,"day":10,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 6 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":964,"day":10,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":965,"day":10,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":966,"day":10,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":967,"day":10,"line":"Otto leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Sweeps Week. Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow.\""},{"seq":968,"day":10,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Sweeps Week: Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":969,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never show it your back — FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow."},{"seq":970,"day":10,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":971,"day":10,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":972,"day":10,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":973,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (88 logs now.)"},{"seq":974,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (9 stone now.)"},{"seq":975,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Carlos hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (92 logs now.)"},{"seq":976,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (10 stone now.)"},{"seq":977,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Aria about Ruth. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":978,"day":10,"line":"Otto showed Oscar the Bracken Fiddlehead — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":979,"day":10,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":980,"day":10,"line":"💧 Caleb returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":981,"day":10,"line":"🍲 Daniela is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":982,"day":10,"line":"Benoit is sweeping the hall. Someone has to."},{"seq":983,"day":10,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":984,"day":10,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":985,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (97 logs now.)"},{"seq":986,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (11 stone now.)"},{"seq":987,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Daniela about Benoit. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":988,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Ruth about Daniela. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":989,"day":10,"line":"Ruth showed Caleb the Water Chestnut — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":990,"day":10,"line":"🌿 Aria returns from foraging the wilds: +256 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 255 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":991,"day":10,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"Ooh. NEIGHBORS. You know what neighbors are for? STORYLINES. Go knock — worst case, it's CONTENT. Best case? The show gets BIGGER.\""},{"seq":992,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: The System noticed the neighbors, and wants storylines."},{"seq":993,"day":10,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":994,"day":10,"line":"Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."},{"seq":995,"day":10,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Daniela stands accused over what happened to Ruth. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":996,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: Heard about the case against Daniela."},{"seq":997,"day":10,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Loud-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":998,"day":10,"line":"SYSTEM: Quest protocol integrated. Objectives will appear."},{"seq":999,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Beard Moss. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":1000,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Long Table. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":1001,"day":10,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 40. I've been watching what you're becoming, little living. Names for your shelf: Beard Moss, Long Table. What they DO — that's still yours to learn.\""},{"seq":1002,"day":10,"line":"◈ THE MENTOR — Otto watches Nadia work, then reaches over. \"No. Like this.\" An hour later something has unlocked that no manual could teach. (Ability slots: 3)"},{"seq":1003,"day":10,"line":"◈ NEURAL CREEP — the overlay isn't on the world anymore. It's under it. Behind your eyes, faintly, when you blink."},{"seq":1004,"day":10,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)"},{"seq":1005,"day":10,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Judge Hoot.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1006,"day":10,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+4 integration)"},{"seq":1007,"day":10,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1008,"day":10,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+3 integration)"},{"seq":1009,"day":10,"line":"🐺 HOWLS in the distance. Closer than before. The System chirps: \"Oh! We made those! Are they... too many? We can make fewer?\" (New monster: hushwolf pack.)"},{"seq":1010,"day":10,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 52. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 4.\""},{"seq":1011,"day":10,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Mesquite. Thorny tree, long bean pods. Desert staple. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1012,"day":10,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":1013,"day":10,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Benoit taught everyone about Mesquite. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":1014,"day":10,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1015,"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +2156 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1016,"day":10,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Aria fixing something."},{"seq":1017,"day":10,"line":"Otto is showing everyone Dandelion by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1018,"day":10,"line":"Benoit spends the afternoon with the vine with thick-skinned round fruit — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":1019,"day":10,"line":"From the lumped bag: Muscadine Grapes — named, and out."},{"seq":1020,"day":10,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Muscadine Grapes. Muscadine. Thick-skinned wild grapes. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1021,"day":10,"line":"💡 The vine with thick-skinned round fruit — THAT's what Benoit was describing. Muscadine Grapes. It clicks like a key turning."},{"seq":1022,"day":10,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":1023,"day":10,"line":"Daniela traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1024,"day":10,"line":"Daniela and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1025,"day":10,"line":"🍽️ Otto watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":1026,"day":10,"line":"The southeast ground is thinning faster than your crews alone could strip it. Stonebridge isn't slowing down — their foragers are on your turf most days now. Their speaker would probably want words. (Talk about the shared ground at their fire.)"},{"seq":1027,"day":10,"line":"Ruth eats apart from the others tonight. Daniela doesn't look up. The fire feels smaller."},{"seq":1028,"day":11,"line":"— DAY 11 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1029,"day":11,"line":"Overnight, unknown shoots went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":1030,"day":11,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1031,"day":11,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Mesquite — named and noted."},{"seq":1032,"day":11,"line":"👀 When the others traded stories about Denver, Oscar went quiet in a way that wasn't listening — more like realizing they had nothing true to trade."},{"seq":1033,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Oscar — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":1034,"day":11,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1035,"day":11,"line":"\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\""},{"seq":1036,"day":11,"line":"(291 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1037,"day":11,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+2 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1038,"day":11,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1039,"day":11,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1040,"day":11,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1041,"day":11,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1042,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1043,"day":11,"line":"💧 Otto returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1044,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (12 stone now.)"},{"seq":1045,"day":11,"line":"💧 Daniela eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1046,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (100 logs now.)"},{"seq":1047,"day":11,"line":"Caleb showed Oscar the Water Chestnut — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":1048,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (48 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1049,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (57 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1050,"day":11,"line":"Aria sets out to find Nadia. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":1051,"day":11,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1052,"day":11,"line":"💬 Caleb is with Adil, talking the way people do when nobody else is listening."},{"seq":1053,"day":11,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1054,"day":11,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1055,"day":11,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":1056,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1057,"day":11,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1058,"day":11,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1059,"day":11,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1060,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (104 logs now.)"},{"seq":1061,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (13 stone now.)"},{"seq":1062,"day":11,"line":"Minh showed Aria the Bracken Fiddlehead — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":1063,"day":11,"line":"Ruth heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1064,"day":11,"line":"Carlos is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":1065,"day":11,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1066,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1067,"day":11,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 29L left."},{"seq":1068,"day":11,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1069,"day":11,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Daniela doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1070,"day":11,"line":"Daniela waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\""},{"seq":1071,"day":11,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1072,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (110 logs now.)"},{"seq":1073,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Oscar pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (14 stone now.)"},{"seq":1074,"day":11,"line":"Minh showed Daniela the Bracken Fiddlehead — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":1075,"day":11,"line":"Caleb heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1076,"day":11,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1077,"day":11,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":1078,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1079,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1080,"day":11,"line":"📖 The Codex settles deeper into you. It knows things before you do now. Deaths, especially — it will tell you itself."},{"seq":1081,"day":11,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. tick is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1082,"day":11,"line":"Something moves out there — The Moderator."},{"seq":1083,"day":11,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1084,"day":11,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to wetland."},{"seq":1085,"day":11,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown nuts — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":1086,"day":11,"line":"Journal updated: a tree with compound leaves and hard nuts grows here too — better than pawpaw."},{"seq":1087,"day":11,"line":"You work the patch: 8× Pawpaw — and 8× unknown nuts you can't name yet. This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1088,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1089,"day":11,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1090,"day":11,"line":"⚔️ Caleb killed the tick with their party — 4 rounds, 25 taken. Word travels fast. Took Medfoam canister off the body. The village cheers."},{"seq":1091,"day":11,"line":"You keep a day's food (640 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1092,"day":11,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1093,"day":11,"line":"Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you."},{"seq":1094,"day":11,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 18 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1095,"day":11,"line":"Minh picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":1096,"day":11,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 6 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1097,"day":11,"line":"⬆️ Green Thumb, Literally deepened to L2! +100% yield (was +50%)."},{"seq":1098,"day":11,"line":"\"Yes! YES! That's the comprehension we calibrated for! Keep going! The sponsors are doubling down!\""},{"seq":1099,"day":11,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1100,"day":11,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1101,"day":11,"line":"Daniela mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1102,"day":11,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1103,"day":11,"line":"\"Why are YOU giving orders?\" Daniela doesn't raise their voice. That's worse."},{"seq":1104,"day":11,"line":"Minh leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about tick. Keep two squares away. Keep 2+ squares away and it's harmless — it can't chase. Don't walk up to it. Latched: burn it off with fire, or let it feed full and drop on its own.\""},{"seq":1105,"day":11,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — tick: Keep two squares away. Keep 2+ squares away and it's harmless — it can't chase. Don't walk up to it. Latched: burn it off with fire, or let it feed full and drop on its own. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1106,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Keep two squares away — Keep 2+ squares away and it's harmless — it can't chase. Don't walk up to it. Latched: burn it off with fire, or let it feed full and drop on its own."},{"seq":1107,"day":11,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1108,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (15 stone now.)"},{"seq":1109,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (116 logs now.)"},{"seq":1110,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Carlos hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (121 logs now.)"},{"seq":1111,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (16 stone now.)"},{"seq":1112,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Otto about Aria. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1113,"day":11,"line":"Minh showed Daniela the Mesquite — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":1114,"day":11,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1115,"day":11,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":1116,"day":11,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Ruth is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1117,"day":11,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":1118,"day":11,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE FIRST GRAVE. Ruth is dead. The village digs its first grave, and everyone understands at once: this place can kill you. It just did."},{"seq":1119,"day":11,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Oh. Oh no. Was that supposed to happen? The audience is crying. I did not know they could do that.\""},{"seq":1120,"day":11,"line":"📖 The entry for Ruth is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":1121,"day":11,"line":"RUTH — GONE. 2 open questions closed unanswered."},{"seq":1122,"day":11,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":1123,"day":11,"line":"A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":1124,"day":11,"line":"Otto has been talking at the fires. Enough voices — tonight they call a moot. Daniela answers for what happened to Ruth."},{"seq":1125,"day":11,"line":"Otto calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."},{"seq":1126,"day":11,"line":"The room is wrong today — still raw after the killing. Edgy, listening for the wrong things. Evidence feels thin in here."},{"seq":1127,"day":11,"line":"The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."},{"seq":1128,"day":11,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1129,"day":11,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1130,"day":11,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1131,"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +2300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1132,"day":11,"line":"Benoit drew Muscadine Grapes in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":1133,"day":11,"line":"Otto spends the afternoon with the tree with compound leaves and hard nuts — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":1134,"day":11,"line":"From the lumped bag: Hickory Nuts — named, and out."},{"seq":1135,"day":11,"line":"SYSTEM: Codex and inventory overlay online."},{"seq":1136,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Loud Chewer. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":1137,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Purify. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":1138,"day":11,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 60. I've been watching what you're becoming, little living. Names for your shelf: Loud Chewer, Purify. What they DO — that's still yours to learn.\""},{"seq":1139,"day":11,"line":"◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers Nadia a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 4)"},{"seq":1140,"day":11,"line":"◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pa"},{"seq":1141,"day":11,"line":"SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Mixtape. WATCH.\""},{"seq":1142,"day":11,"line":"⬆️ Green Whisper deepened to L2! Plants lean toward you."},{"seq":1143,"day":11,"line":"\"We didn't even explain that part! You figured it out yourself! That's the good stuff! The gamblers are thrilled!\""},{"seq":1144,"day":11,"line":"💛 You hold Mixtape and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Green Whisper)"},{"seq":1145,"day":11,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Hickory Nuts. Hickory nut. Hard shell, sweet meat. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1146,"day":11,"line":"💡 The tree with compound leaves and hard nuts — THAT's what Otto was describing. Hickory Nuts. It clicks like a key turning."},{"seq":1147,"day":11,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":1148,"day":11,"line":"Adil was watching. Now they know Hickory Nuts too."},{"seq":1149,"day":11,"line":"Oscar: \"Walked past a good stand of water hemlock. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":1150,"day":11,"line":"Caleb traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1151,"day":11,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1152,"day":11,"line":"🍽️ Caleb watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":1153,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Lamb's Quarters — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1154,"day":11,"line":"💡 Lamb's Quarters: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (1/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1155,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: The old argument between Daniela and Ruth ended — one of them is gone."},{"seq":1156,"day":12,"line":"— DAY 12 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1157,"day":12,"line":"Overnight, unknown nuts went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":1158,"day":12,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1159,"day":12,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Hickory Nuts — named and noted."},{"seq":1160,"day":12,"line":"◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Thornfield bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Beloved. Strangers ask for your blessing. You don't know what to do with that."},{"seq":1161,"day":12,"line":"👁️ Carlos cornered Caleb away from the fire. No one heard the words, but Caleb hasn't been the same since."},{"seq":1162,"day":12,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1163,"day":12,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1164,"day":12,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1165,"day":12,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1166,"day":12,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1167,"day":12,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1168,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (18 stone now.)"},{"seq":1169,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (125 logs now.)"},{"seq":1170,"day":12,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1171,"day":12,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 6L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1172,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Caleb about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1173,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Carlos telling Caleb about Aria. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1174,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Minh about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1175,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Daniela about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1176,"day":12,"line":"💬 Daniela says: \"Do you think they're watching right now? The... audience? I try not to think about it.\""},{"seq":1177,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (48 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1178,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (57 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1179,"day":12,"line":"💧 Caleb returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1180,"day":12,"line":"Benoit sets out to find Aria. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":1181,"day":12,"line":"Caleb is tending the fire, coaxing it steady."},{"seq":1182,"day":12,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1183,"day":12,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1184,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1185,"day":12,"line":"💧 Daniela eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the wood run instead."},{"seq":1186,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (129 logs now.)"},{"seq":1187,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (19 stone now.)"},{"seq":1188,"day":12,"line":"🚶 Aria is back — found Nadia."},{"seq":1189,"day":12,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1190,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1191,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (20 stone now.)"},{"seq":1192,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (133 logs now.)"},{"seq":1193,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Adil about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1194,"day":12,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":1195,"day":12,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"Big Loud.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1196,"day":12,"line":"Daniela heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":1197,"day":12,"line":"💬 Carlos and Otto are hunched over the fire together, voices too low to catch."},{"seq":1198,"day":12,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1199,"day":12,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Caleb has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Benoit asks \"Say that again — slower.\" Oscar breathes \"And you're still standing.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's t"},{"seq":1200,"day":12,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1201,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1202,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1203,"day":12,"line":"Something moves out there — Loud-Eyes."},{"seq":1204,"day":12,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1205,"day":12,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to wetland."},{"seq":1206,"day":12,"line":"It followed you. The Loud-Eyes is here."},{"seq":1207,"day":12,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1208,"day":12,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":1209,"day":12,"line":"It followed you. The Loud-Eyes is here."},{"seq":1210,"day":12,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 16× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1211,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1212,"day":12,"line":"You keep a day's food (640 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1213,"day":12,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1214,"day":12,"line":"You lay out the haul. Otto leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1215,"day":12,"line":"📖 Otto starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":1216,"day":12,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 19 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1217,"day":12,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1218,"day":12,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1219,"day":12,"line":"Harvest: 48× Lamb's Quarters, 48× Lamb's Quarters. About 4800 kcal before preparation."},{"seq":1220,"day":12,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1221,"day":12,"line":"Daniela watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":1222,"day":12,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1223,"day":12,"line":"Daniela mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1224,"day":12,"line":"Benoit leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Loud Beast. Stand tall and shout. When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched.\""},{"seq":1225,"day":12,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Loud Beast: Stand tall and shout. When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1226,"day":12,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Stand tall and shout — When it crouches to pounce, STAND TALL and SHOUT — bang metal, wave your arms, be loud and enormous. It expects prey to flee. Be the thing that doesn't, and the pounce dies unlaunched."},{"seq":1227,"day":12,"line":"You eat Pawpaw (400 kcal)."},{"seq":1228,"day":12,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1229,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (139 logs now.)"},{"seq":1230,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (21 stone now.)"},{"seq":1231,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Carlos hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (145 logs now.)"},{"seq":1232,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (23 stone now.)"},{"seq":1233,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Aria about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1234,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Adil about Caleb. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1235,"day":12,"line":"Carlos showed Caleb the Mesquite — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":1236,"day":12,"line":"Daniela showed Oscar the Hickory Nuts — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":1237,"day":12,"line":"🚶 Benoit is back — found Aria."},{"seq":1238,"day":12,"line":"💬 Benoit has been asking you about Green Thumb, Literally — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":1239,"day":12,"line":"◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something."},{"seq":1240,"day":12,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Daniela stands accused over what happened to Ruth. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":1241,"day":12,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Daniela stands accused over what happened to Ruth. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":1242,"day":12,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"We've been thinking. You know things we don't. Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3). We will watch very closely, which is our entire personality.\""},{"seq":1243,"day":12,"line":"A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet."},{"seq":1244,"day":12,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1245,"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +2000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1246,"day":12,"line":"Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Minh goes to sit with them."},{"seq":1247,"day":12,"line":"Fireside lesson: Benoit passes around Mesquite. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn."},{"seq":1248,"day":12,"line":"Benoit came back with 534 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 267 kcal in, 267 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":1249,"day":12,"line":"Oscar and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1250,"day":12,"line":"Carlos and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1251,"day":12,"line":"🍽️ Caleb taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":1252,"day":12,"line":"🌿 White Oak Acorns — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1253,"day":12,"line":"💡 White Oak Acorns: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (2/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1254,"day":12,"line":"🤒 Oscar is back on their feet — the fever ran its course."},{"seq":1255,"day":12,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":1256,"day":13,"line":"— DAY 13 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1257,"day":13,"line":"Overnight, Pawpaw went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":1258,"day":13,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1259,"day":13,"line":"🔥 Benoit says it at the fire, not quite looking at Carlos: “Your trade story doesn’t add up. Someone had to say it.” The fire goes quiet in the way it does when someone’s decided to be brave."},{"seq":1260,"day":13,"line":"Snow by morning. (0°C — Cold) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear."},{"seq":1261,"day":13,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 75 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1262,"day":13,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1263,"day":13,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1264,"day":13,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1265,"day":13,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1266,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Echo Location. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":1267,"day":13,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Otto — Field 1. Three offers; they took Echo Location. Earned, chosen. (echo_location: villager level-up)"},{"seq":1268,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Otto chose Echo Location (echo_location) at Field 1."},{"seq":1269,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1270,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Otto hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (147 logs now.)"},{"seq":1271,"day":13,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1272,"day":13,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1273,"day":13,"line":"💧 Oscar eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1274,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Oscar pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (24 stone now.)"},{"seq":1275,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (27 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1276,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (51 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1277,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (60 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1278,"day":13,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1279,"day":13,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1280,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1281,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (25 stone now.)"},{"seq":1282,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (151 logs now.)"},{"seq":1283,"day":13,"line":"Daniela doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fetch water crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":1284,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Caleb about Daniela. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1285,"day":13,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":1286,"day":13,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Otto is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1287,"day":13,"line":"Benoit heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":1288,"day":13,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1289,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1290,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (155 logs now.)"},{"seq":1291,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (27 stone now.)"},{"seq":1292,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Daniela about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1293,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Daniela returns from foraging the wilds: +236 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 235 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1294,"day":13,"line":"💬 Carlos is with Otto, talking the way people do when nobody else is listening."},{"seq":1295,"day":13,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1296,"day":13,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":1297,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1298,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1299,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Otto about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1300,"day":13,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":1301,"day":13,"line":"Journal updated: Hickory Nuts grows here too — better than muscadine grapes."},{"seq":1302,"day":13,"line":"You work the patch: 3× Hickory Nuts — and 3× unknown berries you can't name yet. This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1303,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1304,"day":13,"line":"The pantry is bursting past tomorrow — most of the haul stays in your pack. The fire can wait; the road can't."},{"seq":1305,"day":13,"line":"You keep a day's food (4800 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1306,"day":13,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1307,"day":13,"line":"You lay out the haul. Otto leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1308,"day":13,"line":"📖 Otto starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1309,"day":13,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 19 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1310,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Carlos about Benoit. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1311,"day":13,"line":"Aria picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":1312,"day":13,"line":"You make a Stone knife. flint knapped to an edge, bound with vine. cuts meat, wood, cord."},{"seq":1313,"day":13,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1314,"day":13,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1315,"day":13,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1316,"day":13,"line":"Daniela doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."},{"seq":1317,"day":13,"line":"Daniela steps closer. \"We need to talk. About who's actually running things here.\""},{"seq":1318,"day":13,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1319,"day":13,"line":"Daniela watches you give the order. \"Interesting. Nobody asked me.\""},{"seq":1320,"day":13,"line":"Recipe: Crude bow (Level 1). You have seen a crude bow. A bent branch and a cord — simple enough to copy, hard enough to shoot."},{"seq":1321,"day":13,"line":"Recipe: Hide armor (Level 1). You have seen hide armor. Tough cured skin, cut and laced into a cuirass."},{"seq":1322,"day":13,"line":"Taken: Crude bow x1, Alien helm x1, Hide armor x1, Pitch torch x1, Anchor's Locket x1, Stethoscope x1."},{"seq":1323,"day":13,"line":"You take crude bow, alien helm, hide armor, pitch torch, anchor's locket, stethoscope from Ruth. Your hands know what they did. (+6 trauma)"},{"seq":1324,"day":13,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":1325,"day":13,"line":"Caleb leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Drum-Belly. Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer.\""},{"seq":1326,"day":13,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Drum-Belly: Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1327,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Strike the taut drum — When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer."},{"seq":1328,"day":13,"line":"You eat Lamb's Quarters (500 kcal)."},{"seq":1329,"day":13,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":1330,"day":13,"line":"Equipped Crude bow (ranged)."},{"seq":1331,"day":13,"line":"The full set (60) is back on top over your pieces (47). Sometimes simple wins."},{"seq":1332,"day":13,"line":"Unequipped Hatchet."},{"seq":1333,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (159 logs now.)"},{"seq":1334,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (28 stone now.)"},{"seq":1335,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Carlos pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (29 stone now.)"},{"seq":1336,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Otto hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (168 