1352,"day":13,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1353,"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +2197 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1354,"day":13,"line":"Aria paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":1355,"day":13,"line":"Otto drew Bracken Fiddlehead in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":1356,"day":13,"line":"Caleb spends the afternoon with the thorny bush with dark berries — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":1357,"day":13,"line":"From the lumped bag: Blackberry — named, and out."},{"seq":1358,"day":13,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 65. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 5.\""},{"seq":1359,"day":13,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Blackberry. Thorny canes, dark berries. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1360,"day":13,"line":"💡 Blackberry. The thorny bush with dark berries you've been looking at for days finally has a name, and now you'll never unsee it."},{"seq":1361,"day":13,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":1362,"day":13,"line":"Minh was watching. Now they know Blackberry too."},{"seq":1363,"day":13,"line":"🔍 Aria crouches over a small tree with huge brown fuzzy pods hanging from the trunk, smelling of chocolate and pineapple, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)"},{"seq":1364,"day":13,"line":"Aria is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 81/100)"},{"seq":1365,"day":13,"line":"Adil: \"Walked past a good stand of bracken fiddlehead. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":1366,"day":13,"line":"Oscar and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1367,"day":13,"line":"Daniela and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1368,"day":13,"line":"Aria and Otto lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1369,"day":13,"line":"🍽️ Aria taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":1370,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Bissap Hibiscus — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1371,"day":13,"line":"💡 Bissap Hibiscus: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1372,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Water Hemlock — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1373,"day":13,"line":"💡 Water Hemlock: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1374,"day":13,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":1375,"day":14,"line":"— DAY 14 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1376,"day":14,"line":"Overnight, Lamb's Quarters; Lamb's Quarters; unknown berries; Muscadine Grapes went bad — beyond saving. You leave them for the flies."},{"seq":1377,"day":14,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1378,"day":14,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Blackberry — named and noted."},{"seq":1379,"day":14,"line":"◈ HAVEN — The easy closeness has thinned a little. Nobody's fault. Weather changes."},{"seq":1380,"day":14,"line":"🔥 Otto has been turning something over all evening. Finally: “Oscar. The past story — we all eat from the same pot here, we don’t get to lie about who’s at it.” It costs Otto to say it; you can see the price land."},{"seq":1381,"day":14,"line":"People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one."},{"seq":1382,"day":14,"line":"Something has shifted. Conversations stop when you approach the fire. Nobody meets your eyes for long."},{"seq":1383,"day":14,"line":"📓 Codex: The village has gone quiet around me. I don't know why — I've eaten only what was set before me."},{"seq":1384,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1385,"day":14,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1386,"day":14,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1387,"day":14,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1388,"day":14,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1389,"day":14,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1390,"day":14,"line":"💧 Otto returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1391,"day":14,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (31 stone now.)"},{"seq":1392,"day":14,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1393,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Otto telling Aria about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1394,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Carlos telling Adil about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1395,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (30 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1396,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (54 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1397,"day":14,"line":"👥 Daniela heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":1398,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (63 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1399,"day":14,"line":