line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"A viewer sent this. A FAN. We checked. It is not dinner.\" A pause. \"We checked twice. The fans are very insistent that you open it ON CAMERA.\""},{"seq":1451,"day":14,"line":"The package sits in your pack, unopened. Opening it takes a day-part — the fans demand the full unboxing. (Use it from your pack when you have a morning to spend.)"},{"seq":1452,"day":14,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1453,"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +2327 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1454,"day":14,"line":"Aria drew Water Chestnut in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":1455,"day":14,"line":"Adil traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1456,"day":14,"line":"Aria traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1457,"day":14,"line":"Aria and Caleb lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1458,"day":14,"line":"Benoit and Daniela lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1459,"day":14,"line":"🍽️ Aria sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\""},{"seq":1460,"day":14,"line":"📓 Codex: Otto taught Benoit Reading Tracks."},{"seq":1461,"day":14,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":1462,"day":14,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":1463,"day":15,"line":"— DAY 15 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1464,"day":15,"line":"Overnight, Blackberry went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":1465,"day":15,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":1466,"day":15,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1467,"day":15,"line":"\"Cache by the hollow. Dried meat, clean water. I can't stay. — W.\""},{"seq":1468,"day":15,"line":"(268 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1469,"day":15,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1470,"day":15,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1471,"day":15,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1472,"day":15,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1473,"day":15,"line":"🌱 Otto waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1474,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Otto checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the stone pile instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1475,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (36 stone now.)"},{"seq":1476,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (208 logs now.)"},{"seq":1477,"day":15,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1478,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Aria about you. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1479,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (66 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1480,"day":15,"line":"Caleb heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":1481,"day":15,"line":"Carlos heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1482,"day":15,"line":"Otto is down by the firepit, nudging coals back into the middle."},{"seq":1483,"day":15,"line":"Minh is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft."},{"seq":1484,"day":15,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1485,"day":15,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1486,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1487,"day":15,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1488,"day":15,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1489,"day":15,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1490,"day":15,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 6L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1491,"day":15,"line":"💧 Daniela eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1492,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (38 stone now.)"},{"seq":1493,"day":15,"line":"Aria heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":1494,"day":15,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1495,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1496,"day":15,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 20L left."},{"seq":1497,"day":15,"line":"Oscar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1498,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (39 stone now.)"},{"seq":1499,"day":15,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 1L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1500,"day":15,"line":"Daniela stopped asking. They just started organizing the Fish crews. Nobody stopped them."},{"seq":1501,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Caleb returns from foraging the wilds: +137 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 137 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1502,"day":15,"line":"💧 Carlos returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1503,"day":15,"line":"Benoit is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":1504,"day":15,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1505,"day":15,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":1506,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1507,"day":15,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":1508,"day":15,"line":"Something moves out there — Lockpick."},{"seq":1509,"day":15,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1510,"day":15,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":1511,"day":15,"line":"It followed you. The Lockpick is here."},{"seq":1512,"day":15,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":1513,"day":15,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 18× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1514,"day":15,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1515,"day":15,"line":"The Lockpick stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":1516,"day":15,"line":"You keep a day's food (80 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1517,"day":15,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1518,"day":15,"line":"You lay out the haul. Otto leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1519,"day":15,"line":"📖 Otto starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":1520,"day":15,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1521,"day":15,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1522,"day":15,"line":"You coax 1 growing bed forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1523,"day":15,"line":"🌀 Green Thumb, Literally is STRAINING at its edges. The gift wants to become something — and it wants YOU to choose what."},{"seq":1524,"day":15,"line":"\"IT’S MOLTING! We didn’t program molting! This is YOUR doing! CHOOSE! Choose what it becomes!\""},{"seq":1525,"day":15,"line":"(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)"},{"seq":1526,"day":15,"line":"\"Yes! YES! That's the comprehension we calibrated for! Keep going! The sponsors are doubling down!\""},{"seq":1527,"day":15,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1528,"day":15,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1529,"day":15,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1530,"day":15,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":1531,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 7 wood. The pile grows. (215 logs now.)"},{"seq":1532,"day":15,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (220 logs now.)"},{"seq":1533,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Carlos pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (40 stone now.)"},{"seq":1534,"day":15,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (42 stone now.)"},{"seq":1535,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Aria returns from foraging the wilds: +102 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 102 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1536,"day":15,"line":"📨 Word came: Zoltan Nagy wants to join Haven. \"I can work. That's all I'm selling.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":1537,"day":15,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":1538,"day":15,"line":"Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."},{"seq":1539,"day":15,"line":"The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."},{"seq":1540,"day":15,"line":"The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."},{"seq":1541,"day":15,"line":"Otto counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"seq":1542,"day":15,"line":"A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""},{"seq":1543,"day":15,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":1544,"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +2239 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1545,"day":15,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Benoit fixing something."},{"seq":1546,"day":15,"line":"Caleb is showing everyone Blackberry by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1547,"day":15,"line":"Carlos traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1548,"day":15,"line":"Oscar came back with 624 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 312 kcal in, 312 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":1549,"day":15,"line":"Carlos and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1550,"day":15,"line":"Aria and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1551,"day":15,"line":"Benoit and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1552,"day":15,"line":"🍽️ Daniela carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":1553,"day":15,"line":"✦ Minh has found something — Closed Loop. Days of camp_cook and compost_king side by side, and now they move as one. (closed_loop: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1554,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Minh discovered Closed Loop (closed_loop)."},{"seq":1555,"day":15,"line":"✦ Aria has found something — Peacemaker's Voice. Days of diplomat and mediator side by side, and now they move as one. (peacemakers_voice: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1556,"day":15,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the 