:"⚔️ Aria stood down the Lockpick and kept walking — 1 round, bloodied but breathing. It's still out there, somewhere."},{"seq":1597,"day":16,"line":"You keep a day's food (650 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1598,"day":16,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1599,"day":16,"line":"You lay out the haul. Otto leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1600,"day":16,"line":"📖 Otto starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1601,"day":16,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1602,"day":16,"line":"You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1603,"day":16,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1604,"day":16,"line":"You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1605,"day":16,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1606,"day":16,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1607,"day":16,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1608,"day":16,"line":"📋 Otto — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1609,"day":16,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1610,"day":16,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1611,"day":16,"line":"You eat Blackberry (390 kcal)."},{"seq":1612,"day":16,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1613,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Daniela checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1614,"day":16,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (229 logs now.)"},{"seq":1615,"day":16,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (44 stone now.)"},{"seq":1616,"day":16,"line":"🪵 Carlos hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (235 logs now.)"},{"seq":1617,"day":16,"line":"🪨 Otto pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (45 stone now.)"},{"seq":1618,"day":16,"line":"🪵 Oscar hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (240 logs now.)"},{"seq":1619,"day":16,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1620,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Caleb returns from foraging the wilds: +236 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 235 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1621,"day":16,"line":"💬 Caleb has Adil's ear — quiet talk, the kind that doesn't need an audience."},{"seq":1622,"day":16,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1623,"day":16,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":1624,"day":16,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (47 stone now.)"},{"seq":1625,"day":16,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (249 logs now.)"},{"seq":1626,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Caleb telling Benoit about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1627,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Carlos returns from foraging the wilds: +300 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 299 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1628,"day":16,"line":"Daniela is at the cookpot, tasting off the spoon, frowning, adding a pinch of something."},{"seq":1629,"day":16,"line":"🍲 Aria eats with Otto — bowls side by side, talk low."},{"seq":1630,"day":16,"line":"🐗 RAID — 4 raiders (Extended Warranty, Lockpick, The Moderator, Static) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":1631,"day":16,"line":"🚨 Extended Warranty, Lockpick, The Moderator, Static is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"seq":1632,"day":16,"line":"The village feels it — the bond dips, but holds. They endure together."},{"seq":1633,"day":16,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Otto is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1634,"day":16,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":1635,"day":16,"line":"📖 The entry for Otto is finished. 1 deed recorded. No more pages."},{"seq":1636,"day":16,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Lockpick: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (Two survived encounters — the fire has a theory.)"},{"seq":1637,"day":16,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Buy it off — It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase."},{"seq":1638,"day":16,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Moderator is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1639,"day":16,"line":"🛡️ Otto, Minh, Daniela and Adil met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 driven off, 1 barely walked away. Otto didn't come back. Minh, Daniela, Adil are hurt."},{"seq":1640,"day":16,"line":"One of them is coming for YOU — Extended Warranty, inside the haven, eyes on your bedroll."},{"seq":1641,"day":16,"line":"A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":1642,"day":16,"line":"The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."},{"seq":1643,"day":16,"line":"The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."},{"seq":1644,"day":16,"line":"Otto counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"seq":1645,"day":16,"line":"A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""},{"seq":1646,"day":16,"line":"🔇 The birds have gone quiet. Even the crickets. The woods are holding their breath."},{"seq":1647,"day":16,"line":"Something out there knows exactly where you sleep. It isn't howling. That's the worst part — it isn't making a sound at all."},{"seq":1648,"day":16,"line":"Three shapes at the treeline — dog-shaped silences, circling. (A real pack is out there now: 3 of them. No names yet — nobody's lived to argue about one.)"},{"seq":1649,"day":16,"line":"Investigate and the morning is gone — tracking them costs a full day-part. Bar the door and you learn nothing. Your call."},{"seq":1650,"day":16,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1651,"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +2136 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1652,"day":16,"line":"Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Caleb goes to sit with them."},{"seq":1653,"day":16,"line":"Daniela came back with 610 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1654,"day":16,"line":"Caleb and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1655,"day":16,"line":"Caleb and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1656,"day":16,"line":"Carlos and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1657,"day":16,"line":"🍽️ Carlos taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":1658,"day":16,"line":"✦ Benoit has found something — Closed Loop. Days of camp_cook and compost_king side by side, and now they move as one. (closed_loop: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1659,"day":16,"line":"📓 Codex: Carlos taught Daniela Reading Tracks."},{"seq":1660,"day":16,"line":"📓 Codex: Aria taught Caleb Reading Tracks."},{"seq":1661,"day":17,"line":"— DAY 17 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1662,"day":17,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":1663,"day":17,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE BREACH. It got INSIDE. The haven was supposed to be the safe place — the one place. It isn’t."},{"seq":1664,"day":17,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\""},{"seq":1665,"day":17,"line":"The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline."},{"seq":1666,"day":17,"line":"You don't know what that was. A phone ringing in the trees, and no phone anywhere. Someone at the haven should hear about this."},{"seq":1667,"day":17,"line":"⚔ EXTENDED WARRANTY! Carlos joins you!"},{"seq":1668,"day":17,"line":"Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."},{"seq":1669,"day":17,"line":"Carlos doesn't look away. \"About time someone fought back.\""},{"seq":1670,"day":17,"line":"Ring-ring. It's not calling you this time. It's calling Carlos — and they're reaching for a phone that isn't there."},{"seq":1671,"day":17,"line":"🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer."},{"seq":1672,"day":17,"line":"(The game is telling you something: this is bigger than one person. Talk to your companions — \"We should name this. Us.\")"},{"seq":1673,"day":17,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel."},{"seq":1674,"day":17,"line":"You STRIKE the warranty for 35 (Crude bow)."},{"seq":1675,"day":17,"line":"📺 +5 style — solid hit"},{"seq":1676,"day":17,"line":"Carlos strikes the Extended Warranty."},{"seq":1677,"day":17,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Carlos fights on a full belly."},{"seq":1678,"day":17,"line":"Carlos hits warranty for 13."},{"seq":1679,"day":17,"line":"warranty is hurt — and it goes quiet and clever. It stops rushing. It starts CHOOSING. Watch the spacing."},{"seq":1680,"day":17,"line":"\"—BAD CONNECTION—\" The voice fragments, furious. It hangs up on Carlos and redials."},{"seq":1681,"day":17,"line":"\"—BAD CONNECTION—\" The voice fragments, furious. It hangs up. It is already redialing."},{"seq":1682,"day":17,"line":"No arrow left. Your Crude bow is a stick you hold wrong."},{"seq":1683,"day":17,"line":"Carlos strikes the Extended Warranty."},{"seq":1684,"day":17,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Carlos fights on a full belly."},{"seq":1685,"day":17,"line":"Carlos hits warranty for 18."},{"seq":1686,"day":17,"line":"Hold music, faint, from the treeline. It is redialing."},{"seq":1687,"day":17,"line":"No arrow left. Your Crude bow is a stick you hold wrong."},{"seq":1688,"day":17,"line":"Carlos strikes the Extended Warranty."},{"seq":1689,"day":17,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Carlos fights on a full belly."},{"seq":1690,"day":17,"line":"Carlos hits warranty for 14."},{"seq":1691,"day":17,"line":"No arrow left. Your Crude bow is a stick you hold wrong."},{"seq":1692,"day":17,"line":"Carlos strikes the Extended Warranty."},{"seq":1693,"day":17,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): Carlos fights on a full belly."},{"seq":1694,"day":17,"line":"Carlos hits warranty for 16."},{"seq":1695,"day":17,"line":"The Extended Warranty falls."},{"seq":1696,"day":17,"line":"Carlos laughs, disbelieving. \"Did you SEE that?\""},{"seq":1697,"day":17,"line":"It is a phone. Do not eat the phone."},{"seq":1698,"day":17,"line":"✨ ALIEN LOOT: Phase sling. The pouch phases half a second ahead of your hand. Stones arrive before you throw them. It's on the body — search it."},{"seq":1699,"day":17,"line":"You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire."},{"seq":1700,"day":17,"line":"◈ TRIAL RECOGNIZED — the System has been watching. You WON a fight. Not survived — won. The audience is still standing. So are you. (Combat track +)"},{"seq":1701,"day":17,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1702,"day":17,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1703,"day":17,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1704,"day":17,"line":"Daniela folds their arms. \"Sure. Your call. For now.\""},{"seq":1705,"day":17,"line":"Equipped Hatchet (melee)."},{"seq":1706,"day":17,"line":"The static resolves into something almost like a voice. Almost like yours."},{"seq":1707,"day":17,"line":"📻 It moves."},{"seq":1708,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Daniela worked the creek — 3 fish, +450 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1709,"day":17,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1710,"day":17,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 3L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1711,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (10 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1712,"day":17,"line":"Carlos heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":1713,"day":17,"line":"Oscar sits by the door re-lacing a strap, testing each pull before the next."},{"seq":1714,"day":17,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1715,"day":17,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":1716,"day":17,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1717,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1718,"day":17,"line":"The static resolves into something almost like a voice. Almost like yours."},{"seq":1719,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Daniela worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1720,"day":17,"line":"💧 Daniela eyes the cistern — full to the brim. No sense hauling water there's no room for; they turn to the stone pile instead."},{"seq":1721,"day":17,"line":"🪨 Daniela pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (49 stone now.)"},{"seq":1722,"day":17,"line":"📖 Benoit is walking Daniela through the giant rhubarb-like leaves, round burrs, first-year = leaf rosette with no stalk — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour."},{"seq":1723,"day":17,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1724,"day":17,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":1725,"day":17,"line":"🛟 Carlos stands up by the fire. \"We can't just watch this happen. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1726,"day":17,"line":"\"We can bind the wounds, or go lean, or hunt hard to replace what we lost. Say which — standing here isn't an answer.\""},{"seq":1727,"day":17,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Carlos adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1728,"day":17,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1729,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1730,"day":17,"line":"\"HELP ME,\" says the dark, in your friend's voice. Your friend is asleep in the haven."},{"seq":1731,"day":17,"line":"📻 It moves."},{"seq":1732,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Daniela worked the creek — 3 fish, +450 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1733,"day":17,"line":"🪵 Daniela hauls back 8 wood. The pile grows. (254 logs now.)"},{"seq":1734,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Carlos returns from foraging the wilds: +397 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1735,"day":17,"line":"📖 Benoit is showing Adil a weedy mustard with yellow flowers and peppery basal leaves — where it grows, what's safe to eat."},{"seq":1736,"day":17,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1737,"day":17,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Daniela has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Moderator — I put it down today.\" \"It reviews you. 'Content noted.' A weak ranging chip while it decides.\" \"'REMOVAL NOTICE.' Defiant or compliant — the hammer is coming down.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Caleb says quietly \"So it bleeds.\" Adil says quietly \"Did it look at you? Bef"},{"seq":1738,"day":17,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1739,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1740,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":1741,"day":17,"line":"The Static stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there."},{"seq":1742,"day":17,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":1743,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Caleb about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1744,"day":17,"line":"★ Deeper knowledge: Pawpaw. Parts: fruit only. Seeds and skin are not food. Ripe = soft, fragrant. (Yield +50%). Use unlocked: food: custard-sweet fruit when fully ripe and soft."},{"seq":1745,"day":17,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× Hickory Nuts, 6× Pawpaw (480 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1746,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1747,"day":17,"line":"The Lockpick stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there."},{"seq":1748,"day":17,"line":"While you were gone — 4 things you missed:"},{"seq":1749,"day":17,"line":"💀 The Extended Warranty killed Otto in 7 rounds. The village mourns."},{"seq":1750,"day":17,"line":"⚔️ Minh stood down the Lockpick and kept walking — 3 rounds, bloodied but breathing. It's still out there, somewhere."},{"seq":1751,"day":17,"line":"⚔️ Daniela killed the Moderator with their party — 11 rounds, 91 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1752,"day":17,"line":"🩸 The Static mauled Adil (-59 health) over 3 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing. — staying out of sight for the rest of the day — too hurt to meet it again"},{"seq":1753,"day":17,"line":"You keep a day's food (480 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1754,"day":17,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1755,"day":17,"line":"You lay out the haul. Daniela leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1756,"day":17,"line":"📖 Daniela starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1757,"day":17,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1758,"day":17,"line":"Aria will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":1759,"day":17,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1760,"day":17,"line":"You sow Pawpaw: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1761,"day":17,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1762,"day":17,"line":"📻 It moves."},{"seq":1763,"day":17,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1764,"day":17,"line":"Harvest: 75× Sassafras. About 1500 kcal before preparation."},{"seq":1765,"day":17,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1766,"day":17,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Pawpaw. Uses: highest-calorie wild fruit in the east. Eat fresh; doesn't keep. (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: custard-sweet fruit when fully ripe and soft; bait: strong scent draws animals."},{"seq":1767,"day":17,"line":"You eat Pawpaw and Sassafras (500 kcal)."},{"seq":1768,"day":17,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1769,"day":17,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1770,"day":17,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1771,"day":17,"line":"📋 Daniela — 🍲 Cook. Daniela nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1772,"day":17,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1773,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Carlos worked the creek — 4 fish, +588 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1774,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1775,"day":17,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 1 fish, +105 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1776,"day":17,"line":"🍲 Daniela cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1777,"day":17,"line":"Aria is tending the fire, coaxing it steady."},{"seq":1778,"day":17,"line":"◈ THE CREEP — Nadia's thoughts have an echo now. The System's echo. Or theirs. Hard to tell anymore. Gifts used in sequence resonate — try them together. (Ability slots: 5)"},{"seq":1779,"day":17,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+8 integration)"},{"seq":1780,"day":17,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 19 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1781,"day":17,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":1782,"day":17,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1783,"day":17,"line":"🌟 \"We have detected elevated attachment to Unit IRONFIST WRAPS. This is inefficient. This is also... [PROCESSING] ...valuable? Optimization available.\" (Choose an enhancement for your Ironfist Wraps.)"},{"seq":1784,"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +2440 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":1785,"day":17,"line":"Caleb is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 59/100)"},{"seq":1786,"day":17,"line":"Aria and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1787,"day":17,"line":"🌿 Lemongrass — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1788,"day":17,"line":"💡 Lemongrass: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1789,"day":18,"line":"— DAY 18 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1790,"day":18,"line":"The fire burns low. 3 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Pawpaw — understood at last."},{"seq":1791,"day":18,"line":"💬 Benoit says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\""},{"seq":1792,"day":18,"line":"You overhear it at the fire, and stop pretending not to listen. Riders from Ashford are telling the deer story again — with your name attached this time."},{"seq":1793,"day":18,"line":"Taken: Flannel Shirt x1, Crowbar x1, Energy drink x1."},{"seq":1794,"day":18,"line":"You take flannel shirt, crowbar, energy drink from Otto. Your hands know what they did. (+18 trauma)"},{"seq":1795,"day":18,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":1796,"day":18,"line":"Minh leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Extended Warranty. Never stand still. The RING is the telegraph — the pitch itself gives no warning. Move two or more tiles from where you stood when it dialed and the call drops. It can only dial a stationary target. Never stand still.\""},{"seq":1797,"day":18,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Extended Warranty: Never stand still. The RING is the telegraph — the pitch itself gives no warning. Move two or more tiles from where you stood when it dialed and the call drops. It can only dial a stationary target. Never stand still. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1798,"day":18,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never stand still — The RING is the telegraph — the pitch itself gives no warning. Move two or more tiles from where you stood when it dialed and the call drops. It can only dial a stationary target. Never stand still."},{"seq":1799,"day":18,"line":"It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."},{"seq":1800,"day":18,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1801,"day":18,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1802,"day":18,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1803,"day":18,"line":"Daniela mutters something under their breath. You catch only the last word: \"again.\""},{"seq":1804,"day":18,"line":"Crying, in the dark. A voice you know. It sounds exactly like them — but they're safe at the haven. Aren't they?"},{"seq":1805,"day":18,"line":"The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline."},{"seq":1806,"day":18,"line":"You don't know what that was. Crying in the dark — a voice you almost recognize. Someone at the haven should hear about this."},{"seq":1807,"day":18,"line":"⚔ STATIC! You're on your own."},{"seq":1808,"day":18,"line":"Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."},{"seq":1809,"day":18,"line":"🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer."},{"seq":1810,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Daniela worked the creek — 5 fish, +900 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1811,"day":18,"line":"💧 Daniela returns with 14L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1812,"day":18,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 3L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1813,"day":18,"line":"Daniela doesn't bother arguing anymore. By dusk the Fetch water crews are taking orders from them, and nobody quite remembers when it changed."},{"seq":1814,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Oscar about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1815,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Caleb about Benoit. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1816,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (10 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1817,"da