"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2054,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 3 fish, +500 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2055,"day":20,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2056,"day":20,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":2057,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Aria about herself. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2058,"day":20,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Fully identify 3 plants (knowledge level 3) within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":2059,"day":20,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2060,"day":20,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2061,"day":20,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2062,"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +2253 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2063,"day":20,"line":"Carlos set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":2064,"day":20,"line":"Aria: \"The white oak acorns patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\""},{"seq":2065,"day":20,"line":"Adil and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2066,"day":20,"line":"Caleb and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2067,"day":20,"line":"🌿 Dandelion — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2068,"day":20,"line":"💡 Dandelion: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":2069,"day":20,"line":"🌿 Water Chestnut — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2070,"day":20,"line":"💡 Water Chestnut: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":2071,"day":20,"line":"🌿 Bracken Fiddlehead — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2072,"day":20,"line":"💡 Bracken Fiddlehead: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":2073,"day":20,"line":"🌿 Mesquite — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2074,"day":20,"line":"💡 Mesquite: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":2075,"day":20,"line":"Your Snare 1 tile north sits empty. You read the ground on the way in — no sign, no promise."},{"seq":2076,"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":2077,"day":21,"line":"— DAY 21 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2078,"day":21,"line":"👀 You caught Oscar rehearsing — muttering details about Denver under their breath before the evening fire, like someone cramming for a part."},{"seq":2079,"day":21,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":2080,"day":21,"line":"\"I left bandages where the path bends. Don't thank me. Just live.\""},{"seq":2081,"day":21,"line":"(226 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":2082,"day":21,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+2 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2083,"day":21,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2084,"day":21,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2085,"day":21,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2086,"day":21,"line":"🌱 Caleb works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2087,"day":21,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2088,"day":21,"line":"Benoit showed Caleb the small tree with huge brown fuzzy pods hanging from the trunk, smelling of chocolate and pineapple — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":2089,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2090,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (10 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2091,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Caleb is still hurting (59 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2092,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Carlos is still hurting (8 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2093,"day":21,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2094,"day":21,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2095,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2096,"day":21,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2097,"day":21,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2098,"day":21,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Benoit sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Benoit.)"},{"seq":2099,"day":21,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2100,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2101,"day":21,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 21L left."},{"seq":2102,"day":21,"line":"Benoit has opinions about the firewood situation and needs you to hear them."},{"seq":2103,"day":21,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2104,"day":21,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":2105,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2106,"day":21,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2107,"day":21,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Adil about Carlos. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2108,"day":21,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2109,"day":21,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2110,"day":21,"line":"Something moves out there — Extended Warranty."},{"seq":2111,"day":21,"line":"★ Deeper knowledge: White Oak Acorns. Parts: nut meat (must leach tannins), caps (nothing). White oak = less tannin than red. (Yield +50%). Use unlocked: food: leach the tannins in water, then grind to meal."},{"seq":2112,"day":21,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":2113,"day":21,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":2114,"day":21,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 25× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2115,"day":21,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2116,"day":21,"line":"The Extended Warranty stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2117,"day":21,"line":"You keep a day's food (1400 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2118,"day":21,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2119,"day":21,"line":"You lay out the haul. Oscar leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2120,"day":21,"line":"📖 Oscar starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":2121,"day":21,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2122,"day":21,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":2123,"day":21,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2124,"day":21,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2125,"day":21,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2126,"day":21,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2127,"day":21,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2128,"day":21,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2129,"day":21,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":2130,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Carlos worked the creek — 4 fish, +735 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2131,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 4 fish, +750 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2132,"day":21,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2133,"day":21,"line":"Aria showed Carlos the small tree with huge brown fuzzy pods hanging from the trunk, smelling of chocolate and pineapple — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":2134,"day":21,"line":"🐪 A trader from the downriver village walks into Haven, pack heavy, smile practiced. River-mud on their boots, river-gossip on their tongue."},{"seq":2135,"day":21,"line":"\"Heard you people eat REGULARLY now,\" they say. \"Heard the sky talks to you. I have news — some of it might even be true.\""},{"seq":2136,"day":21,"line":"Feed a guest: about 600 kcal from the stores. Trading takes a full day-part. Rudeness is free — but the river remembers. (They'll be here till dusk.)"},{"seq":2137,"day":21,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Cupuaçu. Big brown pod, incredible smell, tangy cream inside. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":2138,"day":21,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":2139,"day":21,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Aria taught everyone about Cupuaçu. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":2140,"day":21,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2141,"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +2250 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2142,"day":21,"line":"Benoit traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2143,"day":21,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Carlos — Field 1. Three offers; they took Echo Location. Earned, chosen. (echo_location: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2144,"day":21,"line":"📓 Codex: Carlos chose Echo Location (echo_location) at Field 1."},{"seq":2145,"day":21,"line":"Carlos came back with 486 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2146,"day":21,"line":"Adil and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2147,"day":21,"line":"✦ Oscar has found something — Closed Loop. Days of camp_cook and compost_king side by side, and now they move as one. (closed_loop: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":2148,"day":21,"line":"🌿 Muscadine Grapes — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2149,"day":21,"line":"💡 Muscadine Grapes: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":2150,"day":21,"line":"🌿 Hickory Nuts — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2151,"day":21,"line":"🤒 Carlos is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2152,"day":21,"line":"🛟 Benoit stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":2153,"day":21,"line":"\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\""},{"seq":2154,"day":21,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Benoit adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":2155,"day":21,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":2156,"day":21,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":2157,"day":22,"line":"— DAY 22 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2158,"day":22,"line":"Overnight, Pawpaw went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":2159,"day":22,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":2160,"day":22,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: White Oak Acorns — handled into knowledge."},{"seq":2161,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2162,"day":22,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2163,"day":22,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2164,"day":22,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2165,"day":22,"line":"👂 Overheard — Minh: \"The creek's lower than yesterday. Markedly.\""},{"seq":2166,"day":22,"line":"👂 Overheard — Benoit: \"Good. I'll take the first rotation. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":2167,"day":22,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Benoit sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Benoit.)"},{"seq":2168,"day":22,"line":"👂 Overheard — Minh: \"Something's been at the pantry. Not an animal — the jars were moved, not broken.\""},{"seq":2169,"day":22,"line":"👂 Overheard — Benoit: \"Good. I'll take the first rotation. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":2170,"day":22,"line":"🌱 Caleb works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2171,"day":22,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2172,"day":22,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Minh about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2173,"day":22,"line":"💬 Benoit whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":2174,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2175,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (10 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2176,"day":22,"line":"🩹 Caleb is still hurting (59 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2177,"day":22,"line":"👥 Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":2178,"day":22,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2179,"day":22,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2180,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2181,"day":22,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2182,"day":22,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 11L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2183,"day":22,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2184,"day":22,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2185,"day":22,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2186,"day":22,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Aria telling Carlos about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":2187,"day":22,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2188,"day":22,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2189,"d