today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":2208,"day":22,"line":"📋 Caleb — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2209,"day":22,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2210,"day":22,"line":"You eat Blackberry (520 kcal)."},{"seq":2211,"day":22,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2212,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Carlos worked the creek — 4 fish, +980 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2213,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2214,"day":22,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 3 fish, +450 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2215,"day":22,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Lucky Rock. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":2216,"day":22,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Minh — Field 1. Three offers; they took Lucky Rock. Earned, chosen. (lucky_rock: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2217,"day":22,"line":"📓 Codex: Minh chose Lucky Rock (lucky_rock) at Field 1."},{"seq":2218,"day":22,"line":"🍲 Caleb cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2219,"day":22,"line":"💧 Aria returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":2220,"day":22,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2221,"day":22,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2222,"day":22,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2223,"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +2000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2224,"day":22,"line":"Benoit is humming something. It stops when they notice you listening."},{"seq":2225,"day":22,"line":"Aria is showing everyone Cupuaçu by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":2226,"day":22,"line":"Benoit came back with 558 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2227,"day":22,"line":"🤒 Aria is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2228,"day":22,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":2229,"day":23,"line":"— DAY 23 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2230,"day":23,"line":"👀 Oscar let a place-name slip — somewhere that isn't Denver — then covered it with \"Denver\" so fast the cover was louder than the slip."},{"seq":2231,"day":23,"line":"🔪 Carlos attacked Benoit! The village erupts — this is beyond theft or threats."},{"seq":2232,"day":23,"line":"It was brutal. Benoit is hurt badly."},{"seq":2233,"day":23,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":2234,"day":23,"line":"The village is rattled. Everyone's jumpy — eyes on the treeline."},{"seq":2235,"day":23,"line":"You don't know what that was. Something in the dark, laughing at you specifically. Someone at the haven should hear about this."},{"seq":2236,"day":23,"line":"⚔ THE HECKLER! You're on your own."},{"seq":2237,"day":23,"line":"Turn-based now. Tap a tile to move — speed is squares. Then act."},{"seq":2238,"day":23,"line":"It is watching you the way a cat watches a dropped glass."},{"seq":2239,"day":23,"line":"It laughs at you. Specifically at you. The laugh has notes."},{"seq":2240,"day":23,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel."},{"seq":2241,"day":23,"line":"You STRIKE the heckler for 31 (Hatchet)."},{"seq":2242,"day":23,"line":"📺 +5 style — solid hit"},{"seq":2243,"day":23,"line":"The words stick. Your arms feel heavier. (SHAME 1: -1 damage.)"},{"seq":2244,"day":23,"line":"\"Do it again! Do it again, I want to see if it gets worse.\""},{"seq":2245,"day":23,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel."},{"seq":2246,"day":23,"line":"heckler is BLEEDING — and it likes it. Louder, faster, no more feints."},{"seq":2247,"day":23,"line":"You STRIKE the heckler for 30 (Hatchet)."},{"seq":2248,"day":23,"line":"📺 +5 style — solid hit"},{"seq":2249,"day":23,"line":"The words stick. Your arms feel heavier. (SHAME 2: -2 damage.)"},{"seq":2250,"day":23,"line":"\"Do it again! Do it again, I want to see if it gets worse.\" The laugh multiplies — a whole crowd that isn't there, and every throat is laughing at you. (PILE-ON: +2 SHAME)"},{"seq":2251,"day":23,"line":"\"Oh, we've got a LIVE ONE!\" It has your number now. (3+ SHAME: answer back next turn or act and take +2.)"},{"seq":2252,"day":23,"line":"📖 Codex: Vicious Mockery — locks onto one target — moving won't dodge it. You won't forget this."},{"seq":2253,"day":23,"line":"Armor absorbs 5."},{"seq":2254,"day":23,"line":"The words find the soft places. (6 psychic — the mockery cuts.)"},{"seq":2255,"day":23,"line":"The words become a weight. You WANT to answer back. (Next turn: WAIT to answer (lose the turn, clear 3 shame) or act and take +2 shame.)"},{"seq":2256,"day":23,"line":"\"See? SEE? Can't even listen.\" The defiance feeds it. (+2 SHAME)"},{"seq":2257,"day":23,"line":"OVERCHARGED ×1.25 (well-fed): food is fuel."},{"seq":2258,"day":23,"line":"The Heckler falls."},{"seq":2259,"day":23,"line":"You STRIKE the heckler for 30 (Hatchet)."},{"seq":2260,"day":23,"line":"📺 +5 style — solid hit"},{"seq":2261,"day":23,"line":"📺 +20 style — dropped the Heckler!"},{"seq":2262,"day":23,"line":"It is all mouth. You are not hungry enough."},{"seq":2263,"day":23,"line":"You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire."},{"seq":2264,"day":23,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Berserker Rage. They say some fighters stop thinking and start winning."},{"seq":2265,"day":23,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Caleb — Combat 1. Three offers; they took Berserker Rage. Earned, chosen. (rage: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2266,"day":23,"line":"📓 Codex: Caleb chose Berserker Rage (rage) at Combat 1."},{"seq":2267,"day":23,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2268,"day":23,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2269,"day":23,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2270,"day":23,"line":"Equipped Hardlight knife (melee)."},{"seq":2271,"day":23,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2272,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2273,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Adil is still hurting (10 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2274,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Caleb is still hurting (22 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2275,"day":23,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2276,"day":23,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2277,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2278,"day":23,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Adil telling Oscar about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2279,"day":23,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2280,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2281,"day":23,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Aria telling Minh about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2282,"day":23,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Carlos about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":2283,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Carlos is still hurting (3 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2284,"day":23,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2285,"day":23,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Caleb has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Hummice — I put it down today.\" \"A low hum rises from the grass. It harmonizes with itself. Your teeth ache.\" \"Teeth in the grass, everywhere at once — a tide of small bites.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Benoit mutters \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Oscar breathes \"So it bleeds.\" Someone "},{"seq":2286,"day":23,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":2287,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2288,"day":23,"line":"💛 You hold Mixtape. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2289,"day":23,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2290,"day":23,"line":"Something moves out there — Big Loud."},{"seq":2291,"day":23,"line":"Something big pads at the edge of the clearing — then thinks better of it. This ground is already claimed."},{"seq":2292,"day":23,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":2293,"day":23,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Oscar is calling it \"Big Big.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2294,"day":23,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 12× Hickory Nuts, 15× Pawpaw (1200 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2295,"day":23,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2296,"day":23,"line":"The Big Loud stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2297,"day":23,"line":"You keep a day's food (1850 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2298,"day":23,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2299,"day":23,"line":"You lay out the haul. Oscar leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2300,"day":23,"line":"📖 Oscar starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":2301,"day":23,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 21 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2302,"day":23,"line":"Aria will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":2303,"day":23,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":2304,"day":23,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2305,"day":23,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2306,"day":23,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2307,"day":23,"line":"Your pack is full (19.1 kg of 20 kg) — 75× Sassafras (7.5 kg, 1500 kcal) goes straight to the pantry instead."},{"seq":2308,"day":23,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2309,"day":23,"line":"You eat Blackberry and Pawpaw (610 kcal)."},{"seq":2310,"day":23,"line":"📋 Carlos — 🎣 Fish. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2311,"day":23,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2312,"day":23,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2313,"day":23,"line":"📋 Adil — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2314,"day":23,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2315,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Carlos worked the creek — 1 fish, +210 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2316,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 3 fish, +500 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2317,"day":23,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 4 fish, +700 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2318,"day":23,"line":"🍲 Adil cooked for the haven — meals stretched. Adil worked the smoke racks too — 1 batch preserved (~160 kcal, keeps a couple of weeks)."},{"seq":2319,"day":23,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Ugly-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2320,"day":23,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2321,"day":23,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2322,"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +2000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2323,"day":23,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Oscar fixing something."},{"seq":2324,"day":23,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Bacaba. Dark berries like açaí, oilier. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":2325,"day":23,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":2326,"day":23,"line":"Aria brought you a sample. The Codex grows."},{"seq":2327,"day":23,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2328,"day":23,"line":"Caleb and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2329,"day":23,"line":"Aria and Adil lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2330,"day":23,"line":"🤒 Benoit is on the mend — the fever broke."},{"seq":2331,"day":23,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Carlos is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2332,"day":23,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2333,"day":23,"line":"📖 The entry for Carlos is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2334,"day":23,"line":"CARLOS — GONE. 2 open questions closed unanswered."},{"seq":2335,"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":2336,"day":24,"line":"— DAY 24 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2337,"day":24,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Bacaba — named and noted."},{"seq":2338,"day":24,"line":"💬 Caleb pulls you aside. \"I need to tell you something. Last night I... dreamed? No. I was AWAKE. And something spoke to me. Not the System — something else. It said: 'Tell the human to watch the northern treeline.' Then it was gone.\""},{"seq":2339,"day":24,"line":"(Caleb has been contacted by something. They don't understand what happened. But they'll warn you when they dream again.)"},{"seq":2340,"day":24,"line":"◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Emberhold bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."},{"seq":2341,"day":24,"line":"📊 THE STANDINGS — Haven sits 1st of 5. Haven leads. The audience has a favorite, and it's you."},{"seq":2342,"day":24,"line":"You notice the village gives you room on the path now. Not fear, exactly. Room."},{"seq":2343,"day":24,"line":"Taken: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2344,"day":24,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2345,"day":24,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Kitchen knife x1, Rain poncho x1, Wool socks x1, Energy drink x1, Gill net x1, Fishing Line x1."},{"seq":2346,"day":24,"line":"Minh leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Hummice. Bellow at the choir. The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs.\""},{"seq":2347,"day":24,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Hummice: Bellow at the choir. The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":2348,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Bellow at the choir — The Swarm Hum stacks while you stand in it — but the hum needs the choir. SHOUT and the bellow scatters it. Raw noise, no words, all lungs."},{"seq":2349,"day":24,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Lucky Rock (L1). Your lucky rock. The System finds your faith adorable and helps a little: +5% on the hunt. (It’s not the rock. It’s you believing in the rock.)"},{"seq":2350,"day":24,"line":"\"The rock! It is lucky! We checked! It's... a rock! But YOU believe! Belief is power! (We added 4%.)\""},{"seq":2351,"day":24,"line":"\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\""},{"seq":2352,"day":24,"line":"It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."},{"seq":2353,"day":24,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2354,"day":24,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2355,"day":24,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2356,"day":24,"line":"🌱 Aria looks over the garden: turned soil, nothing planted. Someone has to sow first."},{"seq":2357,"day":24,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2358,"day":24,"line":"💬 Caleb says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\""},{"seq":2359,"day":24,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2360,"day":24,"line":"🩹 Caleb is still hurting (22 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2361,"day":24,"line":"Adil is stirring the pot slow, fishing out a bone to check the meat."},{"seq":2362,"day":24,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2363,"day":24,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":2364,"day":24,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2365,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2366,"day":24,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2367,"day":24,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2368,"day":24,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Aria about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2369,"day":24,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":2370,"day":24,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Oscar is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":2371,"day":24,"line":"Minh is feeding the fire one stick at a time, watching the flame take."},{"seq":2372,"day":24,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2373,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2374,"day":24,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 24L left."},{"seq":2375,"day":24,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2376,"day":24,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":2377,"day":24,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":2378,"day":24,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2379,"day":24,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2380,"day":24,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":2381,"day":24,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2382,"day":24,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2383,"day":24,"line":"Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods."},{"seq":2384,"day":24,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2385,"day":24,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Ugly-Eyes. It's here."},{"seq":2386,"day":24,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2387,"day":24,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2388,"day":24,"line":"The Ugly-Eyes stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2389,"day":24,"line":"You keep a day's food (1200 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2390,"day":24,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 22 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2391,"day":24,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2392,"day":24,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":2393,"day":24,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2394,"day":24,"line":"You coax 2 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2395,"day":24,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2396,"day":24,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2397,"day":24,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2398,"day":24,"line":"📋 Adil — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2399,"day":24,"line":"Caleb hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":2400,"day":24,"line":"Aria hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":2401,"day":24,"line":"📋 Benoit — 🍲 Cook. (a natural — good pick) They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2402,"day":24,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2403,"day":24,"line":"Taken: Kitchen knife x1, Rain poncho x1, Wool socks x1, Fishing Line x1."},{"seq":2404,"day":24,"line":"You take kitchen knife, rain poncho, wool socks, fishing line from Carlos. Your hands know what they did. (+11 trauma)"},{"seq":2405,"day":24,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Energy drink x1, Gill net x1."},{"seq":2406,"day":24,"line":"Minh leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Heckler. WAIT to answer back. SHAME is the damage, not the swing — WAIT to answer back and clear it before the HEADLINER pile-on. The words demand a response. Give them one, on your terms.\""},{"seq":2407,"day":24,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Heckler: WAIT to answer back. SHAME is the damage, not the swing — WAIT to answer back and clear it before the HEADLINER pile-on. The words demand a response. Give them one, on your terms. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":2408,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: WAIT to answer back — SHAME is the damage, not the swing — WAIT to answer back and clear it before the HEADLINER pile-on. The words demand a response. Give them one, on your terms."},{"seq":2409,"day":24,"line":"You eat Pawpaw (560 kcal)."},{"seq":2410,"day":24,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":2411,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 2 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2412,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2413,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Adil worked the creek — 3 fish, +315 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2414,"day":24,"line":"🍲 Benoit cooked for the haven — meals stretched. Benoit worked the smoke racks too — 1 batch preserved (~480 kcal, keeps a couple of weeks)."},{"seq":2415,"day":24,"line":"The village debates Zoltan Nagy. The room is cold — Oscar, Minh, Adil against. \"More mouths, same fire.\" (14% for.)"},{"seq":2416,"day":24,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":2417,"day":24,"line":"They come fast and scared — a family, or what's left of one. \"Please. We heard you take people in.\" Behind them, something worse than weather."},{"seq":2418,"day":24,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2419,"day":24,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2420,"day":24,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":2421,"day":24,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":2422,"day":24,"line":"📺 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"We have designed a trial JUST for you. Based on our observations. Which are extensive. And flattering.\""},{"seq":2423,"day":24,"line":"It lists your recent deeds back at you — the good ones, mostly, with the embarrassing ones edited into heroics. It has been WATCHING. (Flattering.)"},{"seq":2424,"day":24,"line":"  1. Trial of the Long Stalk — Take game with patience, not noise."},{"seq":2425,"day":24,"line":"  2. Trial of Stone — Endure. That is the whole trial. Endure."},{"seq":2426,"day":24,"line":"  3. Trial of Tongues — Talk the village through something hard."},{"seq":2427,"day":24,"line":"Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets."},{"seq":2428,"day":24,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2429,"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +2215 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2430,"day":24,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Patauá. Tall palm, greasy-feeling fruit. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":2431,"day":24,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":2432,"day":24,"line":"Minh brought you a sample. The Codex grows."},{"seq":2433,"day":24,"line":"Caleb: \"The white oak acorns patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\""},{"seq":2434,"day":25,"line":"— DAY 25 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2435,"day":25,"line":"Overnight, Pawpaw went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":2436,"day":25,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":2437,"day":25,"line":"📺 \"CLEARED THE BOARD! Every last one of them — ON CAMERA! The audience is still chanting your name, you beautiful violent overachievers!\""},{"seq":2438,"day":25,"line":"📺 \"But real talk? The next act needs a BIGGER STAGE. I can't stage it with ONE fire — there's not enough of you to REFLECT, you feel me? Get me STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread. Rack up the kills, season your alliances, or feast like legends. Make it worth escalating.\""},{"seq":2439,"day":25,"line":"📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""},{"seq":2440,"day":25,"line":"(Something new is moving in the treeline. It was never an animal.)"},{"seq":2441,"day":25,"line":"🔥 Caleb, at the fire: \"The treeline's different now. We mark it, we tell everyone, we don't go alone.\""},{"seq":2442,"day":25,"line":"🔥 Minh, at the fire: \"Great. The woods got an upgrade. Love that for us.\""},{"seq":2443,"day":25,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Patauá — named and noted."},{"seq":2444,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2445,"day":25,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2446,"day":25,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2447,"day":25,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. Oscar nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2448,"day":25,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2449,"day":25,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2450,"day":25,"line":"Aria showed Adil the Bacaba — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":2451,"day":25,"line":"Oscar showed Caleb the Bacaba — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":2452,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2453,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2454,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Caleb is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2455,"day":25,"line":"👥 Benoit heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":2456,"day":25,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2457,"day":25,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2458,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2459,"day":25,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Adil about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2460,"day":25,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2461,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2462,"day":25,"line":"💛 You hold Mixtape. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2463,"day":25,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2464,"day":25,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Ugly-Eyes is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2465,"day":25,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2466,"day":25,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2467,"day":25,"line":"It followed you. The Big Loud is here."},{"seq":2468,"day":25,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":2469,"day":25,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 29× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2470,"day":25,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2471,"day":25,"line":"The Big Loud stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2472,"day":25,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":2473,"day":25,"line":"⚔️ Benoit killed the Ugly-Eyes with their party — 3 rounds, 34 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":2474,"day":25,"line":"You keep a day's food (400 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2475,"day":25,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2476,"day":25,"line":"You lay out the haul. Oscar leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2477,"day":25,"line":"📖 Oscar starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":2478,"day":25,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 23 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2479,"day":25,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":2480,"day":25,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2481,"day":25,"line":"You coax 3 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2482,"day":25,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2483,"day":25,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. Oscar nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2484,"day":25,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2485,"day":25,"line":"📋 Adil — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2486,"day":25,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2487,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 5 fish, +1140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2488,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 4 fish, +750 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2489,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Adil worked the creek — 3 fish, +350 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2490,"day":25,"line":"🌿 Benoit returns from foraging the wilds: +241 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2491,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2492,"day":25,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2493,"day":25,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":2494,"day":25,"line":"A frightened family cries — relief, mostly. Haven grows by one."},{"seq":2495,"day":25,"line":"👋 The village didn't wait for you — a frightened family was taken in around the fire. Another pair of hands."},{"seq":2496,"day":25,"line":"A stranger at the tree line, watching. Not hiding, exactly. Measuring. They'll be gone by dusk — but they'll remember what they saw."},{"seq":2497,"day":25,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"You took too long choosing. We chose. You're welcome. It was the most flattering one.\""},{"seq":2498,"day":25,"line":"📺 TRIAL ACCEPTED: Trial of the Long Stalk. \"Excellent choice. We simulated all three. This one had the best lighting.\""},{"seq":2499,"day":25,"line":"(A day-part, gone to the trial. −250 kcal. Your hands are shaking. The fans loved it.)"},{"seq":2500,"day":25,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"FIELD EQUIPMENT ISSUED.\" A pamphlet flutters down from nowhere. Cheerful pictograms. One page chewed by something. \"REVISION 5. The spring-pole method has been DEEMED SPORTING. The pole does the work. You do the waiting. Waiting is the hard part. We believe in you.\" (It's in your pack — read it.)"},{"seq":2501,"day":25,"line":"🏹 TRIUMPH: you read the ground like a letter — bent grass, a print, the wind in your face. The kill is clean, quick, and kind. The System replays it eleven times."},{"seq":2502,"day":25,"line":"(The village feasts tonight: +600 kcal to the pantry. The watchers will remember the stalk.)"},{"seq":2503,"day":25,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":2504,"day":25,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2505,"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +2131 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2506,"day":25,"line":"Minh set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":2507,"day":25,"line":"Adil traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2508,"day":25,"line":"Caleb and Adil lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2509,"day":25,"line":"Caleb went to sleep hungry. Nobody says anything."},{"seq":2510,"day":25,"line":"🌿 Blackberry — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":2511,"day":25,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: Blackberry — Level 2. You knew it was safe. the village knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Parts: berries (eat), leaves (tea), roots (medicinal). Pick ripe (black, not red)."},{"seq":2512,"day":25,"line":"🤒 Adil is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2513,"day":25,"line":"🤒 Caleb is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2514,"day":25,"line":"🛟 Jonas stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":2515,"day":25,"line":"\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""},{"seq":2516,"day":25,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Jonas adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":2517,"day":25,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":2518,"day":26,"line":"🔥 Caleb, at the fire: \"Whatever's out there... I don't think one fire faces it. Not alone.\""},{"seq":2519,"day":26,"line":"— DAY 26 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2520,"day":26,"line":"💬 Adil whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":2521,"day":26,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2522,"day":26,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2523,"day":26,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2524,"day":26,"line":"📋 Oscar — 💧 Fetch water. Oscar nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2525,"day":26,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2526,"day":26,"line":"💧 Oscar returns with 14L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2527,"day":26,"line":"Benoit showed Oscar the Patauá — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":2528,"day":26,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2529,"day":26,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (26 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2530,"day":26,"line":"🩹 Benoit is still hurting (47 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2531,"day":26,"line":"Jonas heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":2532,"day":26,"line":"💬 Adil has been asking Caleb about Berserker Rage — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":2533,"day":26,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2534,"day":26,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2535,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2536,"day":26,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2537,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2538,"day":26,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2539,"day":26,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":2540,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2541,"day":26,"line":"💛 You hold Mixtape. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2542,"day":26,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2543,"day":26,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Minh telling Caleb about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2544,"day":26,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Oscar telling Jonas about Benoit. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2545,"day":26,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2546,"day":26,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2547,"day":26,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2548,"day":26,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2549,"day":26,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":2550,"day":26,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× Hickory Nuts, 13× Blackberry (845 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2551,"day":26,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2552,"day":26,"line":"The Choir Toad stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":2553,"day":26,"line":"You keep a day's food (1205 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2554,"day":26,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2555,"day":26,"line":"You lay out the haul. Oscar leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2556,"day":26,"line":"📖 Oscar starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":2557,"day":26,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 23 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2558,"day":26,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":2559,"day":26,"line":"You sow Sassafras: 90 days to first harvest. Harvest removes the crop; sow new seed afterward. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":2560,"day":26,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2561,"day":26,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2562,"day":26,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. Oscar nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2563,"day":26,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2564,"day":26,"line":"📋 Adil — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2565,"day":26,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2566,"day":26,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Energy drink x1, Gill net x1."},{"seq":2567,"day":26,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2568,"day":26,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Blackberry. Uses: vitamin C, antioxidants. Leaves for diarrhea. High energy. (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: ripe black berries, straight off the cane; medicine: leaf tea settles the stomach; dye: deep purple-black dye from the juice."},{"seq":2569,"day":26,"line":"You eat Blackberry (585 kcal)."},{"seq":2570,"day":26,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":2571,"day":26,"line":"📺 The audience has a favorite, and it's you. The chant doesn't have words. It doesn't need them."},{"seq":2572,"day":26,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+6 integration)"},{"seq":2573,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 1 fish, +240 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2574,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 2 fish, +400 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2575,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Adil worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2576,"day":26,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 21 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":2577,"day":26,"line":"A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":2578,"day":26,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":2579,"day":26,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2580,"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1380 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2581,"day":26,"line":"Aria came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":2582,"day":26,"line":"Aria traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2583,"day":26,"line":"Caleb: \"Walked past a good stand of bissap hibiscus. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":2584,"day":26,"line":"Oscar went to sleep hungry. Nobody says anything."},{"seq":2585,"day":26,"line":"Adil and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2586,"day":26,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Adil is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2587,"day":26,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2588,"day":26,"line":"📖 The entry for Adil is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2589,"day":26,"line":"💀 Adil starved. Slowly. The talk dies fast around the fire. Nobody has the words yet."},{"seq":2590,"day":26,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Caleb is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2591,"day":26,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2592,"day":26,"line":"📖 The entry for Caleb is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2593,"day":26,"line":"Caleb is gone — dead. The errand dies with them; nobody's waiting on those dandelions now."},{"seq":2594,"day":26,"line":"💀 Caleb starved. Slowly. Somebody's sleeping-roll stays rolled out. Nobody puts it away."},{"seq":2595,"day":26,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 1 of hunger."},{"seq":2596,"day":26,"line":"🤒 Aria is on the mend — the fever broke."},{"seq":2597,"day":27,"line":"— DAY 27 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2598,"day":27,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Blackberry — understood at last."},{"seq":2599,"day":27,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":2600,"day":27,"line":"\"I left bandages where the path bends. Don't thank me. Just live.\""},{"seq":2601,"day":27,"line":"(314 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":2602,"day":27,"line":"👁 \"Don't — don't react. I'm Wren. I'm not supposed to talk to you. Just... there's a cache by the old hollow. No one saw me. Go.\""},{"seq":2603,"day":27,"line":"◈ You understand now: that wasn't human. That was Wren — Student, Vexari Exchange Program — wearing a person like a suit. (you spotted her leaving a cache)"},{"seq":2604,"day":27,"line":"💬 Jonas pulls you aside. \"I need to tell you something. Last night I... dreamed? No. I was AWAKE. And something spoke to me. Not the System — something else. It said: 'Tell the human to watch the northern treeline.' Then it was gone.\""},{"seq":2605,"day":27,"line":"(Jonas has been contacted by an alien player. They don't understand what happened. But they'll warn you when they dream again.)"},{"seq":2606,"day":27,"line":"🛟 Jonas looks up from the fire. \"And now hunger, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":2607,"day":27,"line":"The fire is quieter on hungry mornings. Nobody has spare breath for talking."},{"seq":2608,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2609,"day":27,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2610,"day":27,"line":"You eat Blackberry and Sassafras (580 kcal)."},{"seq":2611,"day":27,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2612,"day":27,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2613,"day":27,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2614,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Oscar is still hurting (2 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2615,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2616,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Aria is still hurting (65 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2617,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Benoit is still hurting (43 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2618,"day":27,"line":"🌿 Jonas returns from foraging the wilds: +358 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2619,"day":27,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2620,"day":27,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2621,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2622,"day":27,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Aria telling Benoit about Jonas. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2623,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (14 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2624,"day":27,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2625,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2626,"day":27,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2627,"day":27,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 16× Hickory Nuts, 13× Pawpaw (1040 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2628,"day":27,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2629,"day":27,"line":"You keep a day's food (1040 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2630,"day":27,"line":"1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2631,"day":27,"line":"You lay out the haul. Oscar leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2632,"day":27,"line":"📖 Oscar starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":2633,"day":27,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 23 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2634,"day":27,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Aria telling Jonas about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":2635,"day":27,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2636,"day":27,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2637,"day":27,"line":"📋 Oscar — 🎣 Fish. Oscar nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2638,"day":27,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2639,"day":27,"line":"📋 Aria — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2640,"day":27,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2641,"day":27,"line":"Taken: Energy drink x1, Gill net x1."},{"seq":2642,"day":27,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":2643,"day":27,"line":"Recipe: Sling (Level 1). You have seen a sling. Two cords, a pouch, a stone — and range that embarrasses bows."},{"seq":2644,"day":27,"line":"Taken: Rain Shell x1, Sling x1, Stone knife x1, Pitch torch x1."},{"seq":2645,"day":27,"line":"You take rain shell, sling, stone knife, pitch torch from Adil. Your hands know what they did. (+11 trauma)"},{"seq":2646,"day":27,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":2647,"day":27,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Good Boots x1, Work Gloves x1, Medfoam canister x1, Hardlight knife x1, Pitch torch x1, Hand drill x1, Tracker's Blind x1."},{"seq":2648,"day":27,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2649,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Oscar worked the creek — 5 fish, +1020 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2650,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 4 fish, +700 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2651,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Aria worked the creek — 2 fish, +245 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2652,"day":27,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2653,"day":27,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2654,"day":27,"line":"🌩️ The sky to the west has gone the color of a bruise. Jonas is already tying things down — rope, tarps, the chicken situation. \"Sky like that,\" Jonas says, \"you don't argue with it.\""},{"seq":2655,"day":27,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"We have filed a request for the sky to be less bruised. It is pending. The sky has not responded.\""},{"seq":2656,"day":27,"line":"A storm is coming, and it does not care about your plans. Be at Haven by dusk — sheltering costs the dusk foraging window (400–800 kcal you'll never see). Getting caught out costs more."},{"seq":2657,"day":27,"line":"Rain. Steady, cold, honest rain."},{"seq":2658,"day":27,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2659,"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1965 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2660,"day":27,"line":"Jonas traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2661,"day":27,"line":"Oscar: \"Walked past a good stand of muscadine grapes. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":2662,"day":27,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Oscar is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2663,"day":27,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2664,"day":27,"line":"📖 The entry for Oscar is finished. 1 deed recorded. No more pages."},{"seq":2665,"day":27,"line":"OSCAR — GONE. 3 open questions closed unanswered."},{"seq":2666,"day":27,"line":"💀 Oscar starved. Slowly. Somebody's sleeping-roll stays rolled out. Nobody puts it away."},{"seq":2667,"day":27,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2668,"day":27,"line":"Minh and Oscar lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2669,"day":27,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 2 of hunger."},{"seq":2670,"day":27,"line":"🤒 Benoit is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2671,"day":28,"line":"— DAY 28 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2672,"day":28,"line":"The fire is quieter on hungry mornings. Nobody has spare breath for talking."},{"seq":2673,"day":28,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 50 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2674,"day":28,"line":"You eat Pawpaw (400 kcal)."},{"seq":2675,"day":28,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2676,"day":28,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2677,"day":28,"line":"📋 Minh — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2678,"day":28,"line":"🌱 Aria works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2679,"day":28,"line":"💧 Minh returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2680,"day":28,"line":"💬 Benoit whispers: \"Someone's been leaving food out, and Wren won't admit a thing. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\""},{"seq":2681,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (2 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2682,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Aria is still hurting (61 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2683,"day":28,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2684,"day":28,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2685,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2686,"day":28,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2687,"day":28,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2688,"day":28,"line":"🌧️ The storm rolls over Haven like a held breath let go — rain hammering the tarps, the wind testing every knot Jonas tied. Inside, it's almost cozy. Almost."},{"seq":2689,"day":28,"line":"You set out every pot and skin — the storm fills them. (+1 clean water — your pack couldn't hold it all. The storm provides, the old-timers say, whether you ask or not.)"},{"seq":2690,"day":28,"line":"The dusk forage goes un-walked: 400–800 kcal you'll never see, out there getting rained on instead of gathered. Jonas nods at the bruised sky, satisfied: \"Worth it.\""},{"seq":2691,"day":28,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2692,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2693,"day":28,"line":"👥 Jonas heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":2694,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Minh is still hurting (2 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2695,"day":28,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2696,"day":28,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":2697,"day":28,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":2698,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2699,"day":28,"line":"💛 You hold Mixtape. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"},{"seq":2700,"day":28,"line":"Travel 1 tile to wetland."},{"seq":2701,"day":28,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Loud-Eyes is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2702,"day":28,"line":"Something moves out there — The Paparazzo."},{"seq":2703,"day":28,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2704,"day":28,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to forest floor."},{"seq":2705,"day":28,"line":"It followed you. The Paparazzo is here."},{"seq":2706,"day":28,"line":"Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods."},{"seq":2707,"day":28,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to grove."},{"seq":2708,"day":28,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2709,"day":28,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2710,"day":28,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":2711,"day":28,"line":"⚔️ Jonas killed the Loud-Eyes with their party — 2 rounds, 8 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":2712,"day":28,"line":"You keep a day's food (640 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2713,"day":28,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 23 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2714,"day":28,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 16 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2715,"day":28,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2716,"day":28,"line":"📋 Minh — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2717,"day":28,"line":"📋 Aria — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2718,"day":28,"line":"📋 Benoit — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2719,"day":28,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Stripped hide x1."},{"seq":2720,"day":28,"line":"Taken: Work Gloves x1, Medfoam canister x1, Hand drill x1."},{"seq":2721,"day":28,"line":"You take work gloves, medfoam canister, hand drill from Caleb. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)"},{"seq":2722,"day":28,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Good Boots x1, Hardlight knife x1, Pitch torch x1, Tracker's Blind x1."},{"seq":2723,"day":28,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Work Gloves x1, Kitchen knife x1, Multitool x1."},{"seq":2724,"day":28,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Pocket Sand (L1). Throw sand in eyes. Blinds for 2 rounds. (You always have sand. Don't ask where.)"},{"seq":2725,"day":28,"line":"\"SAND! In the eyes! It's in YOUR pocket! How?! We don't know! But it's there!\""},{"seq":2726,"day":28,"line":"\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\""},{"seq":2727,"day":28,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2728,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Minh worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2729,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Aria worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2730,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Benoit worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2731,"day":28,"line":"The village debates Hannah Kim. Warm, mostly. \"One more pair of hands.\" (77% for.)"},{"seq":2732,"day":28,"line":"📨 The village didn't wait for you. Hannah Kim was vouched for around the fire — they're walking."},{"seq":2733,"day":28,"line":"Accepted. Hannah Kim is walking. They'll reach Haven in a few days — membership starts when they arrive, but the village already counts them."},{"seq":2734,"day":28,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2735,"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1180 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry."},{"seq":2736,"day":28,"line":"Someone is crying, quietly, in one of the bunks. Jonas goes to sit with them."},{"seq":2737,"day":28,"line":"Minh traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2738,"day":28,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Minh is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2739,"day":28,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2740,"day":28,"line":"📖 The entry for Minh is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2741,"day":28,"line":"💀 Minh starved. Slowly. Somebody keeps looking at the door, like they're still going to walk in."},{"seq":2742,"day":28,"line":"Aria and Minh lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2743,"day":28,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 3 of hunger."},{"seq":2744,"day":28,"line":"Haven couldn't hold. On the third hungry day, people started walking — in different directions. The scattering, again."},{"seq":2745,"day":28,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":2746,"day":28,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."}]}
{"seed":83189,"arm":"armed","policy":"competent","days":30,"daysAlive":28,"endReason":"village-lost","gameDays":28,"maxWaveUnlocked":2,"waveKills":{"1":10,"2":3},"deaths":[{"day":4,"kind":"monster","who":"anaconda_empress","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":5,"kind":"monster","who":"lockpick_raccoon","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"cliffhanger","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"rut_king","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"nightcourt","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"sweeps_week","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"drumbelly_tanuki","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"monster","who":"cliffhanger","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":11,"kind":"villager","who":"david_kim","cause":"sickness","player":false},{"day":13,"kind":"monster","who":"nightlight_catfish","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":15,"kind":"monster","who":"drumbelly_tanuki","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":15,"kind":"monster","who":"moderator","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":15,"kind":"monster","who":"moderator","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":18,"kind":"monster","who":"review_drone","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":19,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_a5xfkqa","cause":"sickness","player":false},{"day":20,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_oc2wu4j","cause":"sickness","player":false},{"day":21,"kind":"person","who":"benoit_lambert","cause":"ambush","player":false},{"day":21,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_oazmal7","cause":"sickness","player":false},{"day":23,"kind":"villager","who":"zoe_adams","cause":"starvation","player":false},{"day":26,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_59h783e","cause":"starvation","player":false},{"day":28,"kind":"villager","who":"nikolai_volkov","cause":"sickness","player":false}],"rows":[{"loopDay":1,"gameDay":2,"pantryKcal":38060,"morningPantryKcal":47250,"freshKcal":38060,"freshDays":4.313722768300522,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","💧 A man, maybe 60s, with freckles returns with water: +2 clean.","💧 A person, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic returns with water: +2 clean.","💧 A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head returns with water: +4 clean.","🍲 A woman, maybe 20s eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb.","🍲 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters.","\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 20s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 20s.)","Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell.","🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces.","★ IDENTIFIED: Pawpaw. Large drooping leaves, custard-like fruit in fall. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","A man, maybe 30s brought you a sample. The Journal grows.","Ole and Paolo lingered over the fire together.","You remember the Crossbow at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","You remember the Mender's Apron at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now.","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Pawpaw — named and noted.","🔥 Jesse says it at the fire, not quite looking at Stanley: “Your story about what you’re after doesn’t add up. Someone had to say it.” The fire goes quiet in the way it does when someone’s decided to be brave.","Stanley is quiet for a long moment. Then, all in a rush: “Fine. It’s true. Not belong — lead. I lied because the truth felt small.” The admission hangs there, and the village — to its credit — doesn’t pounce.","People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one.","A person, maybe 60s will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)","A man, maybe 60s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)","📋 A person, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)","Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game.","\"Jesse,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Jesse.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Jesse).","\"Paolo,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Paolo.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Paolo).","\"Eamon,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Eamon.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Eamon).","You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":2,"gameDay":2,"pantryKcal":37310,"morningPantryKcal":37310,"freshKcal":37310,"freshDays":4.228717721631437,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way.","You step into the Haven hall.","📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","...and then it lands: A man, maybe 50s, with a long braid speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience.","\"Ole,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Ole.\" You'll remember that.","📓 Journal: learned their name (Ole)."]},{"loopDay":3,"gameDay":4,"pantryKcal":29400,"morningPantryKcal":31230,"freshKcal":29400,"freshDays":5.265745334628988,"plenty":true,"hungryStreak":0,"hungerExempt":false,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":true,"gateEngaged":true,"alive":12,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.\n— Nut trees —\nMast crunches underfoot — last season's nuts, sprouting or rotting. The trees don't waste anything.","Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet.","You see smoke on the horizon. Emberhold — 12 people, 3 days in. fishing folk, by the look of it. They know 4 plants — 4 new to you. They've been here the whole time.","Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)","Journal: Riparian ground. Water means life, and lunch.","📓 Journal: you UNDERSTAND Green Thumb, Literally. It resonates with: something unnamed, something unnamed.","A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 7× unknown berries. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","Someone by the fire nods at the counter. \"We pool food here. Keep what you need for the road — the rest feeds everyone, once it's food.\"","Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you.","You walk back into Haven. 4 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","A person, maybe 60s picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)","You break ground behind the hall — bed 3 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You break ground behind the hall — bed 4 of 4, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop.","You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Ole about Eamon. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","A man, maybe 30s showed Eamon the Pawpaw — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper.","💧 A man, maybe 30s returns with water: +4 clean.","💧 A man, maybe 40s, with a limp returns with water: +2 clean.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +1280 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A woman, maybe 20s has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Eamon is showing everyone translucent watery stems, orange-yellow trumpet flowers with spots, grows in wet shade by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The journal grows — the human way.","Jesse spends the afternoon with the thorny bush with dark berries — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe.","From the lumped bag: Blackberry — named, and out.","★ IDENTIFIED: Blackberry. Thorny canes, dark berries. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","💡 You see it again in your mind: a thorny bush with dark berries. Jesse's words land on the memory like a label. Blackberry. Of course.","Paolo was watching. Now they know Blackberry too.","🔍 A 