5% on the hunt. (It’s not the rock. It’s you believing in the rock.)","\"The rock! It is lucky! We checked! It's... a rock! But YOU believe! Belief is power! (We added 4%.)\"","\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\""]},{"loopDay":25,"gameDay":25,"pantryKcal":1700,"morningPantryKcal":1700,"freshKcal":1700,"freshDays":0.6704464871542992,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":11,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":7,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to trail edge.","Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (715 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Ole — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Somchai — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part.","💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −2 trauma)","Taken: Rain Shell x1, Dice set x1.","You take rain shell, dice set from Zoe. Your hands know what they did. (+6 trauma)","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1."]},{"loopDay":26,"gameDay":26,"pantryKcal":0,"morningPantryKcal":0,"freshKcal":0,"freshDays":0,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":12,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":8,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to trail edge.","A sturdy stick (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 16× Hickory Nuts, 16× White Oak Acorns, 12× Spicebush (360 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (360 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\"","📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\"","You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\"","📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\"","You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Ole — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1.","You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)","You eat Spicebush (360 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":27,"gameDay":27,"pantryKcal":688,"morningPantryKcal":558,"freshKcal":688,"freshDays":0.3151781124530798,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":13,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":7,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.","You also take some vine (crafting material).","You also take some vine (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 32× Blackberry (2080 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (1950 kcal) and unload 130 kcal into Haven's pantry.","You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Somchai — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","...and then it lands: Quoc speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Rain Shell x1, Crude bow x1, Seedkeeper's Grimoire x1.","You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)","You eat Blackberry (910 kcal)."]},{"loopDay":28,"gameDay":28,"pantryKcal":0,"morningPantryKcal":0,"freshKcal":0,"freshDays":0,"plenty":false,"hungryStreak":14,"hungerExempt":true,"gateOn":true,"prodThrottleEngaged":false,"gateEngaged":false,"alive":7,"sayLines":["Travel 1 tile to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to trail edge.","Something moves out there — Ugly-Eyes.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","You keep a day's food (65 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","📋 Somchai — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part.","Taken: Canvas Pants x1.","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Binoculars x1.","💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −2 trauma)","Taken: Rain Shell x1.","You take rain shell from Ole. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)","Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crude bow x1, Seedkeeper's Grimoire x1."]}],"sayLines":[{"seq":0,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Ritual & Meaning (Level 1). Marking the dead matters. Even without religion, ritual holds grief."},{"seq":1,"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Steady Hands (Level 1). Fine work under pressure. Dressing game, stitching wounds, tying snares — no shake."},{"seq":2,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your old life taught you things. 2 skills from your past — check your Journal."},{"seq":3,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: knap a Stone knife (stone + vine) — the oldest tool there is. Find the stone."},{"seq":4,"day":1,"line":"📖 Your hands remember: weave cloth (3 plant fiber — strip it from cleared brush), and build a Water Filter (cloth + charcoal from fire ashes). Dirty water doesn't have to stay dirty."},{"seq":5,"day":1,"line":"You wake up with dirt in your mouth and blood on your hands that isn't yours. The sky is the wrong color — not sunset-wrong, wound-wrong. Teresa Wojcik. Tattoo artist. From Columbus, Ohio. That was yesterday. This is now. You have: Dispatcher's headset, Unnamed photograph, Carpenter's square, Hoodie, Hard Candy. That's everything you own in this world. Haven. Twelve people. The fire is lit. You he"},{"seq":6,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic: \"We've got days of stores, not weeks. The treeline is the pantry now. Learn what's out there.\""},{"seq":7,"day":1,"line":"📓 Journal: Food won't come to Haven. Walk past the treeline — learn what grows out there, bring it back, and get it named at camp."},{"seq":8,"day":1,"line":"You tell the others you're heading out. Someone nods. \"Come back before dark.\""},{"seq":9,"day":1,"line":"— DAY 1 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":10,"day":1,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 24L left."},{"seq":11,"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":12,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with freckles heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":13,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":14,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":15,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":16,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s is working the cookpot, tasting, adjusting."},{"seq":17,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 30s is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":18,"day":1,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":19,"day":1,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":20,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":21,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":22,"day":1,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":23,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":24,"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":25,"day":1,"line":"📋 A woman, maybe 20s wants to know what's by the creek. \"Just look. Come back and tell me.\""},{"seq":26,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":27,"day":1,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":28,"day":1,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":29,"day":1,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":30,"day":1,"line":"You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."},{"seq":31,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":32,"day":1,"line":"You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."},{"seq":33,"day":1,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s, with freckles returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":34,"day":1,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":35,"day":1,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":36,"day":1,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":37,"day":1,"line":"🍲 A woman, maybe 20s eats quiet by the fire, scraping the bowl clean with their thumb."},{"seq":38,"day":1,"line":"🍲 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":39,"day":1,"line":"\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 20s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 20s.)"},{"seq":40,"day":1,"line":"Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell."},{"seq":41,"day":1,"line":"🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."},{"seq":42,"day":1,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":43,"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":44,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":45,"day":1,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Pawpaw. Large drooping leaves, custard-like fruit in fall. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":46,"day":1,"line":"A man, maybe 30s brought you a sample. The Journal grows."},{"seq":47,"day":1,"line":"Ole and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":48,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Crossbow at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":49,"day":1,"line":"You remember the Mender's Apron at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."},{"seq":50,"day":2,"line":"— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":51,"day":2,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Pawpaw — named and noted."},{"seq":52,"day":2,"line":"🔥 Jesse says it at the fire, not quite looking at Stanley: “Your story about what you’re after doesn’t add up. Someone had to say it.” The fire goes quiet in the way it does when someone’s decided to be brave."},{"seq":53,"day":2,"line":"Stanley is quiet for a long moment. Then, all in a rush: “Fine. It’s true. Not belong — lead. I lied because the truth felt small.” The admission hangs there, and the village — to its credit — doesn’t pounce."},{"seq":54,"day":2,"line":"People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one."},{"seq":55,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":56,"day":2,"line":"You step into the Haven hall."},{"seq":57,"day":2,"line":"📋 A man, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":58,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":59,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":60,"day":2,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":61,"day":2,"line":"(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"},{"seq":62,"day":2,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":63,"day":2,"line":"\"Jesse,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Jesse.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":64,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Jesse)."},{"seq":65,"day":2,"line":"\"Paolo,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Paolo.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":66,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Paolo)."},{"seq":67,"day":2,"line":"\"Eamon,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Eamon.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":68,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Eamon)."},{"seq":69,"day":2,"line":"You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."},{"seq":70,"day":2,"line":"It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."},{"seq":71,"day":2,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":72,"day":2,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":73,"day":2,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":74,"day":2,"line":"Equipped Mender's Apron (torso)."},{"seq":75,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose.)"},{"seq":76,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A woman, maybe 20s: \"Hmm. That doesn't add up. Let me think it through out loud.\""},{"seq":77,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A man, maybe 50s, with a long braid: \"Thanks for saying it. I'll check on people. Quietly.\""},{"seq":78,"day":2,"line":"(Something in their exchange sticks with you. read people +1)"},{"seq":79,"day":2,"line":"🌿 A person, maybe 60s checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":80,"day":2,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (15 logs now.)"},{"seq":81,"day":2,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":82,"day":2,"line":"🪨 Paolo pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":83,"day":2,"line":"Paolo heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":84,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a long braid heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":85,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 30s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":86,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with a limp heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":87,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":88,"day":2,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":89,"day":2,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":90,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":91,"day":2,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":92,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms: \"Breathe. We've handled worse mornings than this.\""},{"seq":93,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Eamon: \"Interesting. But what's the underlying pattern?\""},{"seq":94,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head.)"},{"seq":95,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Jesse: \"That snare line needs checking. Talk later, work now.\""},{"seq":96,"day":2,"line":"👂 Overheard — Eamon: \"Interesting. But what's the underlying pattern?\""},{"seq":97,"day":2,"line":"(Something in their exchange sticks with you. read people +1)"},{"seq":98,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":99,"day":2,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":100,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":101,"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":102,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head eats from the pantry."},{"seq":103,"day":2,"line":"\"Can we talk?\" Jesse sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\" (Talk to Jesse.)"},{"seq":104,"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 20s showed A person, maybe 60s the Pawpaw — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":105,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a long braid returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":106,"day":2,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":107,"day":2,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":108,"day":2,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":109,"day":2,"line":"You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."},{"seq":110,"day":2,"line":"You step into the Haven hall."},{"seq":111,"day":2,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":112,"day":2,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":113,"day":2,"line":"...and then it lands: A man, maybe 50s, with a long braid speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."},{"seq":114,"day":2,"line":"\"Ole,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Ole.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":115,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Ole)."},{"seq":116,"day":2,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":117,"day":2,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":118,"day":2,"line":"🪵 Jesse hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (19 logs now.)"},{"seq":119,"day":2,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":120,"day":2,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":121,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 40s, with a limp returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":122,"day":2,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":123,"day":2,"line":"🛖 Three days of raising beams, and the longhouse stands — a real roof, a real hearth, room to grow. Someone carves the date into the center post. The village feels bigger already."},{"seq":124,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: The Longhouse raised. Population cap now 16."},{"seq":125,"day":2,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":126,"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1140 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":127,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 30s and A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms are comparing scars like trading cards."},{"seq":128,"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s drew low shrubs, small dark-purple berries, mountain slopes and clearings in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":129,"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head came back with 406 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 203 kcal in, 203 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":130,"day":2,"line":"Jesse and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":131,"day":2,"line":"🍽️ Nikolai carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":132,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: Jesse taught Eamon Food Preservation."},{"seq":133,"day":2,"line":"📓 Journal: Ole taught the man in his 60s, with tattooed arms Silver Tongue."},{"seq":134,"day":3,"line":"— DAY 3 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":135,"day":3,"line":"👀 You caught Eamon rehearsing — muttering details about Denver under their breath before the evening fire, like someone cramming for a part."},{"seq":136,"day":3,