nst it."},{"seq":266,"day":4,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":267,"day":4,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":268,"day":4,"line":"Something moves out there — something displaced a LOT of water, and it wasn't a log."},{"seq":269,"day":4,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":270,"day":4,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge.\n— An old trail —\nThe trail splits around a boulder and rejoins — the world's oldest traffic decision. You follow the deeper-worn side."},{"seq":271,"day":4,"line":"It followed you. Something displaced a LOT of water is here."},{"seq":272,"day":4,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown nuts — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":273,"day":4,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown nuts — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":274,"day":4,"line":"Unfamiliar unknown berries — into the bag. (Unknowns lump together; sort them at camp.)"},{"seq":275,"day":4,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":276,"day":4,"line":"Journal: Trampled ground. The humble weeds win."},{"seq":277,"day":4,"line":"A shot in the dark — you take what's green: 4× unknown nuts, 5× unknown nuts, 3× unknown berries. Into the bag, unnamed. (Not food until identified — sort them at camp.) This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":278,"day":4,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":279,"day":4,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":280,"day":4,"line":"⚔️ Eamon killed the something displaced a LOT of water with their party — 7 rounds, 50 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":281,"day":4,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":282,"day":4,"line":"Nobody at the fire knows your haul any better than you do. It'll be your own hands that teach you."},{"seq":283,"day":4,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 5 Codex entries. The village is glad to see 