e":"Paolo showed A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose the Blackberry — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":297,"day":4,"line":"💧 Eamon returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":298,"day":4,"line":"💧 Ole returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":299,"day":4,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 30s returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":300,"day":4,"line":"🚶 Jesse is back — found A person, maybe 60s."},{"seq":301,"day":4,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 40s, with a limp returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":302,"day":4,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":303,"day":4,"line":"Jesse sits by the door re-lacing a strap, testing each pull before the next."},{"seq":304,"day":4,"line":"🗣️ A man, maybe 30s to a person, maybe 60s, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 59 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\""},{"seq":305,"day":4,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":306,"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1237 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":307,"day":4,"line":"Eamon and A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms are comparing scars like trading cards."},{"seq":308,"day":4,"line":"Jesse is showing everyone Blackberry by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The journal grows — the human way."},{"seq":309,"day":4,"line":"Jesse spends the afternoon with the shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of bright red berries on bare twigs — look, smell, the smallest taste, then waiting. An hour passes. Then another. Nothing. The fire nods. That's dinner, maybe."},{"seq":310,"day":4,"line":"From the lumped bag: Spicebush — named, and out."},{"seq":311,"day":4,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Spicebush. Small oval leaves, red berry clusters on bare twigs. Crushed leaves smell spicy. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":312,"day":4,"line":"💡 Spicebush. The shrub with small oval leaves and clusters of