:"You keep a day's food (650 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":446,"day":6,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 7 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":447,"day":6,"line":"Ole picks through the bag, frowning. Nothing they can name with confidence. (8 ticks)"},{"seq":448,"day":6,"line":"You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":449,"day":6,"line":"You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":450,"day":6,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":451,"day":6,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":452,"day":6,"line":"...and then it lands: A man, maybe 30s speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."},{"seq":453,"day":6,"line":"\"Somchai,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Somchai.\" You'll remember that."},{"seq":454,"day":6,"line":"📓 Journal: learned their name (Somchai)."},{"seq":455,"day":6,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":456,"day":6,"line":"You eat Blackberry (390 kcal)."},{"seq":457,"day":6,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":458,"day":6,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":459,"day":6,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (28 logs now.)"},{"seq":460,"day":6,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":461,"day":6,"line":"💧 A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":462,"day":6,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":463,"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1053 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half