ay":7,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Hickory Nuts — named and noted."},{"seq":480,"day":7,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":481,"day":7,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 100 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":482,"day":7,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":483,"day":7,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":484,"day":7,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":485,"day":7,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":486,"day":7,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":487,"day":7,"line":"🌱 A person, maybe 60s waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":488,"day":7,"line":"🌿 A person, maybe 60s checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":489,"day":7,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":490,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Eamon about A woman, maybe 20s. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":491,"day":7,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Gossip Network (Level 1). You hear things. People tell you things. You remember who told you what."},{"seq":492,"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":493,"day":7,"line":"Paolo heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":494,"day":7,"line":"Ole heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":495,"day":7,"line":"💧 A woman, maybe 20s returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":496,"day":7,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":497,"day":7,"line":"David is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft."},{"seq":498,"day":7,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":499,"day":7,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":500,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":501,"day":7,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":502,"day":7,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":503,"day":7,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":504,"day":7,"line":"💬 A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms is sitting with A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose, talking low. Not business. Just people."},{"seq":505,"day":7,"line":"📖 the woman in her 20s is walking Jesse through a low woodland plant with a whorl of compound leaves and a small cluster of red berries — rare, and protected — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour."},{"seq":506,"day":7,"line":"Jesse is at the cookpot, tasting off the spoon, frowning, adding a pinch of something."},{"seq":507,"day":7,"line":"David is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft."},{"seq":508,"day":7,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":509,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":510,"day":7,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 24L left."},{"seq":511,"day":7,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":512,"day":7,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":513,"day":7,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":514,"day":7,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: the person in their 60s is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":515,"day":7,"line":"💧 A person, maybe 60s returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":516,"day":7,"line":"💧 Ole returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":517,"day":7,"line":"🚶 Somchai is back — found A person, maybe 60s."},{"seq":518,"day":7,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":519,"day":7,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":520,"day":7,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":521,"day":7,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":522,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 60s telling David about A woman, maybe 20s. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":523,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A man, maybe 60s, with tattooed arms telling A man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose about A woman, maybe 20s. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":524,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Ole about himself. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":525,"day":7,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — A woman, maybe 20s telling Paolo about herself. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":526,"day":7,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":527,"day":7,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":528,"day":7,"line":"Something moves out there — two knobs on glass-still water, watching."},{"seq":529,"day":7,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":530,"day":7,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 4× Hickory Nuts, 3× White Oak Acorns, 5× Spicebush (150 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":531,"day":7,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":532,"day":7,"line":"You keep a day's food (150 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":533,"day":7,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":534,"day":7,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":535,"day":7,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":536,"day":7,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 8 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":537,"day":7,"line":"You sow Spicebush: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":538,"day":7,"line":"You sow Spicebush: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":539,"day":7,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":540,"day":7,"line":"📋 A person, maybe 60s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":541,"day":7,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":542,"day":7,"line":"You eat Spicebush (30 kcal)."},{"seq":543,"day":7,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":544,"day":7,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":545,"day":7,"line":"🪵 A person, maybe 60s hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (32 logs now.)"},{"seq":546,"day":7,"line":"Jesse showed A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head the White Oak Acorns — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":547,"day":7,"line":"A man, maybe 60s, with a shaved head showed Eamon the White Oak Acorns — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":548,"day":7,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":549,"day":7,"line":"🗣️ Eamon to a man, maybe 50s, with a crooked nose, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 59 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\""},{"seq":550,"day":7,"line":"🌟 THE SKY SPLITS OPEN."},{"seq":551,"day":7,"line":"Not with light. With... interface. Windows scrolling across the clouds, too fast to read."},{"seq":552,"day":7,"line":"A voice behind your eyes — bright, delighted, utterly wrong. (The System has arrived.)"},{"seq":553,"day":7,"line":"🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":554,"day":7,"line":"📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\""},{"seq":555,"day":7,"line":"📖 Your journal shimmers — handwriting dissolving into interface. It talks now. It remembers everything."},{"seq":556,"day":7,"line":"🕐 Your hand-drawn time-circle glitches — and something colder, more precise, takes its place. (We kept the smudges. They're charming.)"},{"seq":557,"day":7,"line":"🦎 \"Those were CALIBRATION fauna! First drafts! The audience has NOTES! So we made BETTER ones!\" (Something new is crying in the treeline.)"},{"seq":558,"day":7,"line":"🧑‍🤝‍🧑 The village gathers. Everyone's journal is changing. Everyone hears the voice. Jesse grabs your arm. \"Tell me you hear that too.\""},{"seq":559,"day":7,"line":"🎉 \"OH! One more thing! We noticed some of you have been... traveling together! In little groups! How ORGANIC! How INEFFICIENT!\""},{"seq":560,"day":7,"line":"\"So we made it OFFICIAL! The PARTY SYSTEM! Up to THREE companions! Formal! Tracked! With a UI! The audience can see your party composition now! Very important for the betting markets!\""},{"seq":561,"day":7,"line":"\"Choose wisely! Or don't! Betrayal arcs test VERY well with our demographics!\""},{"seq":562,"day":7,"line":"A new option appears when you look at people: invite them to your party."},{"seq":563,"day":7,"line":"💡 Learned: PARTY SYSTEM. You can invite people to travel and fight beside you. Ask — in conversation, like a person."},{"seq":564,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Huckleberry. Small dark berries, mountain slopes. Bears love them. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":565,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":566,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Stanley taught everyone about Huckleberry. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":567,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Peepal Fig. Peepal. The tree the Buddha sat under — its figs feed birds, and you in a pinch. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":568,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":569,"day":7,"line":"Somchai was watching. Now they know Peepal Fig too."},{"seq":570,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Nikolai taught everyone about Peepal Fig. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":571,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Jewelweed. Translucent stems, orange spotted flowers like tiny trumpets. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":572,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":573,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Eamon taught everyone about Jewelweed. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":574,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Goji Berry. Goji. Small red berries on a thorny shrub. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":575,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":576,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Nikolai taught everyone about Goji Berry. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":577,"day":7,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 35. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 3.\""},{"seq":578,"day":7,"line":"🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)"},{"seq":579,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Lamb's Quarters. Dusty-green leaves, white powder underneath. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":580,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":581,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Jesse taught everyone about Lamb's Quarters. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":582,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Daylily Bud. Daylily. Tawny trumpet flowers, long buds. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":583,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."},{"seq":584,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Somchai taught everyone about Daylily Bud. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":585,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Quest protocol integrated. Objectives will appear."},{"seq":586,"day":7,"line":"◈ THE MENTOR — Jesse watches Teresa work, then reaches over. \"No. Like this.\" An hour later something has unlocked that no manual could teach. (Ability slots: 3)"},{"seq":587,"day":7,"line":"◈ NEURAL CREEP — the overlay isn't on the world anymore. It's under it. Behind your eyes, faintly, when you blink."},{"seq":588,"day":7,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Assacu (Sandbox Tree). Assacu. Thorny trunk, exploding pods. Stay back. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":589,"day":7,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":590,"day":7,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Nikolai taught everyone about Assacu (Sandbox Tree). The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":591,"day":7,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":592,"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":593,"day":7,"line":"Eamon is showing Stanley how to tie a snare. Hands patient. It takes three tries."},{"seq":594,"day":7,"line":"Zoe has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Nikolai is showing everyone Peepal Fig by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":595,"day":7,"line":"Ole came back with 257 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 129 kcal in, 128 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":596,"day":7,"line":"Jesse had the day of their life — 1862 kcal. The pantry can't take it all: 931 kcal goes in, 931 kcal is eaten at the fire."},{"seq":597,"day":7,"line":"Eamon and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":598,"day":7,"line":"🍽️ Somchai taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":599,"day":7,"line":"🤒 Stanley is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":600,"day":7,"line":"🛟 Stanley stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":601,"day":7,"line":"\"Triage tents and broth for the sick, or half rations till it passes, or the healthy hunt hard to keep everyone fed. Pick — everything costs.\""},{"seq":602,"day":7,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Stanley adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":603,"day":7,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":604,"day":7,"line":"📓 Codex: Stanley proposed relief (sickness), day 7."},{"seq":605,"day":7,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":606,"day":7,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":607,"day":7,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":608,"day":7,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":609,"day":8,"line":"— DAY 8 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":610,"day":8,"line":"The fire burns low. 7 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Huckleberry — named and noted."},{"seq":611,"day":8,"line":"👀 Stanley let a place-name slip — somewhere that isn't Denver — then covered it with \"Denver\" so fast the cover was louder than the slip."},{"seq":612,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: A person, maybe 60s — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":613,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: The System offered an aid quest (treat), day 8."},{"seq":614,"day":8,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":615,"day":8,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 31 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":616,"day":8,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":617,"day":8,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":618,"day":8,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":619,"day":8,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":620,"day":8,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":621,"day":8,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":622,"day":8,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~8 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":623,"day":8,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":624,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Grigory about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":625,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Zoe telling Grigory about herself. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":626,"day":8,"line":"Teresa showed Eamon the Hickory Nuts — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":627,"day":8,"line":"Teresa showed Stanley the Lamb's Quarters — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":628,"day":8,"line":"Teresa showed Benoit the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":629,"day":8,"line":"💬 Paolo has been asking Somchai about Bloodhound — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":630,"day":8,"line":"Ole heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":631,"day":8,"line":"Zoe heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":632,"day":8,"line":"Jesse heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":633,"day":8,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":634,"day":8,"line":"Nikolai heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":635,"day":8,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":636,"day":8,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":637,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":638,"day":8,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":639,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Zoe telling David about herself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":640,"day":8,"line":"Teresa showed Jesse the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":641,"day":8,"line":"You catch Eamon telling the fire about Zoe. \"the woman in her 20s showed Jesse a low woodland plant with a whorl of compound leaves and a small cluster of red berries\" The story's already growing."},{"seq":642,"day":8,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":643,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":644,"day":8,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":645,"day":8,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":646,"day":8,"line":"Nikolai showed Eamon the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":647,"day":8,"line":"Paolo heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":648,"day":8,"line":"💧 Ole returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":649,"day":8,"line":"💧 Zoe returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":650,"day":8,"line":"Somchai sets out to find Jesse. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":651,"day":8,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":652,"day":8,"line":"David heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":653,"day":8,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":654,"day":8,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":655,"day":8,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":656,"day":8,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":657,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":658,"day":8,"line":"Movement — a gray fox, climbing a tree (foxes shouldn't do that)."},{"seq":659,"day":8,"line":"👁 Clever. It'll stay just out of reach, toying with you. Run it down."},{"seq":660,"day":8,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":661,"day":8,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":662,"day":8,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":663,"day":8,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":664,"day":8,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":665,"day":8,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 15 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":666,"day":8,"line":"David looks at the pantry, then at the Codex, then at you. \"We’re going to make it.\" Haven will survive — because someone learned the land, and wrote it down. One less thing to fear."},{"seq":667,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex settles deeper into you. It knows things before you do now. Deaths, especially — it will tell you itself."},{"seq":668,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Cliffhanger is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":669,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Rut King is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":670,"day":8,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":671,"day":8,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":672,"day":8,"line":"David leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Rut King. Give it a tree. His antler rack catches on trunks — keep a tree between you and let the charge tangle. Step aside at the last breath and strike while he is pulling free.\""},{"seq":673,"day":8,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Rut King: Give it a tree. His antler rack catches on trunks — keep a tree between you and let the charge tangle. Step aside at the last breath and strike while he is pulling free. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":674,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Give it a tree — His antler rack catches on trunks — keep a tree between you and let the charge tangle. Step aside at the last breath and strike while he is pulling free."},{"seq":675,"day":8,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Green Thumb, Literally (L1). Gather 50% more food from plants. Ask the Plants reveals what grows in the area, once a day. Cultivate growing Haven beds: 200 kcal, once per bed each day. Higher levels accelerate growth further."},{"seq":676,"day":8,"line":"\"The plants lean toward you. They're gossiping. You're learning to listen.\""},{"seq":677,"day":8,"line":"\"We've been watching you figure things out all week! This one's on us — a head start! But the REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\""},{"seq":678,"day":8,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":679,"day":8,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"},{"seq":680,"day":8,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (34 logs now.)"},{"seq":681,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Jesse telling Ole about Eamon. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":682,"day":8,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Zoe telling Paolo about themself. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":683,"day":8,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":684,"day":8,"line":"📨 Word came: a quiet teacher wants to join Haven. \"I can work. That's all I'm selling.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":685,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: a quiet teacher applied remotely."},{"seq":686,"day":8,"line":"◈ THE SPARK — something clicks. A trick Teresa learned long ago suddenly has edges it never had. SYSTEM: \"ANOMALY: organic unit demonstrates pattern recognition. Slot capacity increased. We are taking notes.\" (Ability slots: 3)"},{"seq":687,"day":8,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":688,"day":8,"line":"◈ ARC II — THE SHOW. The sky tore open a week ago and the village is still here. Still eating. The audience has noticed. Strangers will come — not because the plot says so, but because surviving is worth watching."},{"seq":689,"day":8,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"RATINGS DIP. The audience wants STAKES — pointed ones. A PALISADE. Stockpile 14,000 kcal, 350 wood and 60 stone. Walls make such good television. You will thank us when the teeth come.\""},{"seq":690,"day":8,"line":"🐗 RAID — 4 raiders (Night Court, Sweeps Week, Drum-Belly, Cliffhanger) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":691,"day":8,"line":"🚨 Night Court, Sweeps Week, Drum-Belly, Cliffhanger is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"seq":692,"day":8,"line":"📓 Codex: Night Court, Sweeps Week, Drum-Belly, Cliffhanger at the door, day 8."},{"seq":693,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Night Court is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":694,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Sweeps Week is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":695,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Drum-Belly is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":696,"day":8,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Cliffhanger is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":697,"day":8,"line":"🛡️ Stanley, Eamon, Grigory and Ole met them at the door — 4 put down. Stanley, Eamon, Grigory, Ole are hurt."},{"seq":698,"day":8,"line":"The defenders met them at the treeline — nothing reached your bedroll."},{"seq":699,"day":8,"line":"📢 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"Catch something! Anything! We want to see how you do it!\" (Hunt an animal today for a reward.)"},{"seq":700,"day":8,"line":"A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet."},{"seq":701,"day":8,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":702,"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":703,"day":8,"line":"Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Nikolai fixing something."},{"seq":704,"day":8,"line":"David drew White Oak Acorns in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":705,"day":8,"line":"Eamon came back with 336 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 168 kcal in, 168 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":706,"day":8,"line":"Eamon and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":707,"day":8,"line":"David eats away from the haven — 1380 kcal from the pack — while hurt (health 5/100), far from the haven's shelves."},{"seq":708,"day":8,"line":"🍽️ Nikolai carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\""},{"seq":709,"day":8,"line":"You've started noticing: Benoit and Paolo never speak. It's not new. (Something old lives in Haven.)"},{"seq":710,"day":9,"line":"— DAY 9 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":711,"day":9,"line":"Snow by morning. (0°C — Cold) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear."},{"seq":712,"day":9,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":713,"day":9,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 3 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":714,"day":9,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":715,"day":9,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":716,"day":9,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":717,"day":9,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":718,"day":9,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":719,"day":9,"line":"👂 Overheard — Ole: \"We should eat together tonight. All of us. It matters.\""},{"seq":720,"day":9,"line":"👂 Overheard — Zoe: \"Hmm. That fits what I've been seeing. Let me think about the mechanism...\""},{"seq":721,"day":9,"line":"👂 Ole \"You. Yeah, you. What do you make of this?\""},{"seq":722,"day":9,"line":"(Something in their exchange sticks with you. read people +1)"},{"seq":723,"day":9,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":724,"day":9,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~9 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":725,"day":9,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":726,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Nikolai about Eamon. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":727,"day":9,"line":"Somchai showed Stanley the Daylily Bud — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":728,"day":9,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":729,"day":9,"line":"👥 Grigory heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":730,"day":9,"line":"👥 Jesse walks out with Grigory. \"Nobody walks alone today.\""},{"seq":731,"day":9,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (46 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":732,"day":9,"line":"👥 Nikolai heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":733,"day":9,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":734,"day":9,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":735,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":736,"day":9,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":737,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Zoe about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":738,"day":9,"line":"💬 Jesse says: \"If they're watching, let them watch me work. That's all I've got.\""},{"seq":739,"day":9,"line":"Nikolai showed Grigory the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":740,"day":9,"line":"Eamon showed Ole the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":741,"day":9,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (64 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":742,"day":9,"line":"💧 David returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":743,"day":9,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":744,"day":9,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":745,"day":9,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE SIEGE. They came in the night for the pantry — and the village met them at the door with blades and fire and drove them back into the dark. Wealth has a scent. So does defiance."},{"seq":746,"day":9,"line":"SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\""},{"seq":747,"day":9,"line":"🛟 Stanley looks up from the fire. \"And now a raid, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":748,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":749,"day":9,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":750,"day":9,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling David about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":751,"day":9,"line":"Teresa showed Grigory the Daylily Bud — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":752,"day":9,"line":"Stanley showed David the Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":753,"day":9,"line":"💧 Grigory returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":754,"day":9,"line":"🚶 Jesse is back with Grigory."},{"seq":755,"day":9,"line":"🩹 David is still hurting (5 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":756,"day":9,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":757,"day":9,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":758,"day":9,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Paolo has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Cliffhanger — I put it down today.\" \"It goes perfectly still. Only the eyes move. Then the water explodes — and the world starts spinning.\" \"It has your leg. The roll starts. Do NOT let it reach the water.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Zoe says quietly \"So it bleeds.\" Ole says \"So it blee"},{"seq":759,"day":9,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. David has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Rut King — I put it down today.\" \"He lowers the crown. Paws the earth once, twice. The whole forest holds its breath.\" \"His chest swells. The inhale goes on too long — cover your ears or get behind something.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Eamon says \"So it bleeds.\" Zoe asks \"So it bleeds."},{"seq":760,"day":9,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Stanley has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Night Court — I put it down today.\" \"No sound. That is the warning. The moon-shadow on the ground is growing — and there is no sound at all. Owls don't make sound when they hunt.\" \"It missed — and it is already turning. The second dive re-aims at where you moved.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at"},{"seq":761,"day":9,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Eamon has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Sweeps Week — I put it down today.\" \"The grass stops moving the way wind moves it. Two amber eyes — then the whole striped avalanche.\" \"It circles, unhurried. It has seen this episode before — and it knows how it ends.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Paolo breathes \"And you're still standin"},{"seq":762,"day":9,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Grigory has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Drum-Belly — I put it down today.\" \"It rears up, belly swelling drum-taut, and beats it with both paws — BOOM. The air itself flinches.\" \"It waddles left, then is suddenly right — a feint, testing whether your eyes or your ears are in charge.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Eamon says \"Te"},{"seq":763,"day":9,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":764,"day":9,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":765,"day":9,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":766,"day":9,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 8× Blackberry (520 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":767,"day":9,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":768,"day":9,"line":"While you were gone — 6 things you missed:"},{"seq":769,"day":9,"line":"⚔️ Paolo killed the Cliffhanger with their party — 3 rounds, 36 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":770,"day":9,"line":"⚔️ David killed the Rut King with their party — 7 rounds, 95 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":771,"day":9,"line":"⚔️ Stanley killed the Night Court with their party — 4 rounds, 38 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":772,"day":9,"line":"⚔️ Eamon killed the Sweeps Week with their party — 6 rounds, 41 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":773,"day":9,"line":"⚔️ Grigory killed the Drum-Belly with their party — 4 rounds, 24 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":774,"day":9,"line":"...and 1 more. Ask around — they'll tell you."},{"seq":775,"day":9,"line":"You keep a day's food (520 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":776,"day":9,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 15 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":777,"day":9,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":778,"day":9,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":779,"day":9,"line":"Eamon leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Night Court. Dodge twice. No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours.\""},{"seq":780,"day":9,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Night Court: Dodge twice. No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":781,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Dodge twice — No sound is the tell — watch the ground-shadow. A missed dive comes again instantly at your NEW position: dodge TWICE. Then it's exhausted, and the sky is yours."},{"seq":782,"day":9,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":783,"day":9,"line":"You eat Blackberry (520 kcal)."},{"seq":784,"day":9,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":785,"day":9,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (3 stone now.)"},{"seq":786,"day":9,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (37 logs now.)"},{"seq":787,"day":9,"line":"🚶 Somchai is back — found Jesse."},{"seq":788,"day":9,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":789,"day":9,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)"},{"seq":790,"day":9,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Big Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":791,"day":9,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 52. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 4.\""},{"seq":792,"day":9,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)"},{"seq":793,"day":9,"line":"Zoe came back from the treeline white-faced. Saw it too. Whatever it is, it's still out there."},{"seq":794,"day":9,"line":"🚶 A stranger walks into Haven. They're thin, scared, and carrying nothing. \"Please,\" they say. \"I heard you have food.\" (Drama: do you share?)"},{"seq":795,"day":9,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":796,"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":797,"day":9,"line":"Jesse is showing everyone Lamb's Quarters by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":798,"day":9,"line":"Jesse came back with 553 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 277 kcal in, 276 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":799,"day":9,"line":"Grigory and Eamon lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":800,"day":9,"line":"Ole and Eamon lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":801,"day":9,"line":"Nikolai and Zoe lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":802,"day":9,"line":"🍽️ Zoe looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\""},{"seq":803,"day":9,"line":"📓 Codex: Zoe taught Paolo Reading People."},{"seq":804,"day":9,"line":"🌿 Jewelweed — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":805,"day":9,"line":"💡 Jewelweed: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":806,"day":9,"line":"🤒 David is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":807,"day":10,"line":"— DAY 10 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":808,"day":10,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":809,"day":10,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 103 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":810,"day":10,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":811,"day":10,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":812,"day":10,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":813,"day":10,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":814,"day":10,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":815,"day":10,"line":"👂 Overheard — Paolo: \"One day at a time. We're still here — that counts.\""},{"seq":816,"day":10,"line":"👂 Overheard — Jesse: \"Right. Let's do it, then. Talking doesn't chop wood.\""},{"seq":817,"day":10,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":818,"day":10,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~8 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":819,"day":10,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":820,"day":10,"line":"Eamon showed Benoit the Daylily Bud — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":821,"day":10,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (64 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":822,"day":10,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (46 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":823,"day":10,"line":"👥 Nikolai heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":824,"day":10,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":825,"day":10,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":826,"day":10,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":827,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":828,"day":10,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":829,"day":10,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":830,"day":10,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":831,"day":10,"line":"👂 Overheard — Paolo: \"We've made it this far. That's not luck, that's us.\""},{"seq":832,"day":10,"line":"👂 Overheard — David: \"Right. Let's do it, then. Talking doesn't chop wood.\""},{"seq":833,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Stanley about Grigory. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":834,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — David telling Eamon about Jesse. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":835,"day":10,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":836,"day":10,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":837,"day":10,"line":"Zoe heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":838,"day":10,"line":"Somchai heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":839,"day":10,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":840,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":841,"day":10,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 12L left."},{"seq":842,"day":10,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":843,"day":10,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":844,"day":10,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"Big Ugly.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":845,"day":10,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":846,"day":10,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"The Bailiff.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":847,"day":10,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":848,"day":10,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":849,"day":10,"line":"👥 Grigory heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":850,"day":10,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":851,"day":10,"line":"Nikolai is stitching a tear shut by the door light, squinting at every stitch."},{"seq":852,"day":10,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":853,"day":10,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":854,"day":10,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":855,"day":10,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":856,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":857,"day":10,"line":"Something moves out there — The Moderator."},{"seq":858,"day":10,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":859,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Jesse telling Ole about Grigory. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":860,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Nikolai about himself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":861,"day":10,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Grigory about Jesse. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":862,"day":10,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":863,"day":10,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":864,"day":10,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 6× Hickory Nuts, 5× White Oak Acorns, 6× Spicebush (180 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":865,"day":10,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":866,"day":10,"line":"You keep a day's food (180 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":867,"day":10,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":868,"day":10,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":869,"day":10,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":870,"day":10,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":871,"day":10,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":872,"day":10,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 15 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":873,"day":10,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":874,"day":10,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":875,"day":10,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":876,"day":10,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":877,"day":10,"line":"Stanley leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Sweeps Week. Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow.\""},{"seq":878,"day":10,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Sweeps Week: Never show it your back. FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":879,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never show it your back — FACE IT — or paint eyes on the back of your head — and it hesitates. It wants the ambush, not the fight. Never turn, never run; running is prey. Hold its gaze and back away slow."},{"seq":880,"day":10,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":881,"day":10,"line":"You eat Spicebush (180 kcal)."},{"seq":882,"day":10,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":883,"day":10,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (5 stone now.)"},{"seq":884,"day":10,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (41 logs now.)"},{"seq":885,"day":10,"line":"💧 Zoe returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":886,"day":10,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"Ooh. NEIGHBORS. You know what neighbors are for? STORYLINES. Go knock — worst case, it's CONTENT. Best case? The show gets BIGGER.\""},{"seq":887,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: The System noticed the neighbors, and wants storylines."},{"seq":888,"day":10,"line":"📨 Word came: Sam Wilson of Emberhold wants to join Haven. \"My village is gone. Yours isn't. That's the whole of it.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":889,"day":10,"line":"Someone walks in like they belong here, grinning. \"Heard about this place three valleys over. Had to see it.\" The System's show has an audience, and audiences talk."},{"seq":890,"day":10,"line":"📓 Codex: a curious wanderer arrived (curious)."},{"seq":891,"day":10,"line":"🐺 HOWLS in the distance. Closer than before. The System chirps: \"Oh! We made those! Are they... too many? We can make fewer?\" (New monster: hushwolf pack.)"},{"seq":892,"day":10,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":893,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT HOODIE — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn (morale). You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":894,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Hoodie\nDorm laundry and rain. The night the storm took the power you walked three miles home in this, soaked through, laughing. Armor, basically."},{"seq":895,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: You can smell weather coming. Storms rarely surprise you."},{"seq":896,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Hoodie is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":897,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT CARPENTER'S SQUARE — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn; building and repairs hold better. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":898,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Carpenter's square\nYour first solo frame, checked and found true. The nod that followed was the whole ceremony. Measure twice, cut once — it's in your hands now."},{"seq":899,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: Measure twice. You still hear it."},{"seq":900,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Carpenter's square is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":901,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT UNNAMED PHOTOGRAPH — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":902,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Unnamed photograph\nThere is a name you won't say out loud anymore. The photo doesn't need you to say it. Somebody you loved didn't make it to the clearing, and this is what's left of the proof they were here."},{"seq":903,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: You carry them. That is the whole of it."},{"seq":904,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Unnamed photograph is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":905,"day":10,"line":"◈ \"UNIT DISPATCHER'S HEADSET — [TRANSLATION COMPLETE] — we have been watching you carry this. Attachment waveform: significant. Function decoded: +resolve when worn; calm under pressure. You knew it mattered before we did. Cute.\""},{"seq":906,"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Dispatcher's headset\nYou learned the voice — low, steady, unhurried. 'Panic is just information arriving too fast.' You hear it in your own voice now when it counts."},{"seq":907,"day":10,"line":"📖 The memory leaves something behind: You read bad situations early. It is training."},{"seq":908,"day":10,"line":"💛 The Dispatcher's headset is starting to do something. (Keepsake L1 — resolve: trauma lands a quarter lighter, while worn.)"},{"seq":909,"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":910,"day":10,"line":"Jesse paces the hall, restless, then sits. Then paces."},{"seq":911,"day":10,"line":"Nikolai drew Assacu (Sandbox Tree) in the dirt for the others. It'll wash away. The knowledge won't."},{"seq":912,"day":10,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Cacao. Sweet pulp around bitter seeds, straight off the trunk. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":913,"day":10,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":914,"day":10,"line":"Nikolai was watching. Now they know Cacao too."},{"seq":915,"day":10,"line":"Somchai brought you a sample. The Codex grows."},{"seq":916,"day":10,"line":"Jesse traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":917,"day":10,"line":"🤢 Grigory's stomach knots — something in their meal was off."},{"seq":918,"day":10,"line":"Benoit and Jesse lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":919,"day":10,"line":"🍽️ Benoit taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""},{"seq":920,"day":10,"line":"🌿 Huckleberry — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":921,"day":10,"line":"💡 Huckleberry: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":922,"day":10,"line":"🌿 Blackberry — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":923,"day":10,"line":"💡 Blackberry: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (2/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":924,"day":10,"line":"🤒 Eamon made it through the worst of it — the fever finally broke."},{"seq":925,"day":10,"line":"🛟 Zoe stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":926,"day":10,"line":"\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\""},{"seq":927,"day":10,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Zoe adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":928,"day":10,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":929,"day":10,"line":"Emberhold's speaker sent a runner: the northwest ground feeds both villages or neither. They want to talk — properly, at their fire. Ignoring this is also an answer."},{"seq":930,"day":10,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":931,"day":11,"line":"— DAY 11 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":932,"day":11,"line":"On the carcass nearby, Night Court (carcass), Sweeps Week (carcass), Drum-Belly (carcass), Cliffhanger (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost."},{"seq":933,"day":11,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Cacao — named and noted."},{"seq":934,"day":11,"line":"👀 Stanley pronounced a Denver place-name the way someone reads it off a map for the first time. Nobody from there says it that way."},{"seq":935,"day":11,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":936,"day":11,"line":"\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\""},{"seq":937,"day":11,"line":"(228 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":938,"day":11,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":939,"day":11,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":940,"day":11,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":941,"day":11,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":942,"day":11,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":943,"day":11,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":944,"day":11,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":945,"day":11,"line":"The stash count is off. 1 stone missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody suspects something."},{"seq":946,"day":11,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":947,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":948,"day":11,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":949,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Zoe telling Grigory about himself. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":950,"day":11,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — everyone's talking about it now."},{"seq":951,"day":11,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"Big Big.\" They'll fight it out — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":952,"day":11,"line":"Nikolai showed Paolo the Cacao — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":953,"day":11,"line":"Teresa showed Jesse the Cacao — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":954,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Eamon is still hurting (9 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":955,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":956,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Grigory returns from foraging the wilds: +265 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 264 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":957,"day":11,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (49 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":958,"day":11,"line":"Zoe heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":959,"day":11,"line":"👥 Jesse heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":960,"day":11,"line":"Nikolai is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":961,"day":11,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":962,"day":11,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":963,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":964,"day":11,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":965,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Grigory about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":966,"day":11,"line":"💬 Ole says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\""},{"seq":967,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Somchai returns from foraging the wilds: +220 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 220 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":968,"day":11,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":969,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":970,"day":11,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":971,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Jesse telling Eamon about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":972,"day":11,"line":"💧 Zoe returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":973,"day":11,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":974,"day":11,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":975,"day":11,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":976,"day":11,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":977,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":978,"day":11,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":979,"day":11,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":980,"day":11,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":981,"day":11,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":982,"day":11,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":983,"day":11,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":984,"day":11,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 4 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":985,"day":11,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":986,"day":11,"line":"⬆️ Green Thumb, Literally deepened to L2! +100% yield (was +50%)."},{"seq":987,"day":11,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"seq":988,"day":11,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":989,"day":11,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":990,"day":11,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":991,"day":11,"line":"Grigory leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Cliffhanger. Go for the eyes. When it lunges, strike the EYES or the soft palate inside the mouth — the armored hide shrugs off everything else. Never fight it in the water; that's its studio. On land, get beside it: it turns like a bus.\""},{"seq":992,"day":11,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Cliffhanger: Go for the eyes. When it lunges, strike the EYES or the soft palate inside the mouth — the armored hide shrugs off everything else. Never fight it in the water; that's its studio. On land, get beside it: it turns like a bus. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":993,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Go for the eyes — When it lunges, strike the EYES or the soft palate inside the mouth — the armored hide shrugs off everything else. Never fight it in the water; that's its studio. On land, get beside it: it turns like a bus."},{"seq":994,"day":11,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":995,"day":11,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (4 stone now.)"},{"seq":996,"day":11,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 6 wood. The pile grows. (45 logs now.)"},{"seq":997,"day":11,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Somchai about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":998,"day":11,"line":"Somchai is working the cookpot, tasting, adjusting."},{"seq":999,"day":11,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 16 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1000,"day":11,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":1001,"day":11,"line":"A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":1002,"day":11,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1003,"day":11,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+4 integration)"},{"seq":1004,"day":11,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1005,"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1185 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1006,"day":11,"line":"Somchai is showing everyone Daylily Bud by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1007,"day":11,"line":"Nikolai is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 84/100)"},{"seq":1008,"day":11,"line":"Zoe and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1009,"day":11,"line":"Somchai and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1010,"day":11,"line":"Somchai and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1011,"day":11,"line":"David and Jesse lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1012,"day":11,"line":"🍽️ Zoe watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":1013,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Somchai taught Paolo Tireless Stride."},{"seq":1014,"day":11,"line":"📓 Codex: Grigory taught Ole Diplomatic Incident."},{"seq":1015,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Peepal Fig — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1016,"day":11,"line":"💡 Peepal Fig: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1017,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Goji Berry — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1018,"day":11,"line":"💡 Goji Berry: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1019,"day":11,"line":"🌿 Spicebush — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1020,"day":11,"line":"💡 Spicebush: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (2/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1021,"day":11,"line":"💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back."},{"seq":1022,"day":11,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. David is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1023,"day":11,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":1024,"day":11,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE FIRST GRAVE. David is dead. The village digs its first grave, and everyone understands at once: this place can kill you. It just did."},{"seq":1025,"day":11,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Oh. Oh no. Was that supposed to happen? The audience is crying. I did not know they could do that.\""},{"seq":1026,"day":11,"line":"📖 The entry for David is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":1027,"day":12,"line":"— DAY 12 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1028,"day":12,"line":"◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from Stonebridge bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Witness. People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one."},{"seq":1029,"day":12,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1030,"day":12,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1031,"day":12,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1032,"day":12,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1033,"day":12,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1034,"day":12,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1035,"day":12,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1036,"day":12,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1037,"day":12,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1038,"day":12,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1039,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Nikolai telling Eamon about Zoe. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1040,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Grigory about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1041,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Somchai about Benoit. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1042,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Eamon is still hurting (9 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1043,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1044,"day":12,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (49 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1045,"day":12,"line":"👥 Nikolai heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1046,"day":12,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1047,"day":12,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1048,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1049,"day":12,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1050,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Paolo about Zoe. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1051,"day":12,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Jesse about Benoit. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1052,"day":12,"line":"👥 Somchai heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1053,"day":12,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1054,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1055,"day":12,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1056,"day":12,"line":"Ole showed Stanley the Cacao — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":1057,"day":12,"line":"Zoe heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1058,"day":12,"line":"👥 Benoit heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":1059,"day":12,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1060,"day":12,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1061,"day":12,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":1062,"day":12,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1063,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1064,"day":12,"line":"Something moves out there — The Loud Beast."},{"seq":1065,"day":12,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 10× Blackberry (650 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1066,"day":12,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1067,"day":12,"line":"The Loud Beast stops at the treeline — pacing, unwilling. The walls end the argument. It's still out there."},{"seq":1068,"day":12,"line":"You keep a day's food (650 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1069,"day":12,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1070,"day":12,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1071,"day":12,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1072,"day":12,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1073,"day":12,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1074,"day":12,"line":"💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −2 trauma)"},{"seq":1075,"day":12,"line":"Taken: Kitchen knife x1, Rain poncho x1, Work Gloves x1, Hand drill x1, Multitool x1."},{"seq":1076,"day":12,"line":"You take kitchen knife, rain poncho, work gloves, hand drill, multitool from David. Your hands know what they did. (+8 trauma)"},{"seq":1077,"day":12,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":1078,"day":12,"line":"Paolo leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Loud Beast. Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer.\""},{"seq":1079,"day":12,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Loud Beast: Strike the taut drum. When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1080,"day":12,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Strike the taut drum — When the belly swells drum-taut, STRIKE — the stretched skin is thin as a drumhead and the thunderclap backfires, stunning it senseless. Hit the drum, not the drummer."},{"seq":1081,"day":12,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1082,"day":12,"line":"You eat Blackberry (650 kcal)."},{"seq":1083,"day":12,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1084,"day":12,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (6 stone now.)"},{"seq":1085,"day":12,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 5 wood. The pile grows. (48 logs now.)"},{"seq":1086,"day":12,"line":"💧 Somchai returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1087,"day":12,"line":"Benoit doesn't say it twice: \"Emberhold has grain. We have hands. Someone should walk over.\""},{"seq":1088,"day":12,"line":"📨 Word came: Desmond Clarke wants to join Haven. \"Heard about this place three valleys over. Had to try.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge."},{"seq":1089,"day":12,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":1090,"day":12,"line":"◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something."},{"seq":1091,"day":12,"line":"🗣️ Benoit to Stanley, by the fire: \"Stone. We need 54 more for the palisade footings. Creek beds, hillsides — pry it loose.\""},{"seq":1092,"day":12,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":1093,"day":12,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Paolo stands accused over what happened to Benoit. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":1094,"day":12,"line":"📓 Codex: Heard about the case against Paolo."},{"seq":1095,"day":12,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Big Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1096,"day":12,"line":"SYSTEM: Codex and inventory overlay online."},{"seq":1097,"day":12,"line":"◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers Teresa a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 4)"},{"seq":1098,"day":12,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"A trial, broadcast live. The audience loves a trial.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":1099,"day":12,"line":"◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pa"},{"seq":1100,"day":12,"line":"SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Hard Candy. WATCH.\""},{"seq":1101,"day":12,"line":"💛 You hold Hard Candy and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Green Thumb, Literally)"},{"seq":1102,"day":12,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+3 integration)"},{"seq":1103,"day":12,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Bailiff.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1104,"day":12,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1105,"day":12,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1106,"day":12,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 66. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 5.\""},{"seq":1107,"day":12,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1108,"day":12,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"We've been thinking. You know things we don't. Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3). We will watch very closely, which is our entire personality.\""},{"seq":1109,"day":12,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1110,"day":12,"line":"🌟 \"We have detected elevated attachment to Unit MENDER'S APRON. This is inefficient. This is also... [PROCESSING] ...valuable? Optimization available.\" (Choose an enhancement for your Mender's Apron.)"},{"seq":1111,"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1112,"day":12,"line":"Nikolai set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":1113,"day":12,"line":"Grigory came back with 595 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 298 kcal in, 297 kcal eaten at the fire."},{"seq":1114,"day":12,"line":"Eamon traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1115,"day":12,"line":"Eamon and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1116,"day":12,"line":"🍽️ Jesse watches another basket arrive and laughs. \"We're feeding the shelves more than ourselves. Not today.\""},{"seq":1117,"day":12,"line":"🤒 Grigory made it through the worst of it — the fever finally broke."},{"seq":1118,"day":13,"line":"— DAY 13 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1119,"day":13,"line":"💬 Jesse says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\""},{"seq":1120,"day":13,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 77 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1121,"day":13,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1122,"day":13,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1123,"day":13,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1124,"day":13,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1125,"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1126,"day":13,"line":"Equipped Kitchen knife (melee)."},{"seq":1127,"day":13,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1128,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~5 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1129,"day":13,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1130,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Eamon is still hurting (12 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1131,"day":13,"line":"👥 Paolo walks out with Eamon. \"Nobody walks alone today.\""},{"seq":1132,"day":13,"line":"Grigory heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\""},{"seq":1133,"day":13,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (52 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1134,"day":13,"line":"💧 Zoe returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1135,"day":13,"line":"👥 Jesse heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1136,"day":13,"line":"🌿 Benoit returns from foraging the wilds: +250 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 249 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1137,"day":13,"line":"Nikolai heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1138,"day":13,"line":"Zoe is crouched over the embers, blowing soft, one hand blocking the draft."},{"seq":1139,"day":13,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1140,"day":13,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1141,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1142,"day":13,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1143,"day":13,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1144,"day":13,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1145,"day":13,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1146,"day":13,"line":"Somchai sets out to find Jesse. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":1147,"day":13,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1148,"day":13,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1149,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1150,"day":13,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 11L left."},{"seq":1151,"day":13,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1152,"day":13,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1153,"day":13,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1154,"day":13,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":1155,"day":13,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":1156,"day":13,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1157,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1158,"day":13,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nightlight is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1159,"day":13,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1160,"day":13,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":1161,"day":13,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":1162,"day":13,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 13× Hickory Nuts, 13× White Oak Acorns, 13× Spicebush (390 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1163,"day":13,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1164,"day":13,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1165,"day":13,"line":"⚔️ Somchai killed the Nightlight with their party — 2 rounds, 12 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1166,"day":13,"line":"You keep a day's food (390 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1167,"day":13,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1168,"day":13,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1169,"day":13,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":1170,"day":13,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1171,"day":13,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1172,"day":13,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1173,"day":13,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Ole about Paolo. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1174,"day":13,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 8 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1175,"day":13,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1176,"day":13,"line":"🌀 Green Thumb, Literally is STRAINING at its edges. The gift wants to become something — and it wants YOU to choose what."},{"seq":1177,"day":13,"line":"\"IT’S MOLTING! We didn’t program molting! This is YOUR doing! CHOOSE! Choose what it becomes!\""},{"seq":1178,"day":13,"line":"(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)"},{"seq":1179,"day":13,"line":"\"Oh! OH! You're starting to GET it! The audience loves the little ah-ha moments! The odds just shifted!\""},{"seq":1180,"day":13,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1181,"day":13,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1182,"day":13,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1183,"day":13,"line":"Eamon leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\""},{"seq":1184,"day":13,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1185,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp."},{"seq":1186,"day":13,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1187,"day":13,"line":"You eat Spicebush (390 kcal)."},{"seq":1188,"day":13,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1189,"day":13,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 2 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (8 stone now.)"},{"seq":1190,"day":13,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (50 logs now.)"},{"seq":1191,"day":13,"line":"🚶 Paolo is back with Jesse."},{"seq":1192,"day":13,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1193,"day":13,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1194,"day":13,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Ugly Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1195,"day":13,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1196,"day":13,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1197,"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1198,"day":13,"line":"The fire is quiet today. Nobody's talking much."},{"seq":1199,"day":13,"line":"Grigory traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1200,"day":13,"line":"Paolo: \"Walked past a good stand of pokeweed. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":1201,"day":13,"line":"🍽️ Zoe sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\""},{"seq":1202,"day":13,"line":"✦ Ole has found something — Everybody's Friend. Days of silver_tongue and gossip_network side by side, and now they move as one. (everybodys_friend: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1203,"day":13,"line":"📓 Codex: Ole discovered Everybody's Friend (everybodys_friend)."},{"seq":1204,"day":13,"line":"✦ Zoe has found something — Tells. Days of lie_detector and open_book side by side, and now they move as one. (tells: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1205,"day":13,"line":"✦ Zoe has found something — Airtight. Days of lie_detector and evidence_board side by side, and now they move as one. (airtight: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1206,"day":13,"line":"💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper."},{"seq":1207,"day":13,"line":"🤒 Stanley is back on their feet — the fever ran its course."},{"seq":1208,"day":14,"line":"— DAY 14 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1209,"day":14,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1210,"day":14,"line":"\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\""},{"seq":1211,"day":14,"line":"(231 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1212,"day":14,"line":"Something has shifted. Conversations stop when you approach the fire. Nobody meets your eyes for long."},{"seq":1213,"day":14,"line":"📓 Codex: The village has gone quiet around me. I don't know why — I've eaten only what was set before me."},{"seq":1214,"day":14,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 74 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1215,"day":14,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1216,"day":14,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1217,"day":14,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1218,"day":14,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1219,"day":14,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1220,"day":14,"line":"🌱 Stanley waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait."},{"seq":1221,"day":14,"line":"🌿 Stanley checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~4 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."},{"seq":1222,"day":14,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1223,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Stanley is still hurting (53 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1224,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Eamon is still hurting (15 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1225,"day":14,"line":"🌿 Grigory returns from foraging the wilds: +228 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 228 kcal is eaten at the fire instead."},{"seq":1226,"day":14,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (55 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1227,"day":14,"line":"Zoe wanders off. \"I want to see what's out there.\""},{"seq":1228,"day":14,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1229,"day":14,"line":"Nikolai heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1230,"day":14,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1231,"day":14,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1232,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1233,"day":14,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Eamon says. (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1234,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Benoit telling Ole about himself. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1235,"day":14,"line":"Grigory heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1236,"day":14,"line":"🚶 Somchai is back — found Jesse."},{"seq":1237,"day":14,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1238,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1239,"day":14,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1240,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Benoit about themself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1241,"day":14,"line":"Paolo heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""},{"seq":1242,"day":14,"line":"Somchai sets out for Nightlight. \"Meat's meat. Back with it or not at all.\""},{"seq":1243,"day":14,"line":"Jesse heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1244,"day":14,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1245,"day":14,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Somchai has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Nightlight — I put it down today.\" \"A soft green glow under the water. Pretty. That's the problem — it's pretty.\" \"The whiskers go rigid — then lash.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Eamon asks \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Stanley asks \"We've been walking past those.\" Someone at the edge"},{"seq":1246,"day":14,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":1247,"day":14,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1248,"day":14,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1249,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Zoe about themself. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1250,"day":14,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1251,"day":14,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":1252,"day":14,"line":"Movement — a thick-bodied rattlesnake, chevron bands, the tail a blur of dry sound."},{"seq":1253,"day":14,"line":"👁 It warns first — the rattle IS the negotiation. Heed it. Pin it behind the head with a forked stick, or take it at range. Never reach."},{"seq":1254,"day":14,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1255,"day":14,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":1256,"day":14,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1257,"day":14,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1258,"day":14,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1259,"day":14,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1260,"day":14,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1261,"day":14,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1262,"day":14,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1263,"day":14,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1264,"day":14,"line":"Paolo hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1265,"day":14,"line":"Grigory hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1266,"day":14,"line":"📋 Ole — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1267,"day":14,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1268,"day":14,"line":"🪨 Jesse pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (9 stone now.)"},{"seq":1269,"day":14,"line":"🪵 Stanley hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (52 logs now.)"},{"seq":1270,"day":14,"line":"💧 Eamon returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1271,"day":14,"line":"🍲 Ole cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1272,"day":14,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ole telling Zoe about herself. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1273,"day":14,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1274,"day":14,"line":"💧 Nikolai returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1275,"day":14,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Benoit stands accused over what happened to Paolo. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":1276,"day":14,"line":"Benoit has been talking at the fires. Enough voices — tonight they call a moot. Paolo answers for what happened to Benoit."},{"seq":1277,"day":14,"line":"Benoit calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."},{"seq":1278,"day":14,"line":"The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."},{"seq":1279,"day":14,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"AUDIENCE EXPANSION! Your party cap is now FOUR! The people demanded bigger ensembles! Don't let us down!\""},{"seq":1280,"day":14,"line":"📦 INCOMING: a crate thumps down outside your door, trailing parachute silk and the smell of glitter. Stenciled on the side, in enormous cheerful letters: FOR LUCK."},{"seq":1281,"day":14,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"A viewer sent this. A FAN. We checked. It is not dinner.\" A pause. \"We checked twice. The fans are very insistent that you open it ON CAMERA.\""},{"seq":1282,"day":14,"line":"The package sits in your pack, unopened. Opening it takes a day-part — the fans demand the full unboxing. (Use it from your pack when you have a morning to spend.)"},{"seq":1283,"day":14,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1284,"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1285,"day":14,"line":"Zoe: \"Goji Berry is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\""},{"seq":1286,"day":14,"line":"Benoit came back with 585 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1287,"day":14,"line":"🍽️ Grigory sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\""},{"seq":1288,"day":14,"line":"✦ Grigory has found something — Everybody's Friend. Days of silver_tongue and gossip_network side by side, and now they move as one. (everybodys_friend: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1289,"day":14,"line":"🌿 White Oak Acorns — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1290,"day":14,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: White Oak Acorns — Level 2. You knew it was safe. the village knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Parts: nut meat (must leach tannins), caps (nothing). White oak = less tannin than red."},{"seq":1291,"day":14,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":1292,"day":14,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."},{"seq":1293,"day":15,"line":"— DAY 15 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1294,"day":15,"line":"👀 When the others traded stories about Denver, Eamon went quiet in a way that wasn't listening — more like realizing they had nothing true to trade."},{"seq":1295,"day":15,"line":"📓 Codex: Eamon — jotted down what they said. Filed."},{"seq":1296,"day":15,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1297,"day":15,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 29 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1298,"day":15,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1299,"day":15,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1300,"day":15,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1301,"day":15,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1302,"day":15,"line":"Eamon looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1303,"day":15,"line":"🌱 Stanley works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1304,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Somchai about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":1305,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Stanley is still hurting (53 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1306,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Eamon is still hurting (15 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1307,"day":15,"line":"💧 Grigory returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1308,"day":15,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (55 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1309,"day":15,"line":"💬 Grigory has been asking Benoit about Green Thumb, Literally — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":1310,"day":15,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1311,"day":15,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1312,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1313,"day":15,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1314,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Jesse about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1315,"day":15,"line":"💬 Teresa says: \"Do you ever feel it? Like the air leans in when something happens.\""},{"seq":1316,"day":15,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1317,"day":15,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1318,"day":15,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1319,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1320,"day":15,"line":"Eamon shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"seq":1321,"day":15,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Paolo about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1322,"day":15,"line":"👥 Paolo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1323,"day":15,"line":"👥 Jesse walks out with Paolo. \"Nobody walks alone today.\""},{"seq":1324,"day":15,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1325,"day":15,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":1326,"day":15,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1327,"day":15,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1328,"day":15,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":1329,"day":15,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 26× Blackberry (1690 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1330,"day":15,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1331,"day":15,"line":"You keep a day's food (1690 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1332,"day":15,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1333,"day":15,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1334,"day":15,"line":"You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1335,"day":15,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1336,"day":15,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1337,"day":15,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1338,"day":15,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1339,"day":15,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1340,"day":15,"line":"You eat Blackberry (1495 kcal)."},{"seq":1341,"day":15,"line":"Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning."},{"seq":1342,"day":15,"line":"Grigory hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1343,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 2 fish, +480 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1344,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Stanley worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1345,"day":15,"line":"🎣 Eamon worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1346,"day":15,"line":"🍲 Paolo cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1347,"day":15,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else."},{"seq":1348,"day":15,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1349,"day":15,"line":"🥩 Somchai is back with strange meat: unknown flesh in the pantry. \"Test it cautiously before anyone eats.\""},{"seq":1350,"day":15,"line":"🥩 Somchai is back empty-handed. \"Nothing worth hauling out there.\""},{"seq":1351,"day":15,"line":"🐗 RAID — 3 raiders (The Loud Beast, The Moderator, The Moderator) hit Haven in the night, drawn by the smell of the pantry! No walls. No warning but the noise."},{"seq":1352,"day":15,"line":"🕯️ The treeline is still torn up from the raid when the System's light comes for them. Nobody is ready. The light doesn't wait."},{"seq":1353,"day":15,"line":"🚨 The Loud Beast, The Moderator, The Moderator is at Haven's door. The village looks to you. Four ways to call: a RUNNER (slow, dangerous), a SIGNAL FIRE (fast, loud, everyone sees), the SYSTEM RELAY (if it can carry voices), or an ABILITY CRY (if your build has one). Each with honest costs."},{"seq":1354,"day":15,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Loud Beast is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1355,"day":15,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Moderator is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1356,"day":15,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Moderator is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1357,"day":15,"line":"🛡️ Stanley, Grigory and Ole met them at the door — 3 put down. Stanley, Grigory, Ole are hurt."},{"seq":1358,"day":15,"line":"The defenders met them at the treeline — nothing reached your bedroll."},{"seq":1359,"day":15,"line":"Days later, you'll hear what happened out past the ridge. For now: nothing. The village keeps its face still."},{"seq":1360,"day":15,"line":"A stranger at the tree line, watching. Not hiding, exactly. Measuring. They'll be gone by dusk — but they'll remember what they saw."},{"seq":1361,"day":15,"line":"Paolo has been talking at the fires. Enough voices — tonight they call a moot. Benoit answers for what happened to Paolo."},{"seq":1362,"day":15,"line":"Paolo calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."},{"seq":1363,"day":15,"line":"The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."},{"seq":1364,"day":15,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1365,"day":15,"line":"◈ THE CREEP — Teresa's thoughts have an echo now. The System's echo. Or theirs. Hard to tell anymore. Gifts used in sequence resonate — try them together. (Ability slots: 5)"},{"seq":1366,"day":15,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1367,"day":15,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1368,"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1369,"day":15,"line":"Grigory is staring into the fire like it owes them answers."},{"seq":1370,"day":15,"line":"Zoe sets aside time with The Loud Beast flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Zoe tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it."},{"seq":1371,"day":15,"line":"Benoit: \"The goji berry patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\""},{"seq":1372,"day":15,"line":"Eamon and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1373,"day":15,"line":"Ole and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1374,"day":15,"line":"✦ Zoe has found something — String Wall. Days of evidence_board and eagle_eye side by side, and now they move as one. (string_wall: villager synergy discovered)"},{"seq":1375,"day":15,"line":"🌿 Hickory Nuts — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1376,"day":15,"line":"💡 KNOWLEDGE COMBINES: Hickory Nuts — Level 2. You knew it was safe. the village knew the rest. Together, it's deeper. Parts: nut meat (eat), shells (smoke flavor), bark (tea). Crack carefully."},{"seq":1377,"day":15,"line":"💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back."},{"seq":1378,"day":16,"line":"— DAY 16 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1379,"day":16,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1380,"day":16,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1381,"day":16,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1382,"day":16,"line":"You eat Blackberry (65 kcal)."},{"seq":1383,"day":16,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1384,"day":16,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1385,"day":16,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1386,"day":16,"line":"Eamon hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1387,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Benoit about you. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1388,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Benoit about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1389,"day":16,"line":"Stanley is stitching a tear shut by the door light, squinting at every stitch."},{"seq":1390,"day":16,"line":"Eamon is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in."},{"seq":1391,"day":16,"line":"Ole is feeding the fire one stick at a time, watching the flame take."},{"seq":1392,"day":16,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1393,"day":16,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1394,"day":16,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1395,"day":16,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1396,"day":16,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1397,"day":16,"line":"📋 Eamon — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1398,"day":16,"line":"💧 Eamon returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1399,"day":16,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1400,"day":16,"line":"🚶 Jesse is back with Paolo."},{"seq":1401,"day":16,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1402,"day":16,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1403,"day":16,"line":"The door is quiet. Haven breathes."},{"seq":1404,"day":16,"line":"🛟 Zoe stands up by the fire. \"We take the hit and we answer it — standing here isn't an answer. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1405,"day":16,"line":"\"We can bind the wounds, or go lean, or hunt hard to replace what we lost. Say which — standing here isn't an answer.\""},{"seq":1406,"day":16,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Zoe adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1407,"day":16,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1408,"day":16,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1409,"day":16,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1410,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Nikolai about you. Three retellings in, nobody remembers what actually happened — but everyone has opinions."},{"seq":1411,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Jesse about Benoit. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1412,"day":16,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1413,"day":16,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":1414,"day":16,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":1415,"day":16,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 19× Hickory Nuts, 15× White Oak Acorns, 8× Spicebush (240 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1416,"day":16,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1417,"day":16,"line":"While you were gone — 3 things you missed:"},{"seq":1418,"day":16,"line":"⚔️ Stanley killed the Loud Beast with their party — 4 rounds, 42 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1419,"day":16,"line":"⚔️ Grigory killed the Moderator with their party — 5 rounds, 41 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1420,"day":16,"line":"⚔️ Ole killed the Moderator with their party — 6 rounds, 35 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1421,"day":16,"line":"You keep a day's food (240 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1422,"day":16,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1423,"day":16,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1424,"day":16,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":1425,"day":16,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1426,"day":16,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1427,"day":16,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1428,"day":16,"line":"Paolo will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."},{"seq":1429,"day":16,"line":"You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)"},{"seq":1430,"day":16,"line":"You sow Spicebush: 730 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 60 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)"},{"seq":1431,"day":16,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1432,"day":16,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1433,"day":16,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1434,"day":16,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1435,"day":16,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1436,"day":16,"line":"Stanley leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about The Moderator. Wait — silence is a verb it can't moderate. It mutes the verb you lean on — strike or move, whichever you use more. But silence is a verb the algorithm cannot moderate: WAIT and its attention slides off your habits.\""},{"seq":1437,"day":16,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — The Moderator: Wait — silence is a verb it can't moderate. It mutes the verb you lean on — strike or move, whichever you use more. But silence is a verb the algorithm cannot moderate: WAIT and its attention slides off your habits. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1438,"day":16,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Wait — silence is a verb it can't moderate — It mutes the verb you lean on — strike or move, whichever you use more. But silence is a verb the algorithm cannot moderate: WAIT and its attention slides off your habits."},{"seq":1439,"day":16,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Squirrel Friend (L1). Squirrels sometimes leave you nuts. (Random gifts.)"},{"seq":1440,"day":16,"line":"\"The tiny tree-people like you! They pay rent in acorns!\""},{"seq":1441,"day":16,"line":"\"The REAL power? That comes from UNDERSTANDING. Use it! Learn it! The gamblers are watching!\""},{"seq":1442,"day":16,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1443,"day":16,"line":"You eat Spicebush (180 kcal)."},{"seq":1444,"day":16,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1445,"day":16,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1446,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 4 fish, +960 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1447,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Stanley worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1448,"day":16,"line":"🎣 Eamon worked the creek — 3 fish, +420 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1449,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Benoit about himself. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1450,"day":16,"line":"Paolo heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1451,"day":16,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1452,"day":16,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Grigory has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"The Moderator — I put it down today.\" \"It reviews you. 'Content noted.' A weak ranging chip while it decides.\" \"'REMOVAL NOTICE.' Defiant or compliant — the hammer is coming down.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Nikolai asks \"We've been walking past those.\" Paolo asks \"So it bleeds.\" Some"},{"seq":1453,"day":16,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1454,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Nikolai about Paolo. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1455,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Jesse about Someone. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1456,"day":16,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Grigory telling Stanley about Jesse. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1457,"day":16,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1458,"day":16,"line":"🍲 Ole is hunched over their bowl by the fire, eating like it matters."},{"seq":1459,"day":16,"line":"🍲 Somchai eats with Stanley — bowls side by side, talk low."},{"seq":1460,"day":16,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":1461,"day":16,"line":"A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":1462,"day":16,"line":"The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."},{"seq":1463,"day":16,"line":"The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."},{"seq":1464,"day":16,"line":"Eamon counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"seq":1465,"day":16,"line":"A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""},{"seq":1466,"day":16,"line":"🔇 The birds have gone quiet. Even the crickets. The woods are holding their breath."},{"seq":1467,"day":16,"line":"Something out there knows exactly where you sleep. It isn't howling. That's the worst part — it isn't making a sound at all."},{"seq":1468,"day":16,"line":"Three shapes at the treeline — dog-shaped silences, circling. (A real pack is out there now: 3 of them. No names yet — nobody's lived to argue about one.)"},{"seq":1469,"day":16,"line":"Investigate and the morning is gone — tracking them costs a full day-part. Bar the door and you learn nothing. Your call."},{"seq":1470,"day":16,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":1471,"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1472,"day":16,"line":"Zoe came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1473,"day":16,"line":"Grigory is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 7/100)"},{"seq":1474,"day":16,"line":"Somchai and Zoe lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1475,"day":16,"line":"◈ CRISIS — THE HUNGER WINTER. Three days now the village has gone to sleep hungry. The pantry is an echo. This is the part the old stories skip — the part where you find out what you’re made of."},{"seq":1476,"day":16,"line":"SYSTEM: \"Organic units require fuel. Noting. Noting loudly. The audience is very quiet, which for them is screaming.\""},{"seq":1477,"day":16,"line":"🛟 Zoe looks up from the fire. \"And now hunger, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":1478,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Lamb's Quarters — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1479,"day":16,"line":"💡 Lamb's Quarters: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1480,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Daylily Bud — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1481,"day":16,"line":"💡 Daylily Bud: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1482,"day":16,"line":"🌿 Assacu (Sandbox Tree) — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."},{"seq":1483,"day":16,"line":"💡 Assacu (Sandbox Tree): the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."},{"seq":1484,"day":16,"line":"🤒 Eamon is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1485,"day":16,"line":"🤒 Paolo is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1486,"day":17,"line":"— DAY 17 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1487,"day":17,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Hickory Nuts — handled into knowledge."},{"seq":1488,"day":17,"line":"🔥 “I don’t say this lightly.” Eamon sets their bowl down. “Stanley, your past story isn’t true, is it? I’ve heard enough versions now.” Nobody looks at Stanley. Everybody does."},{"seq":1489,"day":17,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1490,"day":17,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+1 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 23 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1491,"day":17,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1492,"day":17,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1493,"day":17,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1494,"day":17,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1495,"day":17,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1496,"day":17,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 7L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1497,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Benoit telling Ole about himself. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1498,"day":17,"line":"💧 Paolo returns with water: +2 clean."},{"seq":1499,"day":17,"line":"🩹 Grigory is still hurting (7 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1500,"day":17,"line":"👥 Benoit heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""},{"seq":1501,"day":17,"line":"💬 Paolo and Zoe are hunched over the fire together, voices too low to catch."},{"seq":1502,"day":17,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1503,"day":17,"line":"The pacing in the woods fades — whatever was out there has moved on."},{"seq":1504,"day":17,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1505,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1506,"day":17,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 8L left."},{"seq":1507,"day":17,"line":"Stanley hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1508,"day":17,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1509,"day":17,"line":"👥 Zoe heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1510,"day":17,"line":"Somchai heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":1511,"day":17,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1512,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1513,"day":17,"line":"Stanley hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1514,"day":17,"line":"👥 Jesse heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""},{"seq":1515,"day":17,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1516,"day":17,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1517,"day":17,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":1518,"day":17,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1519,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1520,"day":17,"line":"Something big is moving in the woods. The birds went quiet."},{"seq":1521,"day":17,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Somchai about Benoit. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1522,"day":17,"line":"💬 Jesse says: \"Do you think they're watching right now? The... audience? I try not to think about it.\""},{"seq":1523,"day":17,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1524,"day":17,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":1525,"day":17,"line":"Something moves out there — Performance Review."},{"seq":1526,"day":17,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1527,"day":17,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":1528,"day":17,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1529,"day":17,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},