,"line":"The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."},{"seq":1549,"day":17,"line":"Eamon counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"seq":1550,"day":17,"line":"A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""},{"seq":1551,"day":17,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1552,"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1553,"day":17,"line":"Paolo came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)"},{"seq":1554,"day":17,"line":"Nikolai: \"Jewelweed is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\""},{"seq":1555,"day":17,"line":"Benoit: \"Walked past a good stand of daylily bud. Worth remembering where.\""},{"seq":1556,"day":17,"line":"Paolo and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1557,"day":17,"line":"Zoe and Grigory lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1558,"day":17,"line":"Nikolai and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1559,"day":17,"line":"💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper."},{"seq":1560,"day":17,"line":"🤒 Stanley is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1561,"day":17,"line":"🤒 Grigory is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":1562,"day":18,"line":"— DAY 18 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1563,"day":18,"line":"On the carcass nearby, The Loud Beast (carcass) went bad — maggots, smell, the whole sad story. Leaving it had a cost."},{"seq":1564,"day":18,"line":"👀 Eamon pronounced a Denver place-name the way someone reads it off a map for the first time. Nobody from there says it that way."},{"seq":1565,"day":18,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":1566,"day":18,"line":"\"I left bandages where the path bends. Don't thank me. Just live.\""},{"seq":1567,"day":18,"line":"(269 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":1568,"day":18,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1569,"day":18,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":1570,"day":18,"line":"The pantry is in the hall. Your hands are not."},{"seq":1571,"day":18,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1572,"day":18,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1573,"day":18,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1574,"day":18,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1575,"day":18,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1576,"day":18,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight."},{"seq":1577,"day":18,"line":"Back at the haven the argument starts: Stanley is calling it \"Big-Eyes.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want."},{"seq":1578,"day":18,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1579,"day":18,"line":"Zoe heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""},{"seq":1580,"day":18,"line":"💧 Jesse returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1581,"day":18,"line":"Benoit heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":1582,"day":18,"line":"Nikolai sets out to find Benoit. \"Won't be long.\""},{"seq":1583,"day":18,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1584,"day":18,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1585,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1586,"day":18,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1587,"day":18,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1588,"day":18,"line":"Somchai heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1589,"day":18,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1590,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1591,"day":18,"line":"Stanley hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1592,"day":18,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ole telling Jesse about Zoe. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1593,"day":18,"line":"💧 Zoe returns with water: +4 clean."},{"seq":1594,"day":18,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1595,"day":18,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":1596,"day":18,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1597,"day":18,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1598,"day":18,"line":"★ Deeper knowledge: Blackberry. Parts: berries (eat), leaves (tea), roots (medicinal). Pick ripe (black, not red). (Yield +50%). Use unlocked: food: ripe black berries, straight off the cane."},{"seq":1599,"day":18,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":1600,"day":18,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 32× Blackberry (2080 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1601,"day":18,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1602,"day":18,"line":"You keep a day's food (1950 kcal) and unload 130 kcal into Haven's pantry."},{"seq":1603,"day":18,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1604,"day":18,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Performance Review is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1605,"day":18,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1606,"day":18,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":1607,"day":18,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1608,"day":18,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1609,"day":18,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1610,"day":18,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1611,"day":18,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1612,"day":18,"line":"Somchai leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Performance Review. Dodge unpredictably. It grades your dodges aloud — so stop giving it the same dodge twice. Move two rounds running, never the same way, and its lock breaks. Unpredictability is the only passing grade.\""},{"seq":1613,"day":18,"line":"💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Performance Review: Dodge unpredictably. It grades your dodges aloud — so stop giving it the same dodge twice. Move two rounds running, never the same way, and its lock breaks. Unpredictability is the only passing grade. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"},{"seq":1614,"day":18,"line":"📓 Codex: Counter: Dodge unpredictably — It grades your dodges aloud — so stop giving it the same dodge twice. Move two rounds running, never the same way, and its lock breaks. Unpredictability is the only passing grade."},{"seq":1615,"day":18,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1616,"day":18,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Blackberry. Uses: vitamin C, antioxidants. Leaves for diarrhea. High energy. (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: ripe black berries, straight off the cane; medicine: leaf tea settles the stomach; dye: deep purple-black dye from the juice."},{"seq":1617,"day":18,"line":"You eat Blackberry (1430 kcal)."},{"seq":1618,"day":18,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1619,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 6 fish, +1728 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1620,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Stanley worked the creek — 2 fish, +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1621,"day":18,"line":"🎣 Eamon worked the creek — 1 fish, +140 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1622,"day":18,"line":"🍲 Paolo cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1623,"day":18,"line":"🌿 Benoit returns from foraging the wilds: +280 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1624,"day":18,"line":"🚶 Nikolai is back — found Benoit."},{"seq":1625,"day":18,"line":"Jesse is sweeping ash and grit out through the door, steady strokes."},{"seq":1626,"day":18,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+8 integration)"},{"seq":1627,"day":18,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"Teach us? Show us a plant you know COMPLETELY (Codex L3) — 15 candidates in your notes. We will watch very closely. Reward: integration.\""},{"seq":1628,"day":18,"line":"Word reaches you, days late: Paolo stands accused over what happened to Benoit. There's going to be a moot. People are choosing sides."},{"seq":1629,"day":18,"line":"Benoit is back at the fires, and the village doesn't need convincing this time. Paolo answers for what happened to Benoit — again."},{"seq":1630,"day":18,"line":"Benoit calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."},{"seq":1631,"day":18,"line":"The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."},{"seq":1632,"day":18,"line":"📋 SYSTEM QUEST: \"We have studied cooking. Step one: apply heat until food stops being food? No — wait. We had it. Teach us? Show us one cooked meal, start to finish.\""},{"seq":1633,"day":18,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"We have already cleared your morning. You are welcome. We require 300 kcal of tubers and your full attention. The fans love a cooking segment.\""},{"seq":1634,"day":18,"line":"You lay out 325 kcal of tubers and roots, build the fire up, and start. The System watches with the intensity of a trillion eyes."},{"seq":1635,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"Heat applied. Food is now HOT. Hypothesis: hot food is better because it is hot. ...We will allow it.\""},{"seq":1636,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"You stopped BEFORE it stopped being food. Restraint. We did not know restraint was a flavor. Logging it as one.\""},{"seq":1637,"day":18,"line":"📝 SYSTEM NOTE: \"The tubers did not scream. Our models predicted screaming. The models have been updated. You are welcome.\""},{"seq":1638,"day":18,"line":"SYSTEM: Deep integration. You see the world through us now."},{"seq":1639,"day":18,"line":"⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 83. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 6.\""},{"seq":1640,"day":18,"line":"The overlay's tone has changed around you. Warmer. It notices you noticing."},{"seq":1641,"day":18,"line":"◈ THE GRANT — full integration. The System opens the last slot like a door it built just for Teresa. \"You have been adequate entertainment. We upgrade adequate.\" (Ability slots: 6)"},{"seq":1642,"day":18,"line":"◈ FULL INTEGRATION — you don't look AT the System anymore. You look WITH it."},{"seq":1643,"day":18,"line":"🍲 It replicates your stew for the whole haven. It added a garnish of pocket lint. It's still 400 kcal. You eat around the lint. (+400 kcal to the pantry. The System is SO proud.)"},{"seq":1644,"day":18,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":1645,"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1130 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1646,"day":18,"line":"Ole and Jesse are comparing scars like trading cards."},{"seq":1647,"day":18,"line":"🔍 Somchai has been turning over a thorny bush with small round yellow-red fruits for days — today it clicked. \"I know this one now. Look — see the leaves?\""},{"seq":1648,"day":18,"line":"Somchai is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 76/100)"},{"seq":1649,"day":18,"line":"Somchai came back with 636 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":1650,"day":18,"line":"Zoe and Grigory lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1651,"day":19,"line":"— DAY 19 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1652,"day":19,"line":"The fire burns low. 3 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Blackberry — understood at last."},{"seq":1653,"day":19,"line":"👀 Stanley was talking about home — then stopped mid-sentence, recalibrated, and said \"Denver\" just a fraction too deliberately. Whatever home is, it isn't where that sentence started."},{"seq":1654,"day":19,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 344 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1655,"day":19,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1656,"day":19,"line":"You eat Blackberry (195 kcal)."},{"seq":1657,"day":19,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1658,"day":19,"line":"Took Foraged food (dried)."},{"seq":1659,"day":19,"line":"You eat Foraged food (dried) (160 kcal)."},{"seq":1660,"day":19,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1661,"day":19,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1662,"day":19,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1663,"day":19,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1664,"day":19,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1665,"day":19,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1666,"day":19,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1667,"day":19,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1668,"day":19,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1669,"day":19,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1670,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Jesse about Zoe. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":1671,"day":19,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1672,"day":19,"line":"Zoe heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":1673,"day":19,"line":"💧 Somchai returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1674,"day":19,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1675,"day":19,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1676,"day":19,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":1677,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1678,"day":19,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1679,"day":19,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1680,"day":19,"line":"Stanley hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1681,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Ole about Zoe. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":1682,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Ole telling Paolo about Somchai. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1683,"day":19,"line":"Somchai wanders off. \"I want to see what's out there.\""},{"seq":1684,"day":19,"line":"Benoit heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""},{"seq":1685,"day":19,"line":"🩹 Nikolai is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1686,"day":19,"line":"Jesse is tending the fire, coaxing it steady."},{"seq":1687,"day":19,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":1688,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1689,"day":19,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 10L left."},{"seq":1690,"day":19,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1691,"day":19,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1692,"day":19,"line":"Zoe showed Benoit the thorny bush with small round yellow-red fruits — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":1693,"day":19,"line":"🌿 Zoe returns from foraging the wilds: +204 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1694,"day":19,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":1695,"day":19,"line":"🔥 The fire settles. Nikolai has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Performance Review — I put it down today.\" \"A red line draws itself across the ground. 3.2 stars. 'ASSESSMENT IN PROGRESS.' Do not be on the line.\" \"It stamps the air. REJECTED. The word has weight.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Zoe mutters \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Eamon asks \"So i"},{"seq":1696,"day":19,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":1697,"day":19,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1698,"day":19,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":1699,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Somchai about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":1700,"day":19,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":1701,"day":19,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":1702,"day":19,"line":"★ Deeper knowledge: Spicebush. Parts: berries (dry and grind as allspice), twigs and leaves (spicy tea). (Yield +50%). Use unlocked: food: dried ground berries as spice — the wild allspice; tea: spicy twig and leaf tea."},{"seq":1703,"day":19,"line":"A squirrel drops nuts at your feet and vanishes. A gift — hickory nuts, still in the shell. Crack them open. (squirrel_friend)"},{"seq":1704,"day":19,"line":"💪 Your Perception grows — 7. The work is changing you."},{"seq":1705,"day":19,"line":"✨ Trail Eyes — You notice tracks without trying. (tier 1)"},{"seq":1706,"day":19,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 15× Hickory Nuts, 12× White Oak Acorns, 8× Spicebush (240 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":1707,"day":19,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":1708,"day":19,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1709,"day":19,"line":"⚔️ Nikolai killed the Performance Review with their party — 4 rounds, 67 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."},{"seq":1710,"day":19,"line":"You keep a day's food (240 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":1711,"day":19,"line":"3 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":1712,"day":19,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1713,"day":19,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":1714,"day":19,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":1715,"day":19,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":1716,"day":19,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 16 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1717,"day":19,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1718,"day":19,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1719,"day":19,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1720,"day":19,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1721,"day":19,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1722,"day":19,"line":"Paolo hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1723,"day":19,"line":"📋 Grigory — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1724,"day":19,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1725,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 3 fish, +792 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1726,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Stanley worked the creek — 3 fish, +350 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1727,"day":19,"line":"🎣 Eamon worked the creek — 3 fish, +385 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1728,"day":19,"line":"🍲 Grigory cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1729,"day":19,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Grigory about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":1730,"day":19,"line":"💧 Benoit returns with water: +3 clean."},{"seq":1731,"day":19,"line":"They come fast and scared — a family, or what's left of one. \"Please. We heard you take people in.\" Behind them, something worse than weather."},{"seq":1732,"day":19,"line":"It's settled. The village is calling it \"Ugly-Eyes.\" The Codex keeps it."},{"seq":1733,"day":19,"line":"◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"},{"seq":1734,"day":19,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Jujube. Thorny bush, small round fruits. Ripe ones are food. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1735,"day":19,"line":"SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."},{"seq":1736,"day":19,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Somchai taught everyone about Jujube. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":1737,"day":19,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":1738,"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +1300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1739,"day":19,"line":"Somchai is showing everyone Jujube by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":1740,"day":19,"line":"Benoit traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1741,"day":19,"line":"Ole traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":1742,"day":19,"line":"Ole and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1743,"day":19,"line":"Ole and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1744,"day":19,"line":"Jesse and Stanley lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":1745,"day":19,"line":"📓 Codex: Grigory taught Paolo Gossip Network."},{"seq":1746,"day":19,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Grigory is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":1747,"day":19,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":1748,"day":19,"line":"📖 The entry for Grigory is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":1749,"day":19,"line":"GRIGORY — GONE. 1 open question closed unanswered."},{"seq":1750,"day":19,"line":"🛟 Zoe stands up by the fire. \"The sick can't wait us out. Somebody has to say it, so: we need a plan, tonight. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":1751,"day":19,"line":"\"We can nurse them through it, or go lean and ride it out, or send the strong out hunting while the sick rest. Say which.\""},{"seq":1752,"day":19,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Zoe adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":1753,"day":19,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":1754,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Pattern Recognition (Level 2). Deeper understanding of pattern recognition."},{"seq":1755,"day":19,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 2). Trust builds 3x (was 2x)."},{"seq":1756,"day":19,"line":"🌟 JACKPOT: A stranger by the road knows things. They talk for an hour. You learn: Pattern Recognition, Diplomatic Incident. Your Codex overflows."},{"seq":1757,"day":20,"line":"— DAY 20 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":1758,"day":20,"line":"The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: Spicebush — handled into knowledge."},{"seq":1759,"day":20,"line":"👀 Someone mentioned Denver and Stanley answered to it a beat late — like responding to a name that isn't quite yours."},{"seq":1760,"day":20,"line":"💬 Jesse mutters: \"Smile for the sky, they said. I hate how easy it was to start doing it.\""},{"seq":1761,"day":20,"line":"💬 Stanley pulls you aside. \"I need to tell you something. Last night I... dreamed? No. I was AWAKE. And something spoke to me. Not the System — something else. It said: 'Tell the human to watch the northern treeline.' Then it was gone.\""},{"seq":1762,"day":20,"line":"(Stanley has been contacted by something. They don't understand what happened. But they'll warn you when they dream again.)"},{"seq":1763,"day":20,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 246 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":1764,"day":20,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":1765,"day":20,"line":"Deeper knowledge: Spicebush. Uses: vitamin C in berries, flavoring, morale. Berries dry well. (+5 health when eaten). All uses known: food: dried ground berries as spice — the wild allspice; tea: spicy twig and leaf tea; medicine: berry tea, traditional cold remedy."},{"seq":1766,"day":20,"line":"You eat Spicebush (240 kcal)."},{"seq":1767,"day":20,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":1768,"day":20,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1769,"day":20,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1770,"day":20,"line":"Took Canned soup."},{"seq":1771,"day":20,"line":"You eat Canned soup (250 kcal)."},{"seq":1772,"day":20,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1773,"day":20,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1774,"day":20,"line":"📺 The audience has a favorite, and it's you. The chant doesn't have words. It doesn't need them."},{"seq":1775,"day":20,"line":"✅ The System watched the whole lesson twice. \"NOTED. Filing under: things that are food, which is still a confusing category.\" (+6 integration)"},{"seq":1776,"day":20,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1777,"day":20,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1778,"day":20,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 9L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1779,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Benoit about Jesse. The truth left this story two fires ago. What's left is better theater."},{"seq":1780,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Eamon telling Somchai about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":1781,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (20 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1782,"day":20,"line":"Zoe heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\""},{"seq":1783,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1784,"day":20,"line":"🩹 Nikolai is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1785,"day":20,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1786,"day":20,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1787,"day":20,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1788,"day":20,"line":"📋 Stanley — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1789,"day":20,"line":"💧 Stanley returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1790,"day":20,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Stanley telling Ole about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind."},{"seq":1791,"day":20,"line":"Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was