ere."},{"seq":1812,"day":20,"line":"While you were gone — one thing you missed:"},{"seq":1813,"day":20,"line":"🩸 The Hushpuppy mauled Zoe (-72 health) over 3 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing."},{"seq":1814,"day":20,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 17 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":1815,"day":20,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":1816,"day":20,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":1817,"day":20,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1818,"day":20,"line":"📋 Stanley — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1819,"day":20,"line":"📋 Eamon — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1820,"day":20,"line":"Paolo hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1821,"day":20,"line":"Ole hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1822,"day":20,"line":"Zoe hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1823,"day":20,"line":"📋 Somchai — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1824,"day":20,"line":"💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −3 trauma)"},{"seq":1825,"day":20,"line":"Recipe: Crude bow (Level 1). You have seen a crude bow. A bent branch and a cord — simple enough to copy, hard enough to shoot."},{"seq":1826,"day":20,"line":"Taken: Crude bow x1, Apology padding x1, The Ledger x1, Consensus Crown x1."},{"seq":1827,"day":20,"line":"You take crude bow, apology padding, the ledger, consensus crown from Grigory. Your hands know what they did. (+11 trauma)"},{"seq":1828,"day":20,"line":"The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking."},{"seq":1829,"day":20,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":1830,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 4 fish, +936 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1831,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Stanley worked the creek — 2 fish, +245 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1832,"day":20,"line":"🎣 Eamon worked the creek — 2 fish, +245 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1833,"day":20,"line":"🍲 Somchai cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":1834,"day":20,"line":"🧭 Somchai is back from the north. \"It's... different out there. I'll tell you about it.\" (Ask them what they saw.)"},{"seq":1835,"day":20,"line":"A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":1836,"day":20,"line":"Paolo doesn't wait to be called this time. The fire gets built, they step into the circle — the third time answering for what happened to Benoit."},{"seq":1837,"day":20,"line":"Benoit calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."},{"seq":1838,"day":20,"line":"The moot turns to you. Your vote matters here — and everyone will remember it."},{"seq":1839,"day":20,"line":"The moot doesn't wait forever. Two days of silence from the fire's edge — the count is taken without you."},{"seq":1840,"day":20,"line":"The fire is built high. Nobody speaks while the count is taken — you can hear the wind past the edge of the light."},{"seq":1841,"day":20,"line":"Eamon counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"seq":1842,"day":20,"line":"A long exhale moves around the fire like weather. \"Not guilty — this time.\""},{"seq":1843,"day":20,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":1844,"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":1845,"day":20,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: Cashew. Juicy apple on top, weird nut hanging below. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":1846,"day":20,"line":"SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost."},{"seq":1847,"day":20,"line":"Zoe was watching. Now they know Cashew too