d."},{"seq":1865,"day":21,"line":"You eat Foraged food (200 kcal)."},{"seq":1866,"day":21,"line":"Took Foraged food."},{"seq":1867,"day":21,"line":"You eat Foraged food (200 kcal)."},{"seq":1868,"day":21,"line":"Took Foraged food."},{"seq":1869,"day":21,"line":"You eat Foraged food (200 kcal)."},{"seq":1870,"day":21,"line":"Took Foraged food."},{"seq":1871,"day":21,"line":"You eat Foraged food (200 kcal)."},{"seq":1872,"day":21,"line":"Took Foraged food."},{"seq":1873,"day":21,"line":"You eat Foraged food (200 kcal)."},{"seq":1874,"day":21,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":1875,"day":21,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":1876,"day":21,"line":"📋 Eamon — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":1877,"day":21,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":1878,"day":21,"line":"💧 Eamon returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":1879,"day":21,"line":"Somchai showed Jesse the broad leaves standing tall above still water on stiff stalks — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."},{"seq":1880,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (12 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1881,"day":21,"line":"🌿 Zoe returns from foraging the wilds: +468 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":1882,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1883,"day":21,"line":"🩹 Nikolai is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":1884,"day":21,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":1885,"day":21,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":1886,"day":21,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":1887,"day":21,"line":"Eamon hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":1888,"day":21,"line":"🌿 Benoit returns from foraging the wilds: +590 kcal t