2,"line":"Accepted. a quiet teacher is walking. They'll reach Haven in a few days — membership starts when they arrive, but the village already counts them."},{"seq":2020,"day":22,"line":"◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"The audience wants an encore. A trial, then — smaller this time, but televised.\" Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson."},{"seq":2021,"day":22,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2022,"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +1419 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2023,"day":22,"line":"Somchai is showing everyone Lotus Root by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The Codex grows — the human way."},{"seq":2024,"day":22,"line":"Nikolai came back with 400 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2025,"day":22,"line":"Somchai and Ole lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2026,"day":23,"line":"— DAY 23 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2027,"day":23,"line":"Overnight, Blackberry went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":2028,"day":23,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":2029,"day":23,"line":"💬 Nikolai says: \"Dreamed again. They showed me teeth. Lots of teeth. Be ready to fight soon.\""},{"seq":2030,"day":23,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 210 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2031,"day":23,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2032,"day":23,"line":"You eat Spicebush (570 kcal)."},{"seq":2033,"day":23,"line":"Your chewing echoes off the trees. Something out there heard. (encounters more likely tomorrow)"},{"seq":2034,"day":23,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2035,"day":23,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2036,"day":23,"line":"📋 Ole — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2037,"day":23,"line":"Equipped Fire-hardened spear (ranged)."},{"seq":2038,"day":23,"line":"Unequipped Kitchen knife."},{"seq":2039,"day":23,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2040,"day":23,"line":"💧 Ole returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2041,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (58 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2042,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Ole is still hurting (12 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2043,"day":23,"line":"Somchai heads out to forage. \"Bringing dinner back. One way or another.\""},{"seq":2044,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2045,"day":23,"line":"🩹 Nikolai is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2046,"day":23,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2047,"day":23,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2048,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2049,"day":23,"line":"Ole hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"seq":2050,"day":23,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2051,"day":23,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2052,"day":23,"line":"📋 Ole — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2053,"day":23,"line":"💧 Ole returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2054,"day":23,"line":"🌿 Somchai returns from foraging the wilds: +423 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2055,"day":23,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2056,"day":23,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":2057