🎣 Paolo worked the creek — 4 fish, +650 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2159,"day":24,"line":"🎣 Ole worked the creek — 4 fish, +700 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2160,"day":24,"line":"The village debates Desmond Clarke. The room is cold — Somchai, Jesse, Nikolai against. \"More mouths, same fire.\" (38% for.)"},{"seq":2161,"day":24,"line":"🚶 a quiet teacher walks in — pack light, eyes wide. Haven grows by one. (7 souls.)"},{"seq":2162,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: a quiet teacher arrived and joined."},{"seq":2163,"day":24,"line":"Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade."},{"seq":2164,"day":24,"line":"📺 SYSTEM CHALLENGE: \"We have designed a trial JUST for you. Based on our observations. Which are extensive. And flattering.\""},{"seq":2165,"day":24,"line":"It lists your recent deeds back at you — the good ones, mostly, with the embarrassing ones edited into heroics. It has been WATCHING. (Flattering.)"},{"seq":2166,"day":24,"line":"  1. Trial of Stone — Endure. That is the whole trial. Endure."},{"seq":2167,"day":24,"line":"  2. Trial of Tongues — Talk the village through something hard."},{"seq":2168,"day":24,"line":"  3. Trial of the First Ember — Make fire the old way, from nothing."},{"seq":2169,"day":24,"line":"Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets."},{"seq":2170,"day":24,"line":"★ IDENTIFIED: European Elder. Elder. Big shrub; flat white flower plates in June, drooping black berry clusters in late summer. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn."},{"seq":2171,"day":24,"line":"SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."},{"seq":2172,"day":24,"line":"📚 Village knowledge: Zoe taught everyone about European Elder. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger."},{"seq":2173,"day":24,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2174,"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +1367 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2175,"day":24,"line":"Quoc traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2176,"day":24,"line":"Quoc and Nikolai lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2177,"day":24,"line":"📓 Codex: Paolo taught Quoc Old World Caches."},{"seq":2178,"day":25,"line":"📡 The System, casual as a knife: \"So. The pods. We could... discuss them. A favor for a peek? A peek for a promise? We LOVE a bargain. The audience LOVES a bargain. What's a little debt between friends?\""},{"seq":2179,"day":25,"line":"(Bargain — owe the System a favor — or don't.)"},{"seq":2180,"day":25,"line":"— DAY 25 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2181,"day":25,"line":"The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: European Elder — named and noted."},{"seq":2182,"day":25,"line":"Hunger is doing its slow work on everyone. The lines get thinner every hungry day."},{"seq":2183,"day":25,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 221 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2184,"day":25,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2185,"day":25,"line":"You eat Blackberry (845 kcal)."},{"seq":2186,"day":25,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2187,"day":25,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2188,"day":25,"line":"📋 Ole — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2189,"day":25,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2190,"day":25,"line":"💧 Ole returns with 14L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2191,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (58 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2192,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2193,"day":25,"line":"🩹 Nikolai is still hurting (23 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2194,"day":25,"line":"💬 Quoc has been asking Paolo about Green Whisper — what it does, what it goes with. Planning something."},{"seq":2195,"day":25,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2196,"day":25,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2197,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2198,"day":25,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2199,"day":25,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2200,"day":25,"line":"Somchai is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in."},{"seq":2201,"day":25,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2202,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2203,"day":25,"line":"Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 18L left."},{"seq":2204,"day":25,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2205,"day":25,"line":"Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it."},{"seq":2206,"day":25,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2207,"day":25,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2208,"day":25,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2209,"day":25,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":2210,"day":25,"line":"Your pack is full. Eat something, test a lump from your pack, or leave some for the woods."},{"seq":2211,"day":25,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":2212,"day":25,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2213,"day":25,"line":"You keep a day's food (715 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2214,"day":25,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2215,"day":25,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2216,"day":25,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2217,"day":25,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2218,"day":25,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2219,"day":25,"line":"📋 Ole — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2220,"day":25,"line":"📋 Somchai — 🍲 Cook. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2221,"day":25,"line":"💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −2 trauma)"},{"seq":2222,"day":25,"line":"Taken: Rain Shell x1, Dice set x1."},{"seq":2223,"day":25,"line":"You take rain shell, dice set from Zoe. Your hands know what they did. (+6 trauma)"},{"seq":2224,"day":25,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1."},{"seq":2225,"day":25,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2226,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 4 fish, +1080 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2227,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Paolo worked the creek — 3 fish, +450 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2228,"day":25,"line":"🎣 Ole worked the creek — 4 fish, +700 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2229,"day":25,"line":"🍲 Somchai cooked for the haven — meals stretched."},{"seq":2230,"day":25,"line":"Teresa showed Nikolai the European Elder — \"remember it.\" Word gets around."},{"seq":2231,"day":25,"line":"🚶 Sam Wilson walks in — pack light, eyes wide. Haven grows by one. (8 souls.)"},{"seq":2232,"day":25,"line":"🗣️ Sam to Jesse, by the fire: \"23 wood. We need 350. The forest isn't going to cut itself.\""},{"seq":2233,"day":25,"line":"A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."},{"seq":2234,"day":25,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"You took too long choosing. We chose. You're welcome. It was the most flattering one.\""},{"seq":2235,"day":25,"line":"📺 TRIAL ACCEPTED: Trial of Stone. \"Excellent choice. We simulated all three. This one had the best lighting.\""},{"seq":2236,"day":25,"line":"(A day-part, gone to the trial. −250 kcal. Your hands are shaking. The fans loved it.)"},{"seq":2237,"day":25,"line":"🪨 TRIUMPH: cold water, hard ground, a whole day of it — and you do not bend. The System watches you not-bend with something like awe. \"NOTE: the human did not stop. We do not understand. We are taking notes anyway.\""},{"seq":2238,"day":25,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2239,"day":25,"line":"💛 The Hoodie has become something you can reach for. (Keepsake L2 — new combat action: Steady. Hold it and breathe: clear fear and stun on yourself. Once per fight.)"},{"seq":2240,"day":25,"line":"💛 The Carpenter's square has become something you can reach for. (Keepsake L2 — new combat action: Steady. Hold it and breathe: clear fear and stun on yourself. Once per fight.)"},{"seq":2241,"day":25,"line":"💛 The Unnamed photograph has become something you can reach for. (Keepsake L2 — new combat action: Steady. Hold it and breathe: clear fear and stun on yourself. Once per fight.)"},{"seq":2242,"day":25,"line":"💛 The Dispatcher's headset has become something you can reach for. (Keepsake L2 — new combat action: Steady. Hold it and breathe: clear fear and stun on yourself. Once per fight.)"},{"seq":2243,"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2244,"day":25,"line":"Somchai came back with 398 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2245,"day":25,"line":"Somchai and Ole lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2246,"day":25,"line":"Somchai and Ole lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2247,"day":25,"line":"Nikolai and Jesse lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2248,"day":25,"line":"Sam and Quoc lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2249,"day":25,"line":"📓 Codex: Paolo taught Somchai Old World Caches."},{"seq":2250,"day":25,"line":"🤒 Nikolai is feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse."},{"seq":2251,"day":25,"line":"🛟 Quoc stands up by the fire. \"People are going down and the tents are filling — we do something or we don't, but we decide. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""},{"seq":2252,"day":25,"line":"\"The sick need tending — triage tents, broth, boiled water. Or we tighten our belts and wait it out. Or the hale hunt while the sick lie still.\""},{"seq":2253,"day":25,"line":"\"Or we rally,\" Quoc adds. \"Second shift, everybody. We work, we eat, we live — and we pay for it.\""},{"seq":2254,"day":25,"line":"(Relief is open — triage, rations, hunt, or rally, from the beats row. Each option works once; the moment passes in ~3 days.)"},{"seq":2255,"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"seq":2256,"day":26,"line":"— DAY 26 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2257,"day":26,"line":"Overnight, Blackberry went bad — beyond saving. You leave it for the flies."},{"seq":2258,"day":26,"line":"Fresh food keeps days, not weeks. Smoke it over a fire to make it last."},{"seq":2259,"day":26,"line":"🎁 You find a small bundle tucked where you'll find it. No one saw it left there."},{"seq":2260,"day":26,"line":"\"They're sending Vex after you tomorrow. He's bored. Be somewhere else.\""},{"seq":2261,"day":26,"line":"(438 kcal of dried meat and clean water. Nothing traceable.)"},{"seq":2262,"day":26,"line":"💬 Quoc whispers: \"Mara swears she met a stranger who knew things. Things no one should know. I told her she's tired.\""},{"seq":2263,"day":26,"line":"Another hungry dawn. People move a half-step slower, like the air got thicker overnight."},{"seq":2264,"day":26,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":2265,"day":26,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":2266,"day":26,"line":"Took Fish catch."},{"seq":2267,"day":26,"line":"You eat Fish catch (500 kcal)."},{"seq":2268,"day":26,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2269,"day":26,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2270,"day":26,"line":"📋 Ole — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2271,"day":26,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2272,"day":26,"line":"💧 Ole returns with 13L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2273,"day":26,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Sam about Somchai. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do."},{"seq":2274,"day":26,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (58 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2275,"day":26,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (67 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2276,"day":26,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2277,"day":26,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2278,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2279,"day":26,"line":"📋 Ole — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2280,"day":26,"line":"💧 Ole returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2281,"day":26,"line":"Teresa showed Sam the European Elder — \"remember it.\" The haven hears about it by supper."},{"seq":2282,"day":26,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2283,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2284,"day":26,"line":"Sam heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\""},{"seq":2285,"day":26,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2286,"day":26,"line":"No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to."},{"seq":2287,"day":26,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2288,"day":26,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2289,"day":26,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2290,"day":26,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":2291,"day":26,"line":"A sturdy stick (crafting material)."},{"seq":2292,"day":26,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 16× Hickory Nuts, 16× White Oak Acorns, 12× Spicebush (360 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2293,"day":26,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2294,"day":26,"line":"You keep a day's food (360 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2295,"day":26,"line":"2 unprocessed hauls onto the counter — the clock is ticking."},{"seq":2296,"day":26,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over White Oak Acorns. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2297,"day":26,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. White Oak Acorns. You remember.\""},{"seq":2298,"day":26,"line":"You lay out the haul. Jesse leans over Hickory Nuts. \"Oh — THAT one. Here, look.\""},{"seq":2299,"day":26,"line":"📖 Jesse starts in on the lesson, then catches themself. \"Hold on — I already showed you this one. Hickory Nuts. You remember.\""},{"seq":2300,"day":26,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2301,"day":26,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2302,"day":26,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2303,"day":26,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2304,"day":26,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2305,"day":26,"line":"📋 Ole — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2306,"day":26,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1."},{"seq":2307,"day":26,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2308,"day":26,"line":"You eat Spicebush (360 kcal)."},{"seq":2309,"day":26,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2310,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 4 fish, +1152 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2311,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Paolo worked the creek — 4 fish, +800 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2312,"day":26,"line":"🎣 Ole worked the creek — 3 fish, +600 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2313,"day":26,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Nikolai about Sam. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":2314,"day":26,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Somchai about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2315,"day":26,"line":"The System's messages have gotten careful around you. It chooses its words the way you choose footing on ice."},{"seq":2316,"day":26,"line":"The trial window closed. The audience makes a disappointed sound, like wind."},{"seq":2317,"day":26,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."},{"seq":2318,"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1052 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2319,"day":26,"line":"Sam came back with 640 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."},{"seq":2320,"day":26,"line":"Nikolai and Paolo lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2321,"day":26,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Ole is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2322,"day":26,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2323,"day":26,"line":"📖 The entry for Ole is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2324,"day":26,"line":"💀 Ole starved. Slowly. Nobody eats much tonight. The pot stays full and nobody touches it."},{"seq":2325,"day":26,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 1 of hunger."},{"seq":2326,"day":26,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"seq":2327,"day":27,"line":"— DAY 27 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2328,"day":27,"line":"💬 Nikolai says: \"Dreamed again. They showed me teeth. Lots of teeth. Be ready to fight soon.\""},{"seq":2329,"day":27,"line":"🛟 Quoc looks up from the fire. \"And now hunger, on top of it all. The options stand — pick, before we lose the chance.\""},{"seq":2330,"day":27,"line":"Another hungry dawn. People move a half-step slower, like the air got thicker overnight."},{"seq":2331,"day":27,"line":"Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."},{"seq":2332,"day":27,"line":"Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 353 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)"},{"seq":2333,"day":27,"line":"You are full enough."},{"seq":2334,"day":27,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2335,"day":27,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2336,"day":27,"line":"📋 Somchai — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2337,"day":27,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2338,"day":27,"line":"📓 Codex: you've heard of Lucky Rock. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."},{"seq":2339,"day":27,"line":"◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Paolo — Field 1. Three offers; they took Lucky Rock. Earned, chosen. (lucky_rock: villager level-up)"},{"seq":2340,"day":27,"line":"📓 Codex: Paolo chose Lucky Rock (lucky_rock) at Field 1."},{"seq":2341,"day":27,"line":"💧 Somchai returns with 8L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2342,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (54 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2343,"day":27,"line":"Quoc heads out to forage. \"Gone looking. Don't wait up.\""},{"seq":2344,"day":27,"line":"🌿 Sam returns from foraging the wilds: +360 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2345,"day":27,"line":"Jesse is patching a seam with a scrap of cloth, knot after careful knot."},{"seq":2346,"day":27,"line":"Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."},{"seq":2347,"day":27,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2348,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2349,"day":27,"line":"Took Foraged food."},{"seq":2350,"day":27,"line":"You eat Foraged food (360 kcal)."},{"seq":2351,"day":27,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2352,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2353,"day":27,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (63 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2354,"day":27,"line":"🌿 Quoc returns from foraging the wilds: +558 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2355,"day":27,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2356,"day":27,"line":"The fire burns lower than it should. Nobody wants to be the one to go for wood in the dark."},{"seq":2357,"day":27,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2358,"day":27,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2359,"day":27,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":2360,"day":27,"line":"You also take some vine (crafting material)."},{"seq":2361,"day":27,"line":"You work the patch with practiced hands: 32× Blackberry (2080 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days."},{"seq":2362,"day":27,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2363,"day":27,"line":"You keep a day's food (1950 kcal) and unload 130 kcal into Haven's pantry."},{"seq":2364,"day":27,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2365,"day":27,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2366,"day":27,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2367,"day":27,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2368,"day":27,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2369,"day":27,"line":"📋 Somchai — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2370,"day":27,"line":"...and then it lands: Quoc speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."},{"seq":2371,"day":27,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Canvas Pants x1, Binoculars x1."},{"seq":2372,"day":27,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Rain Shell x1, Crude bow x1, Seedkeeper's Grimoire x1."},{"seq":2373,"day":27,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2374,"day":27,"line":"You eat Blackberry (910 kcal)."},{"seq":2375,"day":27,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2376,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 3 fish, +792 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2377,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Paolo worked the creek — 2 fish, +300 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2378,"day":27,"line":"🎣 Somchai worked the creek — 2 fish, +210 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2379,"day":27,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Paolo about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2380,"day":27,"line":"🌩️ The sky to the west has gone the color of a bruise. Sam is already tying things down — rope, tarps, the chicken situation. \"Sky like that,\" Sam says, \"you don't argue with it.\""},{"seq":2381,"day":27,"line":"📺 SYSTEM: \"We have filed a request for the sky to be less bruised. It is pending. The sky has not responded.\""},{"seq":2382,"day":27,"line":"A storm is coming, and it does not care about your plans. Be at Haven by dusk — sheltering costs the dusk foraging window (400–800 kcal you'll never see). Getting caught out costs more."},{"seq":2383,"day":27,"line":"⚠ WARNING: reserves critical. Eat tomorrow or the spiral begins."},{"seq":2384,"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1490 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2385,"day":27,"line":"Somchai set out an extra bowl before catching themself. Nobody mentioned it."},{"seq":2386,"day":27,"line":"Quoc is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 72/100)"},{"seq":2387,"day":27,"line":"Nikolai and Somchai lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2388,"day":27,"line":"Quoc and Somchai lingered over the fire together."},{"seq":2389,"day":27,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 2 of hunger."},{"seq":2390,"day":28,"line":"The moment passed. Nobody mentions the pods today. A few people notice that nobody mentions them."},{"seq":2391,"day":28,"line":"— DAY 28 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."},{"seq":2392,"day":28,"line":"Hunger is doing its slow work on everyone. The lines get thinner every hungry day."},{"seq":2393,"day":28,"line":"You wake with a start — something is wrong."},{"seq":2394,"day":28,"line":"You chew the bitter leaves. Folk say it helps — you wouldn't know. (+2 health, maybe)"},{"seq":2395,"day":28,"line":"You eat Blackberry (975 kcal)."},{"seq":2396,"day":28,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2397,"day":28,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2398,"day":28,"line":"📋 Somchai — 💧 Fetch water. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2399,"day":28,"line":"🌱 Paolo works the garden — watered, weeded, turned. Nothing ripe yet."},{"seq":2400,"day":28,"line":"💧 Somchai returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."},{"seq":2401,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Paolo about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2402,"day":28,"line":"💬 Somchai says: \"Do you ever feel it? Like the air leans in when something happens.\""},{"seq":2403,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Paolo is still hurting (50 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2404,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Jesse is still hurting (59 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2405,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Quoc is still hurting (68 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2406,"day":28,"line":"Sam heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\""},{"seq":2407,"day":28,"line":"— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."},{"seq":2408,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2409,"day":28,"line":"No risky water to boil."},{"seq":2410,"day":28,"line":"Drank clean water."},{"seq":2411,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Paolo about you. The story's getting bigger than what happened."},{"seq":2412,"day":28,"line":"🩹 Somchai is still hurting (68 HP) — no healer at haven. They rest today instead of ranging out."},{"seq":2413,"day":28,"line":"🌧️ The storm rolls over Haven like a held breath let go — rain hammering the tarps, the wind testing every knot Sam tied. Inside, it's almost cozy. Almost."},{"seq":2414,"day":28,"line":"You set out every pot and skin — the storm fills them. (+1 clean water — your pack couldn't hold it all. The storm provides, the old-timers say, whether you ask or not.)"},{"seq":2415,"day":28,"line":"The dusk forage goes un-walked: 400–800 kcal you'll never see, out there getting rained on instead of gathered. Sam nods at the bruised sky, satisfied: \"Worth it.\""},{"seq":2416,"day":28,"line":"— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen."},{"seq":2417,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2418,"day":28,"line":"\"Don't suppose you've got food,\" Quoc says, trying for casual and missing."},{"seq":2419,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Quoc about you. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half."},{"seq":2420,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Paolo telling Sam about you. It's picking up decorations as it travels."},{"seq":2421,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Nikolai about you. The retelling is already better than the event."},{"seq":2422,"day":28,"line":"— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark."},{"seq":2423,"day":28,"line":"Night settles. The fire is the whole world now. No watches posted. The dark feels bigger than it should."},{"seq":2424,"day":28,"line":"The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't."},{"seq":2425,"day":28,"line":"You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."},{"seq":2426,"day":28,"line":"Travel 1 tile to grove."},{"seq":2427,"day":28,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2428,"day":28,"line":"Travel 2 tiles to trail edge."},{"seq":2429,"day":28,"line":"Something moves out there — Ugly-Eyes."},{"seq":2430,"day":28,"line":"This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again."},{"seq":2431,"day":28,"line":"The creek runs fast here — no crossing without a bridge or a swim."},{"seq":2432,"day":28,"line":"Travel 1 tile to Haven."},{"seq":2433,"day":28,"line":"You keep a day's food (65 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time."},{"seq":2434,"day":28,"line":"You walk back into Haven. 20 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you."},{"seq":2435,"day":28,"line":"You coax 4 growing beds forward by 12 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic."},{"seq":2436,"day":28,"line":"(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)"},{"seq":2437,"day":28,"line":"📋 Jesse — 🎣 Fish. Jesse nods eagerly. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2438,"day":28,"line":"📋 Paolo — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2439,"day":28,"line":"📋 Somchai — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."},{"seq":2440,"day":28,"line":"Taken: Canvas Pants x1."},{"seq":2441,"day":28,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crowbar x1, Binoculars x1."},{"seq":2442,"day":28,"line":"💛 The Hoodie against your chest. It still hurts — a little less. (resolve: −2 trauma)"},{"seq":2443,"day":28,"line":"Taken: Rain Shell x1."},{"seq":2444,"day":28,"line":"You take rain shell from Ole. Your hands know what they did. (+9 trauma)"},{"seq":2445,"day":28,"line":"Too heavy for the rest — left where it lies: Crude bow x1, Seedkeeper's Grimoire x1."},{"seq":2446,"day":28,"line":"You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you."},{"seq":2447,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Jesse worked the creek — 3 fish, +792 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2448,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Paolo worked the creek — 2 fish, +350 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2449,"day":28,"line":"🎣 Somchai worked the creek — 4 fish, +650 kcal to the pantry."},{"seq":2450,"day":28,"line":"You catch fragments by the fire — Somchai telling Nikolai about you. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning."},{"seq":2451,"day":28,"line":"⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."},{"seq":2452,"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1292 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"seq":2453,"day":28,"line":"The fire is quiet today. Nobody's talking much."},{"seq":2454,"day":28,"line":"Quoc is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 42/100)"},{"seq":2455,"day":28,"line":"🔍 Somchai crouches over a giant herb with huge paddle leaves and hanging hands of curved yellow-green fruit, studying it a moment before moving on. (2/3 looks)"},{"seq":2456,"day":28,"line":"Somchai traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs."},{"seq":2457,"day":28,"line":"⚠ Haven's pantry is empty. Day 3 of hunger."},{"seq":2458,"day":28,"line":"Haven couldn't hold. On the third hungry day, people started walking — in different directions. The scattering, again."},{"seq":2459,"day":28,"line":"📓 Codex: Paolo taught Quoc Tireless Stride."},{"seq":2460,"day":28,"line":"🌿 Jewelweed, weeks in the baskets. Handling it day after day, the village has learned what it's FOR — not just what it is. The village knows its uses now."},{"seq":2461,"day":28,"line":"💡 Jewelweed: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/2) and it'll click."},{"seq":2462,"day":28,"line":"📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nikolai is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."},{"seq":2463,"day":28,"line":"Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."},{"seq":2464,"day":28,"line":"📖 The entry for Nikolai is finished. No more pages."},{"seq":2465,"day":28,"line":"The land is getting tired. The easy food is thinning."}]}
